msgid_plural "fast draw holsters"
msgstr[0] "fast draw holster"
msgstr[1] "fast draw holsters"

#. ~ Description for fast draw holster
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A comfortable quick draw holster for small guns.  Activate to holster/draw a"
" gun."
msgstr "A comfortable quick draw holster for small guns.  Activate to holster/draw a gun."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "survivor harness"
msgid_plural "survivor harnesses"
msgstr[0] "survivor harness"
msgstr[1] "survivor harnesses"

#. ~ Description for survivor harness
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A custom-built light harness covered with pouches and including an integral "
"tactical sling for a small rifle or other such weapon.  Durable and "
"carefully crafted to be comfortable to wear.  Activate to holster/draw your "
"weapon."
msgstr "A custom-built light harness covered with pouches and including an integral tactical sling for a small rifle or other such weapon.  Durable and carefully crafted to be comfortable to wear.  Activate to holster/draw your weapon."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "XL holster"
msgid_plural "XL holsters"
msgstr[0] "XL holster"
msgstr[1] "XL holsters"

#. ~ Description for XL holster
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A belt holster consisting of a loop and strap intended for use with larger "
"firearms.  Slightly more cumbersome than a standard holster due to the "
"straps that hold it flat against your leg, Activate to holster/draw a gun."
msgstr "A belt holster consisting of a loop and strap intended for use with larger firearms.  Slightly more cumbersome than a standard holster due to the straps that hold it flat against your leg, Activate to holster/draw a gun."

#. ~ Description for pistol bandolier
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An embroidered leather bandolier for keeping revolver and pistol cartridges "
"close to hand.  If this doesn't make you feel like a cowboy, nothing will."
msgstr "An embroidered leather bandolier for keeping revolver and pistol cartridges close to hand.  If this doesn't make you feel like a cowboy, nothing will."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "Corinthian helm"
msgid_plural "Corinthian helms"
msgstr[0] "Corinthian helm"
msgstr[1] "Corinthian helms"

#. ~ Description for Corinthian helm
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An ancient Greek bronze helmet that provides excellent protection for the "
"head, with slits for the eyes and mouth."
msgstr "An ancient Greek bronze helmet that provides excellent protection for the head, with slits for the eyes and mouth."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "galea"
msgid_plural "galeae"
msgstr[0] "galea"
msgstr[1] "galeae"

#. ~ Description for galea
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An Imperial Roman helmet, with distinct projections protecting the sides of "
"the head."
msgstr "An Imperial Roman helmet, with distinct projections protecting the sides of the head."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "nasal helm"
msgid_plural "nasal helms"
msgstr[0] "nasal helm"
msgstr[1] "nasal helms"

#. ~ Description for nasal helm
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An early medieval helmet with a projection guarding the nose, to better "
"protect the face without obstructing vision.  Proper viking gear, unlike the"
" stereotypical horned helm."
msgstr "An early medieval helmet with a projection guarding the nose, to better protect the face without obstructing vision.  Proper viking gear, unlike the stereotypical horned helm."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "conical helm"
msgid_plural "conical helms"
msgstr[0] "conical helm"
msgstr[1] "conical helms"

#. ~ Description for conical helm
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A conical iron helm with additional protection for the neck, associated with"
" the Mongol Empire."
msgstr "A conical iron helm with additional protection for the neck, associated with the Mongol Empire."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "bell cuirass"
msgid_plural "bell cuirasses"
msgstr[0] "bell cuirass"
msgstr[1] "bell cuirasses"

#. ~ Description for bell cuirass
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "An ancient Greek breastplate, made of bronze."
msgstr "An ancient Greek breastplate, made of bronze."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "lorica segmentata"
msgid_plural "lorica segmentata"
msgstr[0] "lorica segmentata"
msgstr[1] "lorica segmentata"

#. ~ Description for lorica segmentata
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An ancient Roman laminar armor, made of overlapping metal strips connected "
"to internal leather straps."
msgstr "An ancient Roman laminar armor, made of overlapping metal strips connected to internal leather straps."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "chainmail hauberk"
msgid_plural "chainmail hauberks"
msgstr[0] "chainmail hauberk"
msgstr[1] "chainmail hauberks"

#. ~ Description for chainmail hauberk
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A fully customized chainmail outfit, leaving the head uncovered.  The shirt,"
" arms, and leggings have been modified with leather straps to deal with "
"uneven weight distribution and to allow them to be used separately."
msgstr "A fully customized chainmail outfit, leaving the head uncovered.  The shirt, arms, and leggings have been modified with leather straps to deal with uneven weight distribution and to allow them to be used separately."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "pair of bronze greaves"
msgid_plural "pairs of bronze greaves"
msgstr[0] "pair of bronze greaves"
msgstr[1] "pairs of bronze greaves"

#. ~ Description for pair of bronze greaves
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "A pair of bronze leg guards with a simple leather lining."
msgstr "A pair of bronze leg guards with a simple leather lining."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "lamellar armor"
msgid_plural "lamellar armors"
msgstr[0] "lamellar armor"
msgstr[1] "lamellar armors"

#. ~ Description for lamellar armor
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A suit of armor made of multiple pieces of tough leather, laced together for"
" durable yet flexible protection."
msgstr "A suit of armor made of multiple pieces of tough leather, laced together for durable yet flexible protection."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "wooden shield"
msgid_plural "wooden shields"
msgstr[0] "wooden shield"
msgstr[1] "wooden shields"

#. ~ Description for wooden shield
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A crude wooden shield, lacking any metal or leather reinforcement.  "
"Lightweight but not very tough."
msgstr "A crude wooden shield, lacking any metal or leather reinforcement.  Lightweight but not very tough."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "large wooden shield"
msgid_plural "large wooden shields"
msgstr[0] "large wooden shield"
msgstr[1] "large wooden shields"

#. ~ Description for large wooden shield
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An ancient style of wooden shield, lacking any metal or leather "
"reinforcement.  Bulky, but offers a decent amount of protection."
msgstr "An ancient style of wooden shield, lacking any metal or leather reinforcement.  Bulky, but offers a decent amount of protection."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "heater shield"
msgid_plural "heater shields"
msgstr[0] "heater shield"
msgstr[1] "heater shields"

#. ~ Description for heater shield
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A medieval style of shield made of wood overlaid with leather, developed "
"from the longer kite shield.  Mainly used in tournaments, but still viable "
"in battle."
msgstr "A medieval style of shield made of wood overlaid with leather, developed from the longer kite shield.  Mainly used in tournaments, but still viable in battle."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "kite shield"
msgid_plural "kite shields"
msgstr[0] "kite shield"
msgstr[1] "kite shields"

#. ~ Description for kite shield
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A classic medieval style of shield, made of wood overlaid with leather, in "
"an elongated teardrop shape.  Affords decent protection, but was better "
"suited for cavalry."
msgstr "A classic medieval style of shield, made of wood overlaid with leather, in an elongated teardrop shape.  Affords decent protection, but was better suited for cavalry."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "round shield"
msgid_plural "round shields"
msgstr[0] "round shield"
msgstr[1] "round shields"

#. ~ Description for round shield
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A simple round shield made of wood, with a rim and boss of iron.  Made "
"infamous by the Vikings."
msgstr "A simple round shield made of wood, with a rim and boss of iron.  Made infamous by the Vikings."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "hoplon"
msgid_plural "hoplons"
msgstr[0] "hoplon"
msgstr[1] "hoplons"

#. ~ Description for hoplon
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A convex round shield from ancient Greece, made of wood reinforced with "
"bronze.  Heavy but effective."
msgstr "A convex round shield from ancient Greece, made of wood reinforced with bronze.  Heavy but effective."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "scutum"
msgid_plural "scuta"
msgstr[0] "scutum"
msgstr[1] "scuta"

#. ~ Description for scutum
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A rectangular shield from ancient Rome, made of wood and iron.  Perfect for "
"fighting in formation, but not ideal for facing zombies alone."
msgstr "A rectangular shield from ancient Rome, made of wood and iron.  Perfect for fighting in formation, but not ideal for facing zombies alone."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "buckler"
msgid_plural "bucklers"
msgstr[0] "buckler"
msgstr[1] "bucklers"

#. ~ Description for buckler
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A small metal shield from the late medieval and renaissance periods.  "
"Extremely light and tough, but its small size is as much a hindrance as it "
"is an advantage."
msgstr "A small metal shield from the late medieval and renaissance periods.  Extremely light and tough, but its small size is as much a hindrance as it is an advantage."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "hooded hat"
msgid_plural "hooded hats"
msgstr[0] "hooded hat"
msgstr[1] "hooded hats"

#. ~ Description for hooded hat
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A proper wide-brimmed hat, modified by the addition of a hood sewn to it, to"
" better protect the neck from wind and rain."
msgstr "A proper wide-brimmed hat, modified by the addition of a hood sewn to it, to better protect the neck from wind and rain."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "pair of fur leggings"
msgid_plural "pairs of fur leggings"
msgstr[0] "pair of fur leggings"
msgstr[1] "pairs of fur leggings"

#. ~ Description for pair of fur leggings
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Snug fur sleeves to keep your legs warm.  Simple yet effective since "
"prehistoric times."
msgstr "Snug fur sleeves to keep your legs warm.  Simple yet effective since prehistoric times."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "tarpaulin"
msgid_plural "tarpaulins"
msgstr[0] "tarpaulin"
msgstr[1] "tarpaulins"

#. ~ Description for tarpaulin
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A plastic sheet with several grommets for securing it with rope or cord.  "
"Useful for improvised rain protection."
msgstr "A plastic sheet with several grommets for securing it with rope or cord.  Useful for improvised rain protection."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "makeshift sunglasses"
msgid_plural "makeshift sunglasses"
msgstr[0] "makeshift sunglasses"
msgstr[1] "makeshift sunglasses"

#. ~ Description for makeshift sunglasses
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Eyewear carved from from wood or bone, with only a thin slit to see out of."
"  Helps reduce glare, traditionally used by the Inuit to protect against "
"snow blindness."
msgstr "Eyewear carved from from wood or bone, with only a thin slit to see out of.  Helps reduce glare, traditionally used by the Inuit to protect against snow blindness."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "PRM marine armor"
msgid_plural "PRM marine armors"
msgstr[0] "PRM marine armor"
msgstr[1] "PRM marine armors"

#. ~ Description for PRM marine armor
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A green piece of the PRM Corperation Marine Corp, made from microlayered "
"polymer plastic and tapering off into a thin, flexible filiment at the "
"shoulder, collarbone, and stomach.  Offers decent protection from flame and "
"acid, and features various straps and pockets for holstering guns and "
"holding stims and ammo."
msgstr "A green piece of the PRM Corperation Marine Corp, made from microlayered polymer plastic and tapering off into a thin, flexible filiment at the shoulder, collarbone, and stomach.  Offers decent protection from flame and acid, and features various straps and pockets for holstering guns and holding stims and ammo."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "PRM marine helmet"
msgid_plural "PRM marine helmets"
msgstr[0] "PRM marine helmet"
msgstr[1] "PRM marine helmets"

#. ~ Description for PRM marine helmet
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A heavy helmet with a tinted visor and sturdy, reinforced electronic wiring."
"  A simple filter is fixed onto either side, and an atomic power unit "
"ensures that as long as its in one general piece its basic HUD will "
"function."
msgstr "A heavy helmet with a tinted visor and sturdy, reinforced electronic wiring.  A simple filter is fixed onto either side, and an atomic power unit ensures that as long as its in one general piece its basic HUD will function."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "PRM marine leggings"
msgid_plural "PRM marine leggings"
msgstr[0] "PRM marine leggings"
msgstr[1] "PRM marine leggings"

#. ~ Description for PRM marine leggings
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Thick and somewhat oppressive leggings to protect PRM marines from "
"enviornmental hazards.  Although it has no pockets it does have slots along "
"its length to carry small items more easily, and really shapes the thighs!"
msgstr "Thick and somewhat oppressive leggings to protect PRM marines from enviornmental hazards.  Although it has no pockets it does have slots along its length to carry small items more easily, and really shapes the thighs!"

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "PRM marine boots"
msgid_plural "PRM marine boots"
msgstr[0] "PRM marine boots"
msgstr[1] "PRM marine boots"

#. ~ Description for PRM marine boots
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Lovingly refered to as 'shitstompers', these polyplastic boots reach up to "
"the knee, where they are sealed with a large strap.  They can be very hard "
"to even walk around in untrained, especially if they are imporperly fitted."
msgstr "Lovingly refered to as 'shitstompers', these polyplastic boots reach up to the knee, where they are sealed with a large strap.  They can be very hard to even walk around in untrained, especially if they are imporperly fitted."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "PRM marine gloves"
msgid_plural "PRM marine gloves"
msgstr[0] "PRM marine gloves"
msgstr[1] "PRM marine gloves"

#. ~ Description for PRM marine gloves
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A pair of black gloves emblazoned with the PRM logo, stretched tight against"
" the skin so as not to interfere with dexterous tasks."
msgstr "A pair of black gloves emblazoned with the PRM logo, stretched tight against the skin so as not to interfere with dexterous tasks."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "PRM marine sleeves"
msgid_plural "PRM marine sleeves"
msgstr[0] "PRM marine sleeves"
msgstr[1] "PRM marine sleeves"

#. ~ Description for PRM marine sleeves
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"PRM sleeves that keep the arms covered during cold conditions.  Can also "
"protect from flame, with some discomfort."
msgstr "PRM sleeves that keep the arms covered during cold conditions.  Can also protect from flame, with some discomfort."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "megabear skull helmet"
msgid_plural "megabear skull helmets"
msgstr[0] "megabear skull helmet"
msgstr[1] "megabear skull helmets"

#. ~ Description for megabear skull helmet
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A elegantly shaped elephant bear helmet, taken from a young adult and "
"fashioned into a helmet that covers the eyes and head.  Leaves the mouth "
"free for a filter mask, and looks much more ceremonial than a makeshift bone"
" helmet."
msgstr "A elegantly shaped elephant bear helmet, taken from a young adult and fashioned into a helmet that covers the eyes and head.  Leaves the mouth free for a filter mask, and looks much more ceremonial than a makeshift bone helmet."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "makeshift kevlar vest"
msgid_plural "makeshift kevlar vests"
msgstr[0] "makeshift kevlar vest"
msgstr[1] "makeshift kevlar vests"

#. ~ Description for makeshift kevlar vest
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A vest sewn together from Kevlar plates, less durable and protective than a "
"proper Kevlar vest.  Suitable for wearing under clothing."
msgstr "A vest sewn together from Kevlar plates, less durable and protective than a proper Kevlar vest.  Suitable for wearing under clothing."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "abstract bionic module"
msgid_plural "abstract bionic modules"
msgstr[0] "abstract bionic module"
msgstr[1] "abstract bionic modules"

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Adrenaline Pump CBM"
msgid_plural "Adrenaline Pump CBMs"
msgstr[0] "Adrenaline Pump CBM"
msgstr[1] "Adrenaline Pump CBMs"

#. ~ Description for Adrenaline Pump CBM
#. ~ Description for Adrenaline Pump
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py lang/json/bionic_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A stimulator system has been implanted alongside your adrenal glands, "
"allowing you to trigger your body's adrenaline response at the cost of some "
"bionic power."
msgstr "A stimulator system has been implanted alongside your adrenal glands, allowing you to trigger your body's adrenaline response at the cost of some bionic power."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Active Defense System CBM"
msgid_plural "Active Defense System CBMs"
msgstr[0] "Active Defense System CBM"
msgstr[1] "Active Defense System CBMs"

#. ~ Description for Active Defense System CBM
#. ~ Description for Active Defense System
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py lang/json/bionic_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A thin forcefield surrounds your body, continually draining power.  Anything"
" attempting to penetrate this field has a chance of being deflected at the "
"cost of more energy.  Melee attacks will be stopped more often than bullets."
msgstr "A thin forcefield surrounds your body, continually draining power.  Anything attempting to penetrate this field has a chance of being deflected at the cost of more energy.  Melee attacks will be stopped more often than bullets."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Advanced Microreactor CBM"
msgid_plural "Advanced Microreactor CBMs"
msgstr[0] "Advanced Microreactor CBM"
msgstr[1] "Advanced Microreactor CBMs"

#. ~ Description for Advanced Microreactor CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Storage tank and stripped down plutonium reactor, allowing generation of "
"power from small amounts of plutonium.  This one has been heavily upgraded."
"  Warning: minimal radiation shielding."
msgstr "Storage tank and stripped down plutonium reactor, allowing generation of power from small amounts of plutonium.  This one has been heavily upgraded.  Warning: minimal radiation shielding."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Alarm System CBM"
msgid_plural "Alarm System CBMs"
msgstr[0] "Alarm System CBM"
msgstr[1] "Alarm System CBMs"

#. ~ Description for Alarm System CBM
#. ~ Description for Alarm System
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py lang/json/bionic_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A motion-detecting alarm system will notice almost all movement within a "
"fifteen-foot radius, and will silently alert you.  This is very useful "
"during sleep, or if you suspect a cloaked pursuer."
msgstr "A motion-detecting alarm system will notice almost all movement within a fifteen-foot radius, and will silently alert you.  This is very useful during sleep, or if you suspect a cloaked pursuer."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Arms Alloy Plating CBM"
msgid_plural "Arms Alloy Plating CBMs"
msgstr[0] "Arms Alloy Plating CBM"
msgstr[1] "Arms Alloy Plating CBMs"

#. ~ Description for Arms Alloy Plating CBM
#. ~ Description for Alloy Plating - Arms
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py lang/json/bionic_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The flesh on your arms has been replaced by a strong armor, protecting you "
"greatly."
msgstr "The flesh on your arms has been replaced by a strong armor, protecting you greatly."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Protective Lenses CBM"
msgid_plural "Protective Lenses CBMs"
msgstr[0] "Protective Lenses CBM"
msgstr[1] "Protective Lenses CBMs"

#. ~ Description for Protective Lenses CBM
#. ~ Description for Protective Lenses
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py lang/json/bionic_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your eye sockets have been sealed with highly protective mirrored lenses and"
" your tear ducts have been re-routed to your mouth.  When you cry, you must "
"spit out or swallow your tears."
msgstr "Your eye sockets have been sealed with highly protective mirrored lenses and your tear ducts have been re-routed to your mouth.  When you cry, you must spit out or swallow your tears."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Head Alloy Plating CBM"
msgid_plural "Head Alloy Plating CBMs"
msgstr[0] "Head Alloy Plating CBM"
msgstr[1] "Head Alloy Plating CBMs"

#. ~ Description for Head Alloy Plating CBM
#. ~ Description for Alloy Plating - Head
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py lang/json/bionic_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The flesh on your head has been replaced by a strong armor, protecting both "
"your head and jaw regions."
msgstr "The flesh on your head has been replaced by a strong armor, protecting both your head and jaw regions."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Legs Alloy Plating CBM"
msgid_plural "Legs Alloy Plating CBMs"
msgstr[0] "Legs Alloy Plating CBM"
msgstr[1] "Legs Alloy Plating CBMs"

#. ~ Description for Legs Alloy Plating CBM
#. ~ Description for Alloy Plating - Legs
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py lang/json/bionic_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The flesh on your legs has been replaced by a strong armor, protecting you "
"greatly."
msgstr "The flesh on your legs has been replaced by a strong armor, protecting you greatly."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Torso Alloy Plating CBM"
msgid_plural "Torso Alloy Plating CBMs"
msgstr[0] "Torso Alloy Plating CBM"
msgstr[1] "Torso Alloy Plating CBMs"

#. ~ Description for Torso Alloy Plating CBM
#. ~ Description for Alloy Plating - Torso
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py lang/json/bionic_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The flesh on your torso has been replaced by a strong armor, protecting you "
"greatly."
msgstr "The flesh on your torso has been replaced by a strong armor, protecting you greatly."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Battery System CBM"
msgid_plural "Battery System CBMs"
msgstr[0] "Battery System CBM"
msgstr[1] "Battery System CBMs"

#. ~ Description for Battery System CBM
#. ~ Description for Battery System
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py lang/json/bionic_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You have a battery draining attachment, and thus can make use of the energy "
"contained in normal, everyday batteries.  Use 'E' to consume batteries.  Can"
" be toggled on and off at will."
msgstr "You have a battery draining attachment, and thus can make use of the energy contained in normal, everyday batteries.  Use 'E' to consume batteries.  Can be toggled on and off at will."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Monomolecular Blade CBM"
msgid_plural "Monomolecular Blade CBMs"
msgstr[0] "Monomolecular Blade CBM"
msgstr[1] "Monomolecular Blade CBMs"

#. ~ Description for Monomolecular Blade CBM
#. ~ Description for Monomolecular Blade
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py lang/json/bionic_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A deadly foot-long blade made of advanced material now resides inside your "
"forearm, capable of being extended through the back of your wrist at the "
"cost of a small amount of power.  Though exceptionally sharp, it will "
"prevent you from holding anything else while extended."
msgstr "A deadly foot-long blade made of advanced material now resides inside your forearm, capable of being extended through the back of your wrist at the cost of a small amount of power.  Though exceptionally sharp, it will prevent you from holding anything else while extended."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Fusion Blaster Arm CBM"
msgid_plural "Fusion Blaster Arm CBMs"
msgstr[0] "Fusion Blaster Arm CBM"
msgstr[1] "Fusion Blaster Arm CBMs"

#. ~ Description for Fusion Blaster Arm CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your left arm has been replaced by a heavy-duty fusion blaster!  You may use"
" your energy banks to fire a damaging heat ray; however, you are unable to "
"use or carry two-handed items, and may only fire handguns."
msgstr "Your left arm has been replaced by a heavy-duty fusion blaster!  You may use your energy banks to fire a damaging heat ray; however, you are unable to use or carry two-handed items, and may only fire handguns."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Blood Analysis CBM"
msgid_plural "Blood Analysis CBMs"
msgstr[0] "Blood Analysis CBM"
msgstr[1] "Blood Analysis CBMs"

#. ~ Description for Blood Analysis CBM
#. ~ Description for Blood Analysis
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py lang/json/bionic_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Small sensors have been implanted in your heart, allowing you to analyze "
"your blood.  This will detect many illnesses, drugs, and other conditions."
msgstr "Small sensors have been implanted in your heart, allowing you to analyze your blood.  This will detect many illnesses, drugs, and other conditions."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Blood Filter CBM"
msgid_plural "Blood Filter CBMs"
msgstr[0] "Blood Filter CBM"
msgstr[1] "Blood Filter CBMs"

#. ~ Description for Blood Filter CBM
#. ~ Description for Blood Filter
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py lang/json/bionic_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A filtration system in your heart allows you to actively filter out chemical"
" impurities, primarily drugs.  It will have limited impact on viruses.  Note"
" that it is not a targeted filter; ALL drugs in your system will be "
"affected."
msgstr "A filtration system in your heart allows you to actively filter out chemical impurities, primarily drugs.  It will have limited impact on viruses.  Note that it is not a targeted filter; ALL drugs in your system will be affected."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Cable Charger System CBM"
msgid_plural "Cable Charger System CBMs"
msgstr[0] "Cable Charger System CBM"
msgstr[1] "Cable Charger System CBMs"

#. ~ Description for Cable Charger System CBM
#. ~ Description for Cable Charger System
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py lang/json/bionic_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You have a complex port mounted above your hip.  While active, it will drain"
" power through a jumper cable held on your person."
msgstr "You have a complex port mounted above your hip.  While active, it will drain power through a jumper cable held on your person."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Subdermal Carbon Filament CBM"
msgid_plural "Subdermal Carbon Filament CBMs"
msgstr[0] "Subdermal Carbon Filament CBM"
msgstr[1] "Subdermal Carbon Filament CBMs"

#. ~ Description for Subdermal Carbon Filament CBM
#. ~ Description for Subdermal Carbon Filament
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py lang/json/bionic_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Lying just beneath your skin is a thin armor made of carbon nanotubes.  This"
" reduces bashing damage by 2 and cutting damage by 4."
msgstr "Lying just beneath your skin is a thin armor made of carbon nanotubes.  This reduces bashing damage by 2 and cutting damage by 4."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Chain Lightning CBM"
msgid_plural "Chain Lightning CBMs"
msgstr[0] "Chain Lightning CBM"
msgstr[1] "Chain Lightning CBMs"

#. ~ Description for Chain Lightning CBM
#. ~ Description for Chain Lightning
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py lang/json/bionic_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your body is equipped with a chain lightning generator, allowing you to emit"
" a blast of lightning at a target, leaving a trail of lightning in its wake,"
" jumping to additional targets within 4 tiles of the previous target."
msgstr "Your body is equipped with a chain lightning generator, allowing you to emit a blast of lightning at a target, leaving a trail of lightning in its wake, jumping to additional targets within 4 tiles of the previous target."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Bionic Claws CBM"
msgid_plural "Bionic Claws CBMs"
msgstr[0] "Bionic Claws CBM"
msgstr[1] "Bionic Claws CBMs"

#. ~ Description for Bionic Claws CBM
#. ~ Description for Bionic Claws
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py lang/json/bionic_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Vicious claws have been installed inside your fingers, allowing you to "
"extend and retract them at the cost of a small amount of power.  These do "
"considerable cutting damage, but prevent you from holding anything else "
"while extended."
msgstr "Vicious claws have been installed inside your fingers, allowing you to extend and retract them at the cost of a small amount of power.  These do considerable cutting damage, but prevent you from holding anything else while extended."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Internal Climate Control CBM"
msgid_plural "Internal Climate Control CBMs"
msgstr[0] "Internal Climate Control CBM"
msgstr[1] "Internal Climate Control CBMs"

#. ~ Description for Internal Climate Control CBM
#. ~ Description for Internal Climate Control
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py lang/json/bionic_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Throughout your body lies a network of thermal piping which eases the "
"effects of high and low ambient temperatures."
msgstr "Throughout your body lies a network of thermal piping which eases the effects of high and low ambient temperatures."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Cloaking System CBM"
msgid_plural "Cloaking System CBMs"
msgstr[0] "Cloaking System CBM"
msgstr[1] "Cloaking System CBMs"

#. ~ Description for Cloaking System CBM
#. ~ Description for Cloaking System
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py lang/json/bionic_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This high-power system uses a set of cameras and LEDs to make you blend into"
" your background, rendering you fully invisible to normal vision.  However, "
"you may be detected by infrared, sonar, etc."
msgstr "This high-power system uses a set of cameras and LEDs to make you blend into your background, rendering you fully invisible to normal vision.  However, you may be detected by infrared, sonar, etc."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Close Quarters Battle CBM"
msgid_plural "Close Quarters Battle CBMs"
msgstr[0] "Close Quarters Battle CBM"
msgstr[1] "Close Quarters Battle CBMs"

#. ~ Description for Close Quarters Battle CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Databanks and processors loaded with extensive martial arts combat programs "
"are integrated directly into your spinal column.  Whilst active, you become "
"deadly in hand-to-hand."
msgstr "Databanks and processors loaded with extensive martial arts combat programs are integrated directly into your spinal column.  Whilst active, you become deadly in hand-to-hand."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Wired Reflexes CBM"
msgid_plural "Wired Reflexes CBMs"
msgstr[0] "Wired Reflexes CBM"
msgstr[1] "Wired Reflexes CBMs"

#. ~ Description for Wired Reflexes CBM
#. ~ Description for Wired Reflexes
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py lang/json/bionic_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your reaction time has been greatly enhanced with bionic nerve stimulators, "
"giving you a +2 bonus to dexterity."
msgstr "Your reaction time has been greatly enhanced with bionic nerve stimulators, giving you a +2 bonus to dexterity."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Expanded Digestive System CBM"
msgid_plural "Expanded Digestive System CBMs"
msgstr[0] "Expanded Digestive System CBM"
msgstr[1] "Expanded Digestive System CBMs"

#. ~ Description for Expanded Digestive System CBM
#. ~ Description for Expanded Digestive System
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py lang/json/bionic_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You have been outfitted with three synthetic stomachs and industrial-grade "
"intestines.  Not only can you extract much more nutrition from food, but you"
" are highly resistant to foodborne illness, and can sometimes eat rotten "
"food."
msgstr "You have been outfitted with three synthetic stomachs and industrial-grade intestines.  Not only can you extract much more nutrition from food, but you are highly resistant to foodborne illness, and can sometimes eat rotten food."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Enhanced Hearing CBM"
msgid_plural "Enhanced Hearing CBMs"
msgstr[0] "Enhanced Hearing CBM"
msgstr[1] "Enhanced Hearing CBMs"

#. ~ Description for Enhanced Hearing CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"When this bionic is active, your hearing will be drastically improved, "
"allowing you to hear ten times better than the average person.  "
"Additionally, high-intensity sounds will be automatically dampened before "
"they can damage your hearing.  You can also toggle those sound dampeners on "
"demand, should you wish to reduce the effect of the bionic or become "
"completely deaf."
msgstr "When this bionic is active, your hearing will be drastically improved, allowing you to hear ten times better than the average person.  Additionally, high-intensity sounds will be automatically dampened before they can damage your hearing.  You can also toggle those sound dampeners on demand, should you wish to reduce the effect of the bionic or become completely deaf."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Directional EMP CBM"
msgid_plural "Directional EMP CBMs"
msgstr[0] "Directional EMP CBM"
msgstr[1] "Directional EMP CBMs"

#. ~ Description for Directional EMP CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Mounted in the palms of your hand are small parabolic EMP field generators."
"  You may use power to fire a short-ranged blast which will disable "
"electronics and robots."
msgstr "Mounted in the palms of your hand are small parabolic EMP field generators.  You may use power to fire a short-ranged blast which will disable electronics and robots."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Ethanol Burner CBM"
msgid_plural "Ethanol Burner CBMs"
msgstr[0] "Ethanol Burner CBM"
msgstr[1] "Ethanol Burner CBMs"

#. ~ Description for Ethanol Burner CBM
#. ~ Description for Ethanol Burner
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py lang/json/bionic_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You burn alcohol as fuel in an extremely efficient reaction.  However, you "
"will still suffer the inebriating effects of the substance."
msgstr "You burn alcohol as fuel in an extremely efficient reaction.  However, you will still suffer the inebriating effects of the substance."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Aero-Evaporator CBM"
msgid_plural "Aero-Evaporator CBMs"
msgstr[0] "Aero-Evaporator CBM"
msgstr[1] "Aero-Evaporator CBMs"

#. ~ Description for Aero-Evaporator CBM
#. ~ Description for Aero-Evaporator
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py lang/json/bionic_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This unit draws moisture from the surrounding air, which then is poured from"
" a fingertip in the form of water.  It may fail in very dry environments."
msgstr "This unit draws moisture from the surrounding air, which then is poured from a fingertip in the form of water.  It may fail in very dry environments."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Diamond Cornea CBM"
msgid_plural "Diamond Cornea CBMs"
msgstr[0] "Diamond Cornea CBM"
msgstr[1] "Diamond Cornea CBMs"

#. ~ Description for Diamond Cornea CBM
#. ~ Description for Diamond Cornea
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py lang/json/bionic_from_json.py
msgid "Your vision is greatly enhanced, giving you a +2 bonus to perception."
msgstr "Your vision is greatly enhanced, giving you a +2 bonus to perception."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Telescopic Eyes CBM"
msgid_plural "Telescopic Eyes CBMs"
msgstr[0] "Telescopic Eyes CBM"
msgstr[1] "Telescopic Eyes CBMs"

#. ~ Description for Telescopic Eyes CBM
#. ~ Description for Telescopic Eyes
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py lang/json/bionic_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Much of the material in your inner eye has been removed and replaced with an"
" array of high-powered, auto-focusing lenses.  You can now see much farther "
"and more clearly than before, any vision problems you might have had are now"
" gone."
msgstr "Much of the material in your inner eye has been removed and replaced with an array of high-powered, auto-focusing lenses.  You can now see much farther and more clearly than before, any vision problems you might have had are now gone."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Facial Distortion CBM"
msgid_plural "Facial Distortion CBMs"
msgstr[0] "Facial Distortion CBM"
msgstr[1] "Facial Distortion CBMs"

#. ~ Description for Facial Distortion CBM
#. ~ Description for Facial Distortion
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py lang/json/bionic_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Through controlled application of electrochemical impulses, you are capable "
"of altering your facial structure so as to subtly affect the reactions of "
"others.  This grants a bonus to all social interactions."
msgstr "Through controlled application of electrochemical impulses, you are capable of altering your facial structure so as to subtly affect the reactions of others.  This grants a bonus to all social interactions."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Dielectric Capacitance System CBM"
msgid_plural "Dielectric Capacitance System CBMs"
msgstr[0] "Dielectric Capacitance System CBM"
msgstr[1] "Dielectric Capacitance System CBMs"

#. ~ Description for Dielectric Capacitance System CBM
#. ~ Description for Dielectric Capacitance System
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py lang/json/bionic_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Throughout your body lies a network of miniature piezoelectric capacitors "
"which can be charged with bionic power to temporarily protect you from "
"external electrical discharge."
msgstr "Throughout your body lies a network of miniature piezoelectric capacitors which can be charged with bionic power to temporarily protect you from external electrical discharge."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Fingerhack CBM"
msgid_plural "Fingerhack CBMs"
msgstr[0] "Fingerhack CBM"
msgstr[1] "Fingerhack CBMs"

#. ~ Description for Fingerhack CBM
#. ~ Description for Fingerhack
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py lang/json/bionic_from_json.py
msgid ""
"One of your fingers has an electrohack embedded in it; an all-purpose "
"hacking unit used to override control panels and the like (but not "
"computers).  Skill in computers is important, and a failed use may damage "
"your circuits."
msgstr "One of your fingers has an electrohack embedded in it; an all-purpose hacking unit used to override control panels and the like (but not computers).  Skill in computers is important, and a failed use may damage your circuits."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Flashbang Generator CBM"
msgid_plural "Flashbang Generator CBMs"
msgstr[0] "Flashbang Generator CBM"
msgstr[1] "Flashbang Generator CBMs"

#. ~ Description for Flashbang Generator CBM
#. ~ Description for Flashbang Generator
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py lang/json/bionic_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Light emitting diodes integrated into your skin can release a flash "
"comparable to a flashbang grenade, blinding nearby enemies.  Speakers "
"integrated into your body mimic the loud sound, deafening those nearby."
msgstr "Light emitting diodes integrated into your skin can release a flash comparable to a flashbang grenade, blinding nearby enemies.  Speakers integrated into your body mimic the loud sound, deafening those nearby."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Cranial Flashlight CBM"
msgid_plural "Cranial Flashlight CBMs"
msgstr[0] "Cranial Flashlight CBM"
msgstr[1] "Cranial Flashlight CBMs"

#. ~ Description for Cranial Flashlight CBM
#. ~ Description for Cranial Flashlight
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py lang/json/bionic_from_json.py
msgid "Mounted between your eyes is a small but powerful LED flashlight."
msgstr "Mounted between your eyes is a small but powerful LED flashlight."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Internal Furnace CBM"
msgid_plural "Internal Furnace CBMs"
msgstr[0] "Internal Furnace CBM"
msgstr[1] "Internal Furnace CBMs"

#. ~ Description for Internal Furnace CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You can burn nearly any organic material as fuel (use 'E'), recharging your "
"power level.  Some materials will burn better than others.  Can be toggled "
"on and off at will."
msgstr "You can burn nearly any organic material as fuel (use 'E'), recharging your power level.  Some materials will burn better than others.  Can be toggled on and off at will."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Integrated Dosimeter CBM"
msgid_plural "Integrated Dosimeter CBMs"
msgstr[0] "Integrated Dosimeter CBM"
msgstr[1] "Integrated Dosimeter CBMs"

#. ~ Description for Integrated Dosimeter CBM
#. ~ Description for Integrated Dosimeter
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py lang/json/bionic_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Small radiation sensors have been implanted throughout your body, allowing "
"you to analyze your level of absorbed radiation.  They will also alert you "
"whenever exposed to environmental radiation."
msgstr "Small radiation sensors have been implanted throughout your body, allowing you to analyze your level of absorbed radiation.  They will also alert you whenever exposed to environmental radiation."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Oxygenator CBM"
msgid_plural "Oxygenator CBMs"
msgstr[0] "Oxygenator CBM"
msgstr[1] "Oxygenator CBMs"

#. ~ Description for Oxygenator CBM
#. ~ Description for Oxygenator
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py lang/json/bionic_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A complex oxygen delivery system.  Improves the ability to extract oxygen "
"from air and allows extracting it from water.  Will automatically turn on "
"when drowning.  Turn on to recharge stamina faster, at moderate power cost."
msgstr "A complex oxygen delivery system.  Improves the ability to extract oxygen from air and allows extracting it from water.  Will automatically turn on when drowning.  Turn on to recharge stamina faster, at moderate power cost."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Terranian Sonar CBM"
msgid_plural "Terranian Sonar CBMs"
msgstr[0] "Terranian Sonar CBM"
msgstr[1] "Terranian Sonar CBMs"

#. ~ Description for Terranian Sonar CBM
#. ~ Description for Terranian Sonar
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py lang/json/bionic_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your feet are equipped with precision sonar equipment, allowing you to "
"detect the movements of creatures below the ground."
msgstr "Your feet are equipped with precision sonar equipment, allowing you to detect the movements of creatures below the ground."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Heat Drain CBM"
msgid_plural "Heat Drain CBMs"
msgstr[0] "Heat Drain CBM"
msgstr[1] "Heat Drain CBMs"

#. ~ Description for Heat Drain CBM
#. ~ Description for Heat Drain
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py lang/json/bionic_from_json.py
msgid ""
"While fighting unarmed against a warm-blooded opponent, there is a chance "
"that a successful hit will drain body heat, inflicting a small amount of "
"extra damage, and increasing your power reserves slightly."
msgstr "While fighting unarmed against a warm-blooded opponent, there is a chance that a successful hit will drain body heat, inflicting a small amount of extra damage, and increasing your power reserves slightly."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Thermal Dissipation CBM"
msgid_plural "Thermal Dissipation CBMs"
msgstr[0] "Thermal Dissipation CBM"
msgstr[1] "Thermal Dissipation CBMs"

#. ~ Description for Thermal Dissipation CBM
#. ~ Description for Thermal Dissipation
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py lang/json/bionic_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Powerful heatsinks and supermaterials are woven into your flesh.  While "
"powered, this system will prevent heat damage up to 2000 degrees Fahrenheit."
"  Note that this does not affect your internal temperature."
msgstr "Powerful heatsinks and supermaterials are woven into your flesh.  While powered, this system will prevent heat damage up to 2000 degrees Fahrenheit.  Note that this does not affect your internal temperature."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Hydraulic Muscles CBM"
msgid_plural "Hydraulic Muscles CBMs"
msgstr[0] "Hydraulic Muscles CBM"
msgstr[1] "Hydraulic Muscles CBMs"

#. ~ Description for Hydraulic Muscles CBM
#. ~ Description for Hydraulic Muscles
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py lang/json/bionic_from_json.py
msgid ""
"While activated, your muscles will be greatly enhanced, increasing your "
"strength by 20."
msgstr "While activated, your muscles will be greatly enhanced, increasing your strength by 20."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Infrared Vision CBM"
msgid_plural "Infrared Vision CBMs"
msgstr[0] "Infrared Vision CBM"
msgstr[1] "Infrared Vision CBMs"

#. ~ Description for Infrared Vision CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your range of vision extends into the infrared, allowing you to see warm-"
"blooded creatures in the dark, and even through walls."
msgstr "Your range of vision extends into the infrared, allowing you to see warm-blooded creatures in the dark, and even through walls."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Cerebral Booster CBM"
msgid_plural "Cerebral Booster CBMs"
msgstr[0] "Cerebral Booster CBM"
msgstr[1] "Cerebral Booster CBMs"

#. ~ Description for Cerebral Booster CBM
#. ~ Description for Cerebral Booster
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py lang/json/bionic_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your brain has been enhanced with bionic coprocessors, giving you a +2 bonus"
" to intelligence."
msgstr "Your brain has been enhanced with bionic coprocessors, giving you a +2 bonus to intelligence."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Finger-Mounted Laser CBM"
msgid_plural "Finger-Mounted Laser CBMs"
msgstr[0] "Finger-Mounted Laser CBM"
msgstr[1] "Finger-Mounted Laser CBMs"

#. ~ Description for Finger-Mounted Laser CBM
#. ~ Description for Finger-Mounted Laser
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py lang/json/bionic_from_json.py
msgid ""
"One of your fingers has a small high-powered laser embedded in it.  This "
"long range weapon is not incredibly damaging, but is very accurate, and has "
"the potential to start fires."
msgstr "One of your fingers has a small high-powered laser embedded in it.  This long range weapon is not incredibly damaging, but is very accurate, and has the potential to start fires."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Leukocyte Breeder System CBM"
msgid_plural "Leukocyte Breeder System CBMs"
msgstr[0] "Leukocyte Breeder System CBM"
msgstr[1] "Leukocyte Breeder System CBMs"

#. ~ Description for Leukocyte Breeder System CBM
#. ~ Description for Leukocyte Breeder System
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py lang/json/bionic_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You are equipped with bionic stimulators which augment your haematopoiesis "
"system, allowing you to accelerate white blood cell production using bionic "
"power.  It is supposed to run continuously and may cause unpleasant side "
"effects when turned off."
msgstr "You are equipped with bionic stimulators which augment your haematopoiesis system, allowing you to accelerate white blood cell production using bionic power.  It is supposed to run continuously and may cause unpleasant side effects when turned off."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Mini-Flamethrower CBM"
msgid_plural "Mini-Flamethrower CBMs"
msgstr[0] "Mini-Flamethrower CBM"
msgstr[1] "Mini-Flamethrower CBMs"

#. ~ Description for Mini-Flamethrower CBM
#. ~ Description for Mini-Flamethrower
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py lang/json/bionic_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The index fingers of both hands have powerful fire starters which extend "
"from the tip."
msgstr "The index fingers of both hands have powerful fire starters which extend from the tip."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Fingerpick CBM"
msgid_plural "Fingerpick CBMs"
msgstr[0] "Fingerpick CBM"
msgstr[1] "Fingerpick CBMs"

#. ~ Description for Fingerpick CBM
#. ~ Description for Fingerpick
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py lang/json/bionic_from_json.py
msgid ""
"One of your fingers has an electronic lockpick embedded in it.  This "
"automatic system will quickly unlock all but the most advanced key locks "
"without any skill required on the part of the user."
msgstr "One of your fingers has an electronic lockpick embedded in it.  This automatic system will quickly unlock all but the most advanced key locks without any skill required on the part of the user."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Electromagnetic Unit CBM"
msgid_plural "Electromagnetic Unit CBMs"
msgstr[0] "Electromagnetic Unit CBM"
msgstr[1] "Electromagnetic Unit CBMs"

#. ~ Description for Electromagnetic Unit CBM
#. ~ Description for Electromagnetic Unit
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py lang/json/bionic_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Embedded in your hand is a powerful electromagnet, allowing you to pull "
"items made of iron over short distances."
msgstr "Embedded in your hand is a powerful electromagnet, allowing you to pull items made of iron over short distances."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Nictating Membrane CBM"
msgid_plural "Nictating Membrane CBMs"
msgstr[0] "Nictating Membrane CBM"
msgstr[1] "Nictating Membrane CBMs"

#. ~ Description for Nictating Membrane CBM
#. ~ Description for Nictating Membrane
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py lang/json/bionic_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your eyes have a thin membrane that closes over your eyes while underwater, "
"negating any vision penalties."
msgstr "Your eyes have a thin membrane that closes over your eyes while underwater, negating any vision penalties."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Enhanced Memory Banks CBM"
msgid_plural "Enhanced Memory Banks CBMs"
msgstr[0] "Enhanced Memory Banks CBM"
msgstr[1] "Enhanced Memory Banks CBMs"

#. ~ Description for Enhanced Memory Banks CBM
#. ~ Description for Enhanced Memory Banks
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py lang/json/bionic_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your memory has been enhanced with small quantum storage drives.  Any time "
"you start to forget a skill, if this bionic is active you will retain all "
"knowledge, at the cost of a small amount of power."
msgstr "Your memory has been enhanced with small quantum storage drives.  Any time you start to forget a skill, if this bionic is active you will retain all knowledge, at the cost of a small amount of power."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Metabolic Interchange CBM"
msgid_plural "Metabolic Interchange CBMs"
msgstr[0] "Metabolic Interchange CBM"
msgstr[1] "Metabolic Interchange CBMs"

#. ~ Description for Metabolic Interchange CBM
#. ~ Description for Metabolic Interchange
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py lang/json/bionic_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your digestive system and power supply are interconnected.  Any drain on "
"energy instead increases your hunger.  Can be toggled on and off at will."
msgstr "Your digestive system and power supply are interconnected.  Any drain on energy instead increases your hunger.  Can be toggled on and off at will."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Weather Reader CBM"
msgid_plural "Weather Reader CBMs"
msgstr[0] "Weather Reader CBM"
msgstr[1] "Weather Reader CBMs"

#. ~ Description for Weather Reader CBM
#. ~ Description for Weather Reader
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py lang/json/bionic_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A multitude of scientific instruments and sensors collect environmental "
"data.  The data is compiled and presented as a simple readout of the current"
" weather.  It also passively tells you your external temperature."
msgstr "A multitude of scientific instruments and sensors collect environmental data.  The data is compiled and presented as a simple readout of the current weather.  It also passively tells you your external temperature."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Repair Nanobots CBM"
msgid_plural "Repair Nanobots CBMs"
msgstr[0] "Repair Nanobots CBM"
msgstr[1] "Repair Nanobots CBMs"

#. ~ Description for Repair Nanobots CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Inside your body is a fleet of tiny dormant robots.  Once charged from your "
"energy banks, they will flit about your body, repairing damage and stopping "
"bleeding."
msgstr "Inside your body is a fleet of tiny dormant robots.  Once charged from your energy banks, they will flit about your body, repairing damage and stopping bleeding."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Artificial Night Generator CBM"
msgid_plural "Artificial Night Generator CBMs"
msgstr[0] "Artificial Night Generator CBM"
msgstr[1] "Artificial Night Generator CBMs"

#. ~ Description for Artificial Night Generator CBM
#. ~ Description for Artificial Night Generator
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py lang/json/bionic_from_json.py
msgid "Destructive interference eliminates all light within a 15 tile radius."
msgstr "Destructive interference eliminates all light within a 15 tile radius."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Implanted Night Vision CBM"
msgid_plural "Implanted Night Vision CBMs"
msgstr[0] "Implanted Night Vision CBM"
msgstr[1] "Implanted Night Vision CBMs"

#. ~ Description for Implanted Night Vision CBM
#. ~ Description for Implanted Night Vision
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py lang/json/bionic_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your eyes have been modified to amplify existing light, allowing you to see "
"in the dark."
msgstr "Your eyes have been modified to amplify existing light, allowing you to see in the dark."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Offensive Defense System CBM"
msgid_plural "Offensive Defense System CBMs"
msgstr[0] "Offensive Defense System CBM"
msgstr[1] "Offensive Defense System CBMs"

#. ~ Description for Offensive Defense System CBM
#. ~ Description for Offensive Defense System
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py lang/json/bionic_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A thin forcefield surrounds your body, continually draining power.  This "
"field does not deflect penetration, but rather delivers a very strong shock,"
" damaging unarmed attackers and those with a conductive weapon."
msgstr "A thin forcefield surrounds your body, continually draining power.  This field does not deflect penetration, but rather delivers a very strong shock, damaging unarmed attackers and those with a conductive weapon."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Sensory Dulling CBM"
msgid_plural "Sensory Dulling CBMs"
msgstr[0] "Sensory Dulling CBM"
msgstr[1] "Sensory Dulling CBMs"

#. ~ Description for Sensory Dulling CBM
#. ~ Description for Sensory Dulling
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py lang/json/bionic_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your nervous system is wired to allow you to inhibit the signals of pain, "
"allowing you to dull your senses at will.  However, the use of this system "
"may cause delayed reaction time and drowsiness."
msgstr "Your nervous system is wired to allow you to inhibit the signals of pain, allowing you to dull your senses at will.  However, the use of this system may cause delayed reaction time and drowsiness."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Plutonium Filter CBM"
msgid_plural "Plutonium Filter CBMs"
msgstr[0] "Plutonium Filter CBM"
msgstr[1] "Plutonium Filter CBMs"

#. ~ Description for Plutonium Filter CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"System of tanks and filters to extract plutonium more rapidly from slurry "
"for a microreactor."
msgstr "System of tanks and filters to extract plutonium more rapidly from slurry for a microreactor."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Power Armor Interface CBM"
msgid_plural "Power Armor Interface CBMs"
msgstr[0] "Power Armor Interface CBM"
msgstr[1] "Power Armor Interface CBMs"

#. ~ Description for Power Armor Interface CBM
#. ~ Description for Power Armor Interface
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py lang/json/bionic_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Interfaces your power system with the internal charging port on suits of "
"power armor."
msgstr "Interfaces your power system with the internal charging port on suits of power armor."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Power Armor Mk. II Interface CBM"
msgid_plural "Power Armor Mk. II Interface CBMs"
msgstr[0] "Power Armor Mk. II Interface CBM"
msgstr[1] "Power Armor Mk. II Interface CBMs"

#. ~ Description for Power Armor Mk. II Interface CBM
#. ~ Description for Power Armor Interface Mk. II
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py lang/json/bionic_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Interfaces your power system with the internal charging port on suits of "
"power armor.  The Mk. II was designed by DoubleTech Inc., to meet the "
"popularity of the Mk. II power armor series."
msgstr "Interfaces your power system with the internal charging port on suits of power armor.  The Mk. II was designed by DoubleTech Inc., to meet the popularity of the Mk. II power armor series."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Power Storage CBM"
msgid_plural "Power Storage CBMs"
msgstr[0] "Power Storage CBM"
msgstr[1] "Power Storage CBMs"

#. ~ Description for Power Storage CBM
#. ~ Description for Power Storage
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py lang/json/bionic_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Compact Bionics Module that upgrades your power capacity by 100 units.  "
"Having at least one of these is a prerequisite to using powered bionics.  "
"You will also need a power supply, found in another CBM."
msgstr "Compact Bionics Module that upgrades your power capacity by 100 units.  Having at least one of these is a prerequisite to using powered bionics.  You will also need a power supply, found in another CBM."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Power Storage CBM Mk. II"
msgid_plural "Power Storage CBMs Mk. II"
msgstr[0] "Power Storage CBM Mk. II"
msgstr[1] "Power Storage CBMs Mk. II"

#. ~ Description for Power Storage CBM Mk. II
#. ~ Description for Power Storage Mk. II
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py lang/json/bionic_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Compact Bionics Module developed at DoubleTech Industries as a replacement "
"for the highly successful Power Storage CBM.  Increases your power capacity "
"by 250 units."
msgstr "Compact Bionics Module developed at DoubleTech Industries as a replacement for the highly successful Power Storage CBM.  Increases your power capacity by 250 units."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Probability Travel CBM"
msgid_plural "Probability Travel CBMs"
msgstr[0] "Probability Travel CBM"
msgstr[1] "Probability Travel CBMs"

#. ~ Description for Probability Travel CBM
#. ~ Description for Probability Travel
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py lang/json/bionic_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Increases your body's wavelength, allowing you to quantum tunnel through "
"walls, reappearing on the other side.  Power drain in standby is minimal, "
"but each tile tunneled through costs 250 bionic power."
msgstr "Increases your body's wavelength, allowing you to quantum tunnel through walls, reappearing on the other side.  Power drain in standby is minimal, but each tile tunneled through costs 250 bionic power."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Air Filtration System CBM"
msgid_plural "Air Filtration System CBMs"
msgstr[0] "Air Filtration System CBM"
msgstr[1] "Air Filtration System CBMs"

#. ~ Description for Air Filtration System CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Implanted in your trachea is an advanced filtration system.  If toxins find "
"their way into your windpipe, the filter will attempt to remove them."
msgstr "Implanted in your trachea is an advanced filtration system.  If toxins find their way into your windpipe, the filter will attempt to remove them."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Radiation Scrubber System CBM"
msgid_plural "Radiation Scrubber System CBMs"
msgstr[0] "Radiation Scrubber System CBM"
msgstr[1] "Radiation Scrubber System CBMs"

#. ~ Description for Radiation Scrubber System CBM
#. ~ Description for Radiation Scrubber System
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py lang/json/bionic_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A system of advanced piezomechanical blood filters have been implanted "
"throughout your body, allowing you to purge yourself of absorbed radiation "
"at the cost of some bionic power."
msgstr "A system of advanced piezomechanical blood filters have been implanted throughout your body, allowing you to purge yourself of absorbed radiation at the cost of some bionic power."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Railgun CBM"
msgid_plural "Railgun CBMs"
msgstr[0] "Railgun CBM"
msgstr[1] "Railgun CBMs"

#. ~ Description for Railgun CBM
#. ~ Description for Railgun
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py lang/json/bionic_from_json.py
msgid ""
"EM field generators in your arms double the range and damage of thrown iron "
"and steel objects at a cost of 1 power per throw, causing them to leave a "
"trail of electricity that can cause additional damage."
msgstr "EM field generators in your arms double the range and damage of thrown iron and steel objects at a cost of 1 power per throw, causing them to leave a trail of electricity that can cause additional damage."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Fingertip Razors CBM"
msgid_plural "Fingertip Razors CBMs"
msgstr[0] "Fingertip Razors CBM"
msgstr[1] "Fingertip Razors CBMs"

#. ~ Description for Fingertip Razors CBM
#. ~ Description for Fingertip Razors
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py lang/json/bionic_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You possess razor-sharp retractable claws underneath your fingernails, ten "
"double-edged blades four centimeters in length that do a small amount of "
"unarmed slashing damage whenever your fingertips are uncovered."
msgstr "You possess razor-sharp retractable claws underneath your fingernails, ten double-edged blades four centimeters in length that do a small amount of unarmed slashing damage whenever your fingertips are uncovered."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Internal Microreactor CBM"
msgid_plural "Internal Microreactor CBMs"
msgstr[0] "Internal Microreactor CBM"
msgstr[1] "Internal Microreactor CBMs"

#. ~ Description for Internal Microreactor CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Storage tank and stripped down plutonium reactor, allowing generation of "
"power from small amounts of plutonium.  Warning: minimal radiation "
"shielding."
msgstr "Storage tank and stripped down plutonium reactor, allowing generation of power from small amounts of plutonium.  Warning: minimal radiation shielding."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Microreactor Upgrade CBM"
msgid_plural "Microreactor Upgrade CBMs"
msgstr[0] "Microreactor Upgrade CBM"
msgstr[1] "Microreactor Upgrade CBMs"

#. ~ Description for Microreactor Upgrade CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A kit for upgrading a pre-installed microreactor with enhanced maximum yield"
" and automatic radiation scrubbing."
msgstr "A kit for upgrading a pre-installed microreactor with enhanced maximum yield and automatic radiation scrubbing."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Recycler Unit CBM"
msgid_plural "Recycler Unit CBMs"
msgstr[0] "Recycler Unit CBM"
msgstr[1] "Recycler Unit CBMs"

#. ~ Description for Recycler Unit CBM
#. ~ Description for Recycler Unit
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py lang/json/bionic_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your digestive system has been outfitted with a series of filters and "
"processors, allowing you to reclaim waste liquid and, to a lesser degree, "
"nutrients.  The net effect is a greatly reduced need to eat and drink."
msgstr "Your digestive system has been outfitted with a series of filters and processors, allowing you to reclaim waste liquid and, to a lesser degree, nutrients.  The net effect is a greatly reduced need to eat and drink."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Remote Controller CBM"
msgid_plural "Remote Controller CBMs"
msgstr[0] "Remote Controller CBM"
msgstr[1] "Remote Controller CBMs"

#. ~ Description for Remote Controller CBM
#. ~ Description for Remote Controller
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py lang/json/bionic_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A small module connected to your brain allows you to interface with nearby "
"devices with wireless capabilities."
msgstr "A small module connected to your brain allows you to interface with nearby devices with wireless capabilities."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Sonic Resonator CBM"
msgid_plural "Sonic Resonator CBMs"
msgstr[0] "Sonic Resonator CBM"
msgstr[1] "Sonic Resonator CBMs"

#. ~ Description for Sonic Resonator CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your entire body may resonate at very high power, creating a short-range "
"shockwave.  While it will not do much damage to flexible creatures, stiff "
"items such as walls, doors, and even robots will be severely damaged."
msgstr "Your entire body may resonate at very high power, creating a short-range shockwave.  While it will not do much damage to flexible creatures, stiff items such as walls, doors, and even robots will be severely damaged."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Olfactory Mask CBM"
msgid_plural "Olfactory Mask CBMs"
msgstr[0] "Olfactory Mask CBM"
msgstr[1] "Olfactory Mask CBMs"

#. ~ Description for Olfactory Mask CBM
#. ~ Description for Olfactory Mask
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py lang/json/bionic_from_json.py
msgid ""
"While this system is powered, your body will produce very little odor, "
"making it nearly impossible for creatures to track you by scent."
msgstr "While this system is powered, your body will produce very little odor, making it nearly impossible for creatures to track you by scent."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Scent Vision CBM"
msgid_plural "Scent Vision CBMs"
msgstr[0] "Scent Vision CBM"
msgstr[1] "Scent Vision CBMs"

#. ~ Description for Scent Vision CBM
#. ~ Description for Scent Vision
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py lang/json/bionic_from_json.py
msgid ""
"While this system is powered, you're able to visually sense your own scent, "
"making it possible for you to recognize your surroundings even if you can't "
"see it."
msgstr "While this system is powered, you're able to visually sense your own scent, making it possible for you to recognize your surroundings even if you can't see it."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Electroshock Unit CBM"
msgid_plural "Electroshock Unit CBMs"
msgstr[0] "Electroshock Unit CBM"
msgstr[1] "Electroshock Unit CBMs"

#. ~ Description for Electroshock Unit CBM
#. ~ Description for Electroshock Unit
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py lang/json/bionic_from_json.py
msgid ""
"While fighting unarmed, or with a weapon that conducts electricity, there is"
" a chance that a successful hit will shock your opponent, inflicting extra "
"damage and disabling them temporarily at the cost of some energy."
msgstr "While fighting unarmed, or with a weapon that conducts electricity, there is a chance that a successful hit will shock your opponent, inflicting extra damage and disabling them temporarily at the cost of some energy."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Shockwave Generator CBM"
msgid_plural "Shockwave Generator CBMs"
msgstr[0] "Shockwave Generator CBM"
msgstr[1] "Shockwave Generator CBMs"

#. ~ Description for Shockwave Generator CBM
#. ~ Description for Shockwave Generator
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py lang/json/bionic_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You generate a powerful shockwave, knocking back all nearby creatures.  "
"Targets are stunned briefly, take damage and additional stun upon impact "
"with impassable terrain, and knockback any creatures they collide with."
msgstr "You generate a powerful shockwave, knocking back all nearby creatures.  Targets are stunned briefly, take damage and additional stun upon impact with impassable terrain, and knockback any creatures they collide with."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Solar Panels CBM"
msgid_plural "Solar Panels CBMs"
msgstr[0] "Solar Panels CBM"
msgstr[1] "Solar Panels CBMs"

#. ~ Description for Solar Panels CBM
#. ~ Description for Solar Panels
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py lang/json/bionic_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You have a few solar panels installed.  While in direct sunlight, your power"
" level will slowly recharge."
msgstr "You have a few solar panels installed.  While in direct sunlight, your power level will slowly recharge."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Synaptic Accelerator CBM"
msgid_plural "Synaptic Accelerator CBMs"
msgstr[0] "Synaptic Accelerator CBM"
msgstr[1] "Synaptic Accelerator CBMs"

#. ~ Description for Synaptic Accelerator CBM
#. ~ Description for Synaptic Accelerator
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py lang/json/bionic_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"Your nervous system has been enhanced with bionic stimulators, giving you a "
"10% boost to your speed."
msgstr "Your nervous system has been enhanced with bionic stimulators, giving you a 10% boost to your speed."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Internal Storage CBM"
msgid_plural "Internal Storage CBMs"
msgstr[0] "Internal Storage CBM"
msgstr[1] "Internal Storage CBMs"

#. ~ Description for Internal Storage CBM
#. ~ Description for Internal Storage
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py lang/json/bionic_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Space inside your chest cavity has been converted into a storage area.  You "
"may carry an extra 8 units of volume."
msgstr "Space inside your chest cavity has been converted into a storage area.  You may carry an extra 8 units of volume."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Muscle Augmentation CBM"
msgid_plural "Muscle Augmentation CBMs"
msgstr[0] "Muscle Augmentation CBM"
msgstr[1] "Muscle Augmentation CBMs"

#. ~ Description for Muscle Augmentation CBM
#. ~ Description for Muscle Augmentation
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py lang/json/bionic_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your muscular system has been enhanced with myomer fibers, giving you a +2 "
"bonus to strength."
msgstr "Your muscular system has been enhanced with myomer fibers, giving you a +2 bonus to strength."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Anti-Glare Compensators CBM"
msgid_plural "Anti-Glare Compensators CBMs"
msgstr[0] "Anti-Glare Compensators CBM"
msgstr[1] "Anti-Glare Compensators CBMs"

#. ~ Description for Anti-Glare Compensators CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your eyes have high-power, quick-reacting transition lenses installed over "
"them, negating any glare penalties and protecting you from bright flashes "
"including those of a welder.  Additionally you can toggle them to block out "
"all light."
msgstr "Your eyes have high-power, quick-reacting transition lenses installed over them, negating any glare penalties and protecting you from bright flashes including those of a welder.  Additionally you can toggle them to block out all light."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Targeting System CBM"
msgid_plural "Targeting System CBMs"
msgstr[0] "Targeting System CBM"
msgstr[1] "Targeting System CBMs"

#. ~ Description for Targeting System CBM
#. ~ Description for Targeting System
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py lang/json/bionic_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your eyes are equipped with range finders, and their movement is synced with"
" that of your arms, to a degree.  Shots you fire will be much more accurate,"
" particularly at long range."
msgstr "Your eyes are equipped with range finders, and their movement is synced with that of your arms, to a degree.  Shots you fire will be much more accurate, particularly at long range."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Teleportation Unit CBM"
msgid_plural "Teleportation Unit CBMs"
msgstr[0] "Teleportation Unit CBM"
msgstr[1] "Teleportation Unit CBMs"

#. ~ Description for Teleportation Unit CBM
#. ~ Description for Teleportation Unit
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py lang/json/bionic_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This highly experimental unit folds space over short distances, instantly "
"transporting your body up to 25 feet at the cost of much power.  Note that "
"prolonged or frequent use may have dangerous side effects."
msgstr "This highly experimental unit folds space over short distances, instantly transporting your body up to 25 feet at the cost of much power.  Note that prolonged or frequent use may have dangerous side effects."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Time Dilation CBM"
msgid_plural "Time Dilation CBMs"
msgstr[0] "Time Dilation CBM"
msgstr[1] "Time Dilation CBMs"

#. ~ Description for Time Dilation CBM
#. ~ Description for Time Dilation
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py lang/json/bionic_from_json.py
msgid ""
"At an immense cost of power, you may increase your body speed and reactions "
"dramatically, essentially freezing time.  You are still delicate, however, "
"and violent or rapid movements may damage you due to friction."
msgstr "At an immense cost of power, you may increase your body speed and reactions dramatically, essentially freezing time.  You are still delicate, however, and violent or rapid movements may damage you due to friction."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Integrated Toolset CBM"
msgid_plural "Integrated Toolset CBMs"
msgstr[0] "Integrated Toolset CBM"
msgstr[1] "Integrated Toolset CBMs"

#. ~ Description for Integrated Toolset CBM
#. ~ Description for Integrated Toolset
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py lang/json/bionic_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Implanted in your hands and fingers is a complete tool set - screwdriver, "
"hammer, wrench, and heating elements.  You can use this in place of many "
"tools when crafting."
msgstr "Implanted in your hands and fingers is a complete tool set - screwdriver, hammer, wrench, and heating elements.  You can use this in place of many tools when crafting."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Joint Torsion Ratchet CBM"
msgid_plural "Joint Torsion Ratchet CBMs"
msgstr[0] "Joint Torsion Ratchet CBM"
msgstr[1] "Joint Torsion Ratchet CBMs"

#. ~ Description for Joint Torsion Ratchet CBM
#. ~ Description for Joint Torsion Ratchet
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py lang/json/bionic_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your joints have been equipped with torsion ratchets that generate power "
"slowly when you move."
msgstr "Your joints have been equipped with torsion ratchets that generate power slowly when you move."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Uncanny Dodge CBM"
msgid_plural "Uncanny Dodge CBMs"
msgstr[0] "Uncanny Dodge CBM"
msgstr[1] "Uncanny Dodge CBMs"

#. ~ Description for Uncanny Dodge CBM
#. ~ Description for Uncanny Dodge
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py lang/json/bionic_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your nervous system has been augmented with bionic processors, allowing you "
"to dodge attacks beyond normal human capability, including bullets."
msgstr "Your nervous system has been augmented with bionic processors, allowing you to dodge attacks beyond normal human capability, including bullets."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Unified Power System CBM"
msgid_plural "Unified Power System CBMs"
msgstr[0] "Unified Power System CBM"
msgstr[1] "Unified Power System CBMs"

#. ~ Description for Unified Power System CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A UPS fully integrated with your bionic power system.  Allows you to run "
"devices requiring a UPS off of your internal power, which is much more "
"efficient than standard battery power."
msgstr "A UPS fully integrated with your bionic power system.  Allows you to run devices requiring a UPS off of your internal power, which is much more efficient than standard battery power."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Internal Chronometer CBM"
msgid_plural "Internal Chronometer CBMs"
msgstr[0] "Internal Chronometer CBM"
msgstr[1] "Internal Chronometer CBMs"

#. ~ Description for Internal Chronometer CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You have been equipped with an internal atomic clock, ensuring that you will"
" always know the current time."
msgstr "You have been equipped with an internal atomic clock, ensuring that you will always know the current time."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Water Extraction Unit CBM"
msgid_plural "Water Extraction Unit CBMs"
msgstr[0] "Water Extraction Unit CBM"
msgstr[1] "Water Extraction Unit CBMs"

#. ~ Description for Water Extraction Unit CBM
#. ~ Description for Water Extraction Unit
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py lang/json/bionic_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Nanotubes embedded in the palm of your hand will pump any available fluid "
"out of a dead body, cleanse it of impurities and convert it into drinkable "
"water.  You must, however, have a container to store the water in."
msgstr "Nanotubes embedded in the palm of your hand will pump any available fluid out of a dead body, cleanse it of impurities and convert it into drinkable water.  You must, however, have a container to store the water in."

#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid "Lessons for the Novice Bowhunter"
msgid_plural "Lessons for the Novice Bowhunter"
msgstr[0] "Lessons for the Novice Bowhunter"
msgstr[1] "Lessons for the Novice Bowhunter"

#. ~ Description for Lessons for the Novice Bowhunter
#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This hefty paperback book contains all the information needed for novice "
"archers to get started hunting with a variety of bows and crossbows."
msgstr "This hefty paperback book contains all the information needed for novice archers to get started hunting with a variety of bows and crossbows."

#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid "Archery for Kids"
msgid_plural "Archery for Kids"
msgstr[0] "Archery for Kids"
msgstr[1] "Archery for Kids"

#. ~ Description for Archery for Kids
#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Will you be able to place the arrow right into the bullseye?  It is not that"
