"mend existing damage.  It can heal bleeding, cleanse wounds, stave off "
"infection, and purge a handful of mundane diseases."
msgstr "A strange reddish liquid that gives off a sweet smell.  The elixir of life, or merely a mimicry?  Drinking this will cure a number of things, but can't mend existing damage.  It can heal bleeding, cleanse wounds, stave off infection, and purge a handful of mundane diseases."

