"feeds on chemicals found within gasoline.  The digestion process turns the "
"result incredibly viscous which, when threats come near, is launched; "
"ensnaring anything it hits.  The amorphous mass can be shaped and attached "
"at your touch, but the weapon itself is inert without something to control "
"it."
msgstr "A living blob turned into an autonomous weapon.  A rather picky eater, it feeds on chemicals found within gasoline.  The digestion process turns the result incredibly viscous which, when threats come near, is launched; ensnaring anything it hits.  The amorphous mass can be shaped and attached at your touch, but the weapon itself is inert without something to control it."

#: lang/json/GUN_from_json.py lang/json/vehicle_part_from_json.py
msgid "acid puffer"
msgid_plural "acid puffers"
msgstr[0] "acid puffer"
msgstr[1] "acid puffers"

#. ~ Description for acid puffer
#: lang/json/GUN_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A living blob turned into an autonomous weapon.  A filter feeder, the "
"digestion process produces highly acidic byproducts; which is then expelled "
"at any nearby enemies.  The amorphous mass can be shaped and attached at "
"your touch, but the weapon itself is inert without something to control it."
msgstr "A living blob turned into an autonomous weapon.  A filter feeder, the digestion process produces highly acidic byproducts; which is then expelled at any nearby enemies.  The amorphous mass can be shaped and attached at your touch, but the weapon itself is inert without something to control it."

#: lang/json/GUN_from_json.py
msgid "amorphous heart"
msgid_plural "amorphous hearts"
msgstr[0] "amorphous heart"
msgstr[1] "amorphous hearts"

#. ~ Description for amorphous heart
#: lang/json/GUN_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This amorphous mass seems to have finished developing; its advanced internal"
" structures testifying to that.  It is capable of locomotion through "
"internal hydraulic pressure, capable of moving substantial loads, and, in an"
" astounding display of intelligence, is capable of manipulating anything "
"it's attached to, whether blob-based or otherwise, through extended "
"pseudopods.  You think you might be able to manipulate it, and through it, "
"all its attached parts.  Though to do so you'll have to position yourself to"
" be in contact with it; and it appears unnervingly willing to accomodate "
"you..."
msgstr "This amorphous mass seems to have finished developing; its advanced internal structures testifying to that.  It is capable of locomotion through internal hydraulic pressure, capable of moving substantial loads, and, in an astounding display of intelligence, is capable of manipulating anything it's attached to, whether blob-based or otherwise, through extended pseudopods.  You think you might be able to manipulate it, and through it, all its attached parts.  Though to do so you'll have to position yourself to be in contact with it; and it appears unnervingly willing to accomodate you..."

#: lang/json/GUN_from_json.py lang/json/vehicle_part_from_json.py
msgid "gel spiker"
msgid_plural "gel spikers"
msgstr[0] "gel spiker"
msgstr[1] "gel spikers"

#. ~ Description for gel spiker
#: lang/json/GUN_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A living blob turned into an autonomous weapon.  Capable of calcifying large"
" numbers of fang-like fragments within itself.  It hurls groups of these "
"fragments along with a small portion of itself.  When it reaches its "
"destination, the detached remains shoot these fragments in all directions, "
"expiring in the process.  The amorphous mass can be shaped and attached at "
"your touch, but the weapon itself is inert without something to control it."
msgstr "A living blob turned into an autonomous weapon.  Capable of calcifying large numbers of fang-like fragments within itself.  It hurls groups of these fragments along with a small portion of itself.  When it reaches its destination, the detached remains shoot these fragments in all directions, expiring in the process.  The amorphous mass can be shaped and attached at your touch, but the weapon itself is inert without something to control it."

#: lang/json/GUN_from_json.py lang/json/vehicle_part_from_json.py
msgid "gel lancer"
msgid_plural "gel lancers"
msgstr[0] "gel lancer"
msgstr[1] "gel lancers"

#. ~ Description for gel lancer
#: lang/json/GUN_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A living blob turned into an autonomous weapon.  Evolving incredible "
"abilities of perception, it is capable of locating and discerning possible "
"threats within a large radius.  When a potential threat is located, it fires"
" a small, calcified projectile with incredible speed and accuracy.  The "
"amorphous mass can be shaped and attached at your touch, but the weapon "
"itself is inert without something to control it."
msgstr "A living blob turned into an autonomous weapon.  Evolving incredible abilities of perception, it is capable of locating and discerning possible threats within a large radius.  When a potential threat is located, it fires a small, calcified projectile with incredible speed and accuracy.  The amorphous mass can be shaped and attached at your touch, but the weapon itself is inert without something to control it."

#: lang/json/GUN_from_json.py lang/json/vehicle_part_from_json.py
msgid "gel razor"
msgid_plural "gel razors"
msgstr[0] "gel razor"
msgstr[1] "gel razors"

#. ~ Description for gel razor
#: lang/json/GUN_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A living blob turned into an autonomous weapon.  An enhanced metabolism "
"allows it to calcify large. toothy discs that is then launched towards any "
"nearby threats.  The amorphous mass can be shaped and attached at your "
"touch, but the weapon itself is inert without something to control it."
msgstr "A living blob turned into an autonomous weapon.  An enhanced metabolism allows it to calcify large. toothy discs that is then launched towards any nearby threats.  The amorphous mass can be shaped and attached at your touch, but the weapon itself is inert without something to control it."

#: lang/json/GUN_from_json.py lang/json/vehicle_part_from_json.py
msgid "shock bulb"
msgid_plural "shock bulbs"
msgstr[0] "shock bulb"
msgstr[1] "shock bulbs"

#. ~ Description for shock bulb
#: lang/json/GUN_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A living blob turned into an autonomous weapon.  Shockingly, it somehow is "
"able to project electricity, which it then discharges at any nearby threats."
"  The amorphous mass can be shaped and attached at your touch, but the "
"weapon itself is inert without something to control it."
msgstr "A living blob turned into an autonomous weapon.  Shockingly, it somehow is able to project electricity, which it then discharges at any nearby threats.  The amorphous mass can be shaped and attached at your touch, but the weapon itself is inert without something to control it."

#: lang/json/GUN_from_json.py lang/json/vehicle_part_from_json.py
msgid "gel puffer"
msgid_plural "gel puffers"
msgstr[0] "gel puffer"
msgstr[1] "gel puffers"

#. ~ Description for gel puffer
#: lang/json/GUN_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A living blob turned into an autonomous weapon.  A filter feeder, it strips "
"any water it processes of nutrients and expels the remainder towards any "
"nearby threats.  The process of filter-feeding also makes the remaining "
"liquid viscous, though it also dissipates fairly quickly.  The amorphous "
"mass can be shaped and attached at your touch, but the weapon itself is "
"inert without something to control it."
msgstr "A living blob turned into an autonomous weapon.  A filter feeder, it strips any water it processes of nutrients and expels the remainder towards any nearby threats.  The process of filter-feeding also makes the remaining liquid viscous, though it also dissipates fairly quickly.  The amorphous mass can be shaped and attached at your touch, but the weapon itself is inert without something to control it."

#: lang/json/GUN_from_json.py lang/json/vehicle_part_from_json.py
msgid "fire puffer"
msgid_plural "fire puffers"
msgstr[0] "fire puffer"
msgstr[1] "fire puffers"

#. ~ Description for fire puffer
#: lang/json/GUN_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A living blob turned into an autonomous weapon.  A rather picky eater, it "
"feeds on chemicals found within gasoline.  The digested material is still "
"highly flammable, and when launched, also activates an ignition gland "
"located on the outer membrane.  The amorphous mass can be shaped and "
"attached at your touch, but the weapon itself is inert without something to "
"control it."
msgstr "A living blob turned into an autonomous weapon.  A rather picky eater, it feeds on chemicals found within gasoline.  The digested material is still highly flammable, and when launched, also activates an ignition gland located on the outer membrane.  The amorphous mass can be shaped and attached at your touch, but the weapon itself is inert without something to control it."

#: lang/json/GUN_from_json.py lang/json/vehicle_part_from_json.py
msgid "spark blight"
msgid_plural "spark blights"
msgstr[0] "spark blight"
msgstr[1] "spark blights"

#. ~ Description for spark blight
#: lang/json/GUN_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A living blob turned into an autonomous weapon.  It is capable of storing "
"energy from sunlight inside itself in the forme of electricity.  Then, in a "
"truly baffling show of force, projects a highly concentrated stream of "
"electricity towards any possible threats.  The amorphous mass can be shaped "
"and attached at your touch, but the weapon itself is inert without something"
" to control it."
msgstr "A living blob turned into an autonomous weapon.  It is capable of storing energy from sunlight inside itself in the forme of electricity.  Then, in a truly baffling show of force, projects a highly concentrated stream of electricity towards any possible threats.  The amorphous mass can be shaped and attached at your touch, but the weapon itself is inert without something to control it."

#: lang/json/GUN_from_json.py lang/json/vehicle_part_from_json.py
msgid "diamond lance"
msgid_plural "diamond lances"
msgstr[0] "diamond lance"
msgstr[1] "diamond lances"

#. ~ Description for diamond lance
#: lang/json/GUN_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A weapon that is as deadly as it is dazzling.  The diamond matrix in this "
"weapon's center acts as a catalyst; rapidly changing carbon-heavy materials "
"into a crystalline substance that is nearly equal to diamond in hardness.  "
"The substance rapidly decays when separated from the catalyst; thus a pre-"
"shaped lump of carbon is brought into contact with the matrix, immediately "
"crystallized and launched just as quickly.  The launcher requires a "
"specialized chassis in order to be brought to bear on its unfortunate "
"targets."
msgstr "A weapon that is as deadly as it is dazzling.  The diamond matrix in this weapon's center acts as a catalyst; rapidly changing carbon-heavy materials into a crystalline substance that is nearly equal to diamond in hardness.  The substance rapidly decays when separated from the catalyst; thus a pre-shaped lump of carbon is brought into contact with the matrix, immediately crystallized and launched just as quickly.  The launcher requires a specialized chassis in order to be brought to bear on its unfortunate targets."

#: lang/json/GUN_from_json.py lang/json/vehicle_part_from_json.py
msgid "diamond nova"
msgid_plural "diamond novas"
msgstr[0] "diamond nova"
msgstr[1] "diamond novas"

#. ~ Description for diamond nova
#: lang/json/GUN_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A weapon that is as deadly as it is dazzling.  The diamond matrix in this "
"weapon's center acts as a catalyst; rapidly changing carbon-heavy materials "
"into a crystalline substance that is nearly equal to diamond in hardness.  "
"The substance rapidly decays when separated from the catalyst, and at  sizes"
" as large as the projectile used, also rapidly decays when in contact with "
"other matter. Thus the projectile is held and launched by the use of "
"pressurized air from a vortex stone.  Upon striking its target, the "
"projectile undergoes explosive decomposition; shattering into a brilliant "
"burst of diamond fragments."
msgstr "A weapon that is as deadly as it is dazzling.  The diamond matrix in this weapon's center acts as a catalyst; rapidly changing carbon-heavy materials into a crystalline substance that is nearly equal to diamond in hardness.  The substance rapidly decays when separated from the catalyst, and at  sizes as large as the projectile used, also rapidly decays when in contact with other matter. Thus the projectile is held and launched by the use of pressurized air from a vortex stone.  Upon striking its target, the projectile undergoes explosive decomposition; shattering into a brilliant burst of diamond fragments."

#: lang/json/GUN_from_json.py lang/json/vehicle_part_from_json.py
msgid "vortex accelerator"
msgid_plural "vortex accelerators"
msgstr[0] "vortex accelerator"
msgstr[1] "vortex accelerators"

#. ~ Description for vortex accelerator
#: lang/json/GUN_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This weapon uses powerful bursts of air to launch sharp fragments at its "
"target at high speed.  You'll need some form of platform to mount it on."
msgstr "This weapon uses powerful bursts of air to launch sharp fragments at its target at high speed.  You'll need some form of platform to mount it on."

#: lang/json/GUN_from_json.py lang/json/vehicle_part_from_json.py
msgid "vortex bolter"
msgid_plural "vortex bolters"
msgstr[0] "vortex bolter"
msgstr[1] "vortex bolters"

#. ~ Description for vortex bolter
#: lang/json/GUN_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This weapon uses powerful bursts of air to launch bolts at its target at "
"high speed.  You'll need some form of platform to mount it on."
msgstr "This weapon uses powerful bursts of air to launch bolts at its target at high speed.  You'll need some form of platform to mount it on."

#: lang/json/GUN_from_json.py lang/json/vehicle_part_from_json.py
msgid "vortex cannon"
msgid_plural "vortex cannons"
msgstr[0] "vortex cannon"
msgstr[1] "vortex cannons"

#. ~ Description for vortex cannon
#: lang/json/GUN_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Essentially a large pneumatic gun made to hurl sharpened metal rails.  "
"Instead of a mechanical system, you've managed to harness the vortex to "
"power this gun.  While powerful for its size, you'll need some form of "
"platform to mount it on."
msgstr "Essentially a large pneumatic gun made to hurl sharpened metal rails.  Instead of a mechanical system, you've managed to harness the vortex to power this gun.  While powerful for its size, you'll need some form of platform to mount it on."

#: lang/json/GUN_from_json.py lang/json/vehicle_part_from_json.py
msgid "vortex rifle"
msgid_plural "vortex rifles"
msgstr[0] "vortex rifle"
msgstr[1] "vortex rifles"

#. ~ Description for vortex rifle
#: lang/json/GUN_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This weapon uses powerful bursts of air to launch small projectiles at its "
"target at high speed.  You'll need some form of platform to mount it on."
msgstr "This weapon uses powerful bursts of air to launch small projectiles at its target at high speed.  You'll need some form of platform to mount it on."

#: lang/json/GUN_from_json.py
msgid "storm bolter"
msgid_plural "storm bolters"
msgstr[0] "storm bolter"
msgstr[1] "storm bolters"

#. ~ Description for storm bolter
#: lang/json/GUN_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This pneumatic bolt thrower has been greatly enhanced, allowing multiple "
"bolts to be launched accurately and in quick succession.  It requires a "
"support of some sort in order to be operated."
msgstr "This pneumatic bolt thrower has been greatly enhanced, allowing multiple bolts to be launched accurately and in quick succession.  It requires a support of some sort in order to be operated."

#: lang/json/GUN_from_json.py
msgid "slingshot cannon"
msgid_plural "slingshot cannons"
msgstr[0] "slingshot cannon"
msgstr[1] "slingshot cannons"

#. ~ Description for slingshot cannon
#: lang/json/GUN_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Essentially several long drawstrings held by two long, reinforced sides and "
"a mechanism attached to a crank to draw and fire it.  It's deceptively "
"powerful and surprisingly accurate, but far too large to be used without "
"some sort of stable platform."
msgstr "Essentially several long drawstrings held by two long, reinforced sides and a mechanism attached to a crank to draw and fire it.  It's deceptively powerful and surprisingly accurate, but far too large to be used without some sort of stable platform."

#: lang/json/GUN_from_json.py
msgid "lacerator"
msgid_plural "lacerators"
msgstr[0] "lacerator"
msgstr[1] "lacerators"

#. ~ Description for lacerator
#: lang/json/GUN_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This weapon launches serrated metal disks at nearby enemies.  It draws its "
"power from a vehicle's engines, and thus must be mounted on such in order to"
" be operated."
msgstr "This weapon launches serrated metal disks at nearby enemies.  It draws its power from a vehicle's engines, and thus must be mounted on such in order to be operated."

#: lang/json/GUN_from_json.py
msgid "rotary cannon"
msgid_plural "rotary cannons"
msgstr[0] "rotary cannon"
msgstr[1] "rotary cannons"

#. ~ Description for rotary cannon
#: lang/json/GUN_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This fearsome weapon sports 3 barrels in a cyclic configuration.  A "
"specialized mechanism loads the otherwise troublesome rounds; allowing it to"
" be fired in quick succession.  However, this renders it incredibly "
"unwieldy, and it must be mounted on a support structure in order to be "
"fired."
msgstr "This fearsome weapon sports 3 barrels in a cyclic configuration.  A specialized mechanism loads the otherwise troublesome rounds; allowing it to be fired in quick succession.  However, this renders it incredibly unwieldy, and it must be mounted on a support structure in order to be fired."

#: lang/json/GUN_from_json.py
msgid "laser cannon"
msgid_plural "laser cannons"
msgstr[0] "laser cannon"
msgstr[1] "laser cannons"

#. ~ Description for laser cannon
#: lang/json/GUN_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This enhanced laser cannon sacrifices efficiency for destructive power.  The"
" increased power requirements require a significant power source and the "
"size of the firing mechanism also requires support."
msgstr "This enhanced laser cannon sacrifices efficiency for destructive power.  The increased power requirements require a significant power source and the size of the firing mechanism also requires support."

#: lang/json/GUN_from_json.py
msgid "pulse laser"
msgid_plural "pulse lasers"
msgstr[0] "pulse laser"
msgstr[1] "pulse lasers"

#. ~ Description for pulse laser
#: lang/json/GUN_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Augmented damage capability and rapid bursts make this a powerful weapon.  "
"The increased power requirements require a significant power source and the "
"firing mechanism also requires a specialized chassis."
msgstr "Augmented damage capability and rapid bursts make this a powerful weapon.  The increased power requirements require a significant power source and the firing mechanism also requires a specialized chassis."

#: lang/json/GUN_from_json.py
msgid "turbolaser cannon"
msgid_plural "turbolaser cannons"
msgstr[0] "turbolaser cannon"
msgstr[1] "turbolaser cannons"

#. ~ Description for turbolaser cannon
#: lang/json/GUN_from_json.py
msgid ""
"With an augmented emitter and capacitor, this mounted laser is capable of "
"superheating most materials to the point of exploding.  The firing mechanism"
" also requires the services of a specialized chassis, and one must be wary "
"of the prodigious power needs of such a weapon."
msgstr "With an augmented emitter and capacitor, this mounted laser is capable of superheating most materials to the point of exploding.  The firing mechanism also requires the services of a specialized chassis, and one must be wary of the prodigious power needs of such a weapon."

#: lang/json/GUN_from_json.py
msgid "perforator"
msgid_plural "perforators"
msgstr[0] "perforator"
msgstr[1] "perforators"

#. ~ Description for perforator
#: lang/json/GUN_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A coilgun with improved electromagnetic circuits to be able to propel a "
"metallic projectile at high speed and with great accuracy.  Capable of "
"piercing armor with little issue, though the projectile itself lacks damage "
"due to its small size.  It must be mounted on a specialized chassis in order"
" to be fired."
msgstr "A coilgun with improved electromagnetic circuits to be able to propel a metallic projectile at high speed and with great accuracy.  Capable of piercing armor with little issue, though the projectile itself lacks damage due to its small size.  It must be mounted on a specialized chassis in order to be fired."

#: lang/json/GUN_from_json.py
msgid "needler"
msgid_plural "needlers"
msgstr[0] "needler"
msgstr[1] "needlers"

#. ~ Description for needler
#: lang/json/GUN_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This improved nailgun features a special firing mechanism that is set to "
"fire a spread of up to 5 nails at once; sure to drop the hammer on its "
"unfortunate targets.  However, these features render it incredibly unwieldy,"
" and it must be mounted on a supporting frame in order to be fired."
msgstr "This improved nailgun features a special firing mechanism that is set to fire a spread of up to 5 nails at once; sure to drop the hammer on its unfortunate targets.  However, these features render it incredibly unwieldy, and it must be mounted on a supporting frame in order to be fired."

#: lang/json/GUN_from_json.py
msgid "hypervelocity driver"
msgid_plural "hypervelocity drivers"
msgstr[0] "hypervelocity driver"
msgstr[1] "hypervelocity drivers"

#. ~ Description for hypervelocity driver
#: lang/json/GUN_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A single-shot, electrically propelled, steel rail launcher.  The powerful, "
"and frankly dangerous, improvements made to the power systems of this weapon"
" is capable imbuing a massive charge into a single-rail; so much that it "
"often shatters into deadly fragments on impact.  It's capabilities are "
"limited by its prodigious power requirements however, and its large size "
"necessitates an appropriately-equipped vehicle."
msgstr "A single-shot, electrically propelled, steel rail launcher.  The powerful, and frankly dangerous, improvements made to the power systems of this weapon is capable imbuing a massive charge into a single-rail; so much that it often shatters into deadly fragments on impact.  It's capabilities are limited by its prodigious power requirements however, and its large size necessitates an appropriately-equipped vehicle."

#: lang/json/GUN_from_json.py
msgid "ripper"
msgid_plural "rippers"
msgstr[0] "ripper"
msgstr[1] "rippers"

#. ~ Description for ripper
#: lang/json/GUN_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This menacing weapon rapidly launches bladed disks that rips through enemies"
" with devastating effect.  It draws its power from a vehicle's engines, and "
"thus must be mounted on such in order to be operated."
msgstr "This menacing weapon rapidly launches bladed disks that rips through enemies with devastating effect.  It draws its power from a vehicle's engines, and thus must be mounted on such in order to be operated."

#: lang/json/GUN_from_json.py
msgid "rotary speargun"
msgid_plural "rotary spearguns"
msgstr[0] "rotary speargun"
msgstr[1] "rotary spearguns"

#. ~ Description for rotary speargun
#: lang/json/GUN_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This pneumatic speargun features a revolving barrel behind its launcher, "
"allowing projectiles to be rapidly loaded and fired.    However, the weight "
"requires an external support measure."
msgstr "This pneumatic speargun features a revolving barrel behind its launcher, allowing projectiles to be rapidly loaded and fired.    However, the weight requires an external support measure."

#: lang/json/GUN_from_json.py
msgid "scorpion ballista"
msgid_plural "scorpion ballistas"
msgstr[0] "scorpion ballista"
msgstr[1] "scorpion ballistas"

#. ~ Description for scorpion ballista
#: lang/json/GUN_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A massive tension-operated crossbow.  The hand-crank allows one to draw it "
"without the need for heavy labor.  It's far too massive to be used on foot, "
"and thus needs to be mounted on a vehicle in order to be operated."
msgstr "A massive tension-operated crossbow.  The hand-crank allows one to draw it without the need for heavy labor.  It's far too massive to be used on foot, and thus needs to be mounted on a vehicle in order to be operated."

#: lang/json/GUN_from_json.py
msgid "splintergun"
msgid_plural "splinterguns"
msgstr[0] "splintergun"
msgstr[1] "splinterguns"

#. ~ Description for splintergun
#: lang/json/GUN_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A heavily modified coilgun that fires tiny fragments of metal at high speeds"
" extremely quickly.  The resulting barrage is highly inaccurate, but can "
"turn unarmored targets into pulp.  It must be mounted on a specialized "
"chassis in order to be fired."
msgstr "A heavily modified coilgun that fires tiny fragments of metal at high speeds extremely quickly.  The resulting barrage is highly inaccurate, but can turn unarmored targets into pulp.  It must be mounted on a specialized chassis in order to be fired."

#: lang/json/GUN_from_json.py
msgid "harpoon gun"
msgid_plural "harpoon guns"
msgstr[0] "harpoon gun"
msgstr[1] "harpoon guns"

#. ~ Description for harpoon gun
#: lang/json/GUN_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A tension-operated speargun.  A hand-crank lets one draw the strings "
"quickly, but it's too unwieldly to handle without a support of some sort."
msgstr "A tension-operated speargun.  A hand-crank lets one draw the strings quickly, but it's too unwieldly to handle without a support of some sort."

#: lang/json/GUN_from_json.py
msgid "tesla cannon"
msgid_plural "tesla cannons"
msgstr[0] "tesla cannon"
msgstr[1] "tesla cannons"

#. ~ Description for tesla cannon
#: lang/json/GUN_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This alteration of the Chain Lightning bionic fires artificial lightning "
"bolts that arc to nearby enemies.  It must be attached to a large power "
"source, but it allows for much more powerful bolts."
msgstr "This alteration of the Chain Lightning bionic fires artificial lightning bolts that arc to nearby enemies.  It must be attached to a large power source, but it allows for much more powerful bolts."

#: lang/json/GUN_from_json.py
msgid "avalanche rifle"
msgid_plural "avalanche rifles"
msgstr[0] "avalanche rifle"
msgstr[1] "avalanche rifles"

#. ~ Description for avalanche rifle
#: lang/json/GUN_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This pneumatic assault rifle has been greatly enhanced, firing projectiles "
"faster and with higher velocity.  However, these features render it "
"incredibly unwieldy, and it must be mounted on a supporting platform in "
"order to be fired."
msgstr "This pneumatic assault rifle has been greatly enhanced, firing projectiles faster and with higher velocity.  However, these features render it incredibly unwieldy, and it must be mounted on a supporting platform in order to be fired."

#: lang/json/GUN_from_json.py
msgid "M6 Aircrew Survival Weapon"
msgid_plural "M6 Aircrew Survival Weapons"
msgstr[0] "M6 Aircrew Survival Weapon"
msgstr[1] "M6 Aircrew Survival Weapons"

#. ~ Description for M6 Aircrew Survival Weapon
#: lang/json/GUN_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A lightweight combination rifle, combining a .22 rimfire barrel with .410 "
"shotgun barrel, and designed to fold for compact storage.  Produced for "
"military aircraft pilots who might be stranded after a crash, later produced"
" commercially by various companies."
msgstr "A lightweight combination rifle, combining a .22 rimfire barrel with .410 shotgun barrel, and designed to fold for compact storage.  Produced for military aircraft pilots who might be stranded after a crash, later produced commercially by various companies."

#: lang/json/GUN_from_json.py
msgid "Colt Single Action Army"
msgid_plural "Colt Single Action Army"
msgstr[0] "Colt Single Action Army"
msgstr[1] "Colt Single Action Army"

#. ~ Description for Colt Single Action Army
#: lang/json/GUN_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Also known as the Peacemaker and M1873, the Colt Single Action Army is one "
"of the first revolvers to use a modern self-contained cartridge.  Made "
"famous by westerns, modern reproductions are still made for Cowboy Action "
"Shooting, and some deem them the greatest gun ever made."
msgstr "Also known as the Peacemaker and M1873, the Colt Single Action Army is one of the first revolvers to use a modern self-contained cartridge.  Made famous by westerns, modern reproductions are still made for Cowboy Action Shooting, and some deem them the greatest gun ever made."

#: lang/json/GUN_from_json.py
msgid "Colt Lightning .45"
msgid_plural "Colt Lightning .45"
msgstr[0] "Colt Lightning .45"
msgstr[1] "Colt Lightning .45"

#. ~ Description for Colt Lightning .45
#: lang/json/GUN_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A modern reproduction of a Colt pump-action rifle.  Originally chambered in "
".44-40, modern versions most commonly use .45 Long Colt, complimenting the "
"Single Action Army as a Cowboy Action Shooting firearm."
msgstr "A modern reproduction of a Colt pump-action rifle.  Originally chambered in .44-40, modern versions most commonly use .45 Long Colt, complimenting the Single Action Army as a Cowboy Action Shooting firearm."

#: lang/json/GUN_from_json.py
msgid "Bond Arms Derringer"
msgid_plural "Bond Arms Derringers"
msgstr[0] "Bond Arms Derringer"
msgstr[1] "Bond Arms Derringers"

#. ~ Description for Bond Arms Derringer
#: lang/json/GUN_from_json.py
