"A brass-plated alto saxophone with a neck strap, so you can wear it while "
"playing."
msgstr "A brass-plated alto saxophone with a neck strap, so you can wear it while playing."

#: lang/json/TOOL_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "shooter's earmuffs"
msgid_plural "shooter's earmuffs"
msgstr[0] "shooter's earmuffs"
msgstr[1] "shooter's earmuffs"

#. ~ Use action msg for shooter's earmuffs.
#: lang/json/TOOL_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "You turn the earmuffs on."
msgstr "You turn the earmuffs on."

#. ~ Use action need_charges_msg for shooter's earmuffs.
#: lang/json/TOOL_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "The earmuff's batteries are dead."
msgstr "The earmuff's batteries are dead."

#. ~ Description for shooter's earmuffs
#: lang/json/TOOL_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A pair of earmuffs favored by shooters.  The earmuffs are turned off.  They "
"will block sounds over a certain decibel amount, assuming it is charged with"
" batteries."
msgstr "A pair of earmuffs favored by shooters.  The earmuffs are turned off.  They will block sounds over a certain decibel amount, assuming it is charged with batteries."

#. ~ Description for shooter's earmuffs
#: lang/json/TOOL_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A pair of earmuffs favored by shooters.  The earmuffs are turned on.  They "
"will block sounds over a certain decibel amount, assuming it is charged with"
" batteries."
msgstr "A pair of earmuffs favored by shooters.  The earmuffs are turned on.  They will block sounds over a certain decibel amount, assuming it is charged with batteries."

#: lang/json/TOOL_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "stethoscope"
msgid_plural "stethoscopes"
msgstr[0] "stethoscope"
msgstr[1] "stethoscopes"

#. ~ Description for stethoscope
#: lang/json/TOOL_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a medical listening tool.  Use it to listen to things.  Closely."
msgstr "This is a medical listening tool.  Use it to listen to things.  Closely."

#: lang/json/TOOL_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "gilded aegis"
msgid_plural "gilded aegises"
msgstr[0] "gilded aegis"
msgstr[1] "gilded aegises"

#. ~ Description for gilded aegis
#: lang/json/TOOL_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A simple leather cloak, richly decorated with scales of gold and several "
"feathers.  It resembles the hide of a golden dragon or serpent.  Using it "
"will heal minor injuries, in exchange for inflicting pain."
msgstr "A simple leather cloak, richly decorated with scales of gold and several feathers.  It resembles the hide of a golden dragon or serpent.  Using it will heal minor injuries, in exchange for inflicting pain."

#: lang/json/TOOL_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "mask of insight"
msgid_plural "masks of insight"
msgstr[0] "mask of insight"
msgstr[1] "masks of insight"

#. ~ Use action msg for mask of insight.
#: lang/json/TOOL_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The mask appears to contort into a fearsome visage, the eyeholes momentarily"
" seeming to glow."
msgstr "The mask appears to contort into a fearsome visage, the eyeholes momentarily seeming to glow."

#. ~ Use action need_charges_msg for mask of insight.
#: lang/json/TOOL_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "Fuel the mask with consecrated essence, to open your eyes."
msgstr "Fuel the mask with consecrated essence, to open your eyes."

#. ~ Description for mask of insight
#: lang/json/TOOL_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A mask faced with iron and decorated with copper, depicting the face of some"
" unknown divine figure.  Fueling it with consecrated essence will grant the "
"wearer clairvoyance within a limited range, in exchange for blindness."
msgstr "A mask faced with iron and decorated with copper, depicting the face of some unknown divine figure.  Fueling it with consecrated essence will grant the wearer clairvoyance within a limited range, in exchange for blindness."

#: lang/json/TOOL_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "mask of insight (on)"
msgid_plural "masks of insight (on)"
msgstr[0] "mask of insight (on)"
msgstr[1] "masks of insight (on)"

#. ~ Use action msg for mask of insight (on).
#: lang/json/TOOL_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "The mask's features return to its original impassive expression."
msgstr "The mask's features return to its original impassive expression."

#. ~ Description for mask of insight (on)
#: lang/json/TOOL_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A mask faced with iron and decorated with copper, depicting the face of some"
" unknown divine figure.  The face depicted on the mask seems more menacing "
"than it did previously."
msgstr "A mask faced with iron and decorated with copper, depicting the face of some unknown divine figure.  The face depicted on the mask seems more menacing than it did previously."

#: lang/json/TOOL_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "wyrmskin armor"
msgid_plural "wyrmskin armors"
msgstr[0] "wyrmskin armor"
msgstr[1] "wyrmskin armors"

#. ~ Description for wyrmskin armor
#: lang/json/TOOL_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A set of leather armor decorated with jade, with serpentine patterns sewn "
"into it.  Using it will conjure a spray of acid."
msgstr "A set of leather armor decorated with jade, with serpentine patterns sewn into it.  Using it will conjure a spray of acid."

#: lang/json/TOOL_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "revenant crown"
msgid_plural "revenant crowns"
msgstr[0] "revenant crown"
msgstr[1] "revenant crowns"

#. ~ Use action activation_message for revenant crown.
#: lang/json/TOOL_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The diamond shimmers with malevolent red light as you feel a strange hunger,"
" a craving for rotting meat and stagnant water..."
msgstr "The diamond shimmers with malevolent red light as you feel a strange hunger, a craving for rotting meat and stagnant water..."

#. ~ Description for revenant crown
#: lang/json/TOOL_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A wicked-looking crown made of silver, decorated with scenes of skeletons in"
" a \"danse macabre\" motif.  A single diamond adorns it, in the center of "
"the scene depicted.  Using it shall yield immunity to food poisoning and "
"parasites, in exchange for increased hunger.  It will not cure existing "
"ailments, only prevent them."
msgstr "A wicked-looking crown made of silver, decorated with scenes of skeletons in a \"danse macabre\" motif.  A single diamond adorns it, in the center of the scene depicted.  Using it shall yield immunity to food poisoning and parasites, in exchange for increased hunger.  It will not cure existing ailments, only prevent them."

#: lang/json/TOOL_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "mantle of shadows"
msgid_plural "mantles of shadows"
msgstr[0] "mantle of shadows"
msgstr[1] "mantles of shadows"

#. ~ Use action msg for mantle of shadows.
#: lang/json/TOOL_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The robe's fabric darkens to a rich shade of black, cloaking your "
"surroundings in a flickering illusion."
msgstr "The robe's fabric darkens to a rich shade of black, cloaking your surroundings in a flickering illusion."

#. ~ Use action need_charges_msg for mantle of shadows.
#: lang/json/TOOL_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "The mantle requires essence to bring forth the night."
msgstr "The mantle requires essence to bring forth the night."

#. ~ Description for mantle of shadows
#: lang/json/TOOL_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A loose-fitting robe of some sort, heavily altered and decorated with "
"patches of fur, dyed in a simple dark gray.  Using it will grant "
"invisibility, draining essence quickly."
msgstr "A loose-fitting robe of some sort, heavily altered and decorated with patches of fur, dyed in a simple dark gray.  Using it will grant invisibility, draining essence quickly."

#: lang/json/TOOL_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "mantle of shadows (on)"
msgid_plural "mantles of shadows (on)"
msgstr[0] "mantle of shadows (on)"
msgstr[1] "mantles of shadows (on)"

#. ~ Use action msg for mantle of shadows (on).
#: lang/json/TOOL_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The robe's fabric returns to its normal gray color, dispelling the illusion."
msgstr "The robe's fabric returns to its normal gray color, dispelling the illusion."

#. ~ Description for mantle of shadows (on)
#: lang/json/TOOL_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A loose-fitting robe of some sort, heavily altered and decorated with "
"patches of fur.  The air wavers around it, barely noticeable to you."
msgstr "A loose-fitting robe of some sort, heavily altered and decorated with patches of fur.  The air wavers around it, barely noticeable to you."

#: lang/json/TOOL_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "pair of thunder gauntlets"
msgid_plural "pairs of thunder gauntlets"
msgstr[0] "pair of thunder gauntlets"
msgstr[1] "pairs of thunder gauntlets"

#. ~ Description for pair of thunder gauntlets
#: lang/json/TOOL_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A heavy set of plate gauntlets, decorated with silver around the edges of "
"each individual plate.  Touching the bare metal sends a faint electric "
"tingle through you.  Use them to give something a shocking surprise, if "
"you're in melee range."
msgstr "A heavy set of plate gauntlets, decorated with silver around the edges of each individual plate.  Touching the bare metal sends a faint electric tingle through you.  Use them to give something a shocking surprise, if you're in melee range."

#: lang/json/TOOL_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "ring of the fallen angel"
msgid_plural "rings of the fallen angel"
msgstr[0] "ring of the fallen angel"
msgstr[1] "rings of the fallen angel"

#. ~ Use action activation_message for ring of the fallen angel.
#: lang/json/TOOL_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A strange energy radiates from the ring's gem, spreading a calming sensation"
" over you."
msgstr "A strange energy radiates from the ring's gem, spreading a calming sensation over you."

#. ~ Description for ring of the fallen angel
#: lang/json/TOOL_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A simple silver ring, adorned with a small red gem and a wing motif.  Using "
"it cures several anomalous ailments, and provides protection from such "
"effects for a while."
msgstr "A simple silver ring, adorned with a small red gem and a wing motif.  Using it cures several anomalous ailments, and provides protection from such effects for a while."

#: lang/json/TOOL_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "zuicide vest"
msgid_plural "zuicide vests"
msgstr[0] "zuicide vest"
msgstr[1] "zuicide vests"

#. ~ Description for zuicide vest
#: lang/json/TOOL_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A leather vest with high explosives sewn into it.  Activate it to prime the "
"explosives, and a short time later it will blow.  Virgins not included."
msgstr "A leather vest with high explosives sewn into it.  Activate it to prime the explosives, and a short time later it will blow.  Virgins not included."

#. ~ Use action sound_msg for zuicide vest.
#: lang/json/TOOL_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "-tcka- -tcka-."
msgstr "-tcka- -tcka-."

#. ~ Use action no_deactivate_msg for zuicide vest.
#: lang/json/TOOL_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "COWARD!!"
msgstr "COWARD!!"

#. ~ Description for zuicide vest
#: lang/json/TOOL_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "An active zuicide vest..."
msgstr "An active zuicide vest..."

#: lang/json/TOOL_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "small purse"
msgid_plural "small purses"
msgstr[0] "small purse"
msgstr[1] "small purses"

#. ~ Description for small purse
#: lang/json/TOOL_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Boiled, salted, coated in wax, and run along with thread, this fluid sac is "
"now a usable purse.  It can even seal fluids within, and be used to craft "
"basic fluid bombs."
msgstr "Boiled, salted, coated in wax, and run along with thread, this fluid sac is now a usable purse.  It can even seal fluids within, and be used to craft basic fluid bombs."

#: lang/json/TOOL_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "sealed purse of clean water"
msgid_plural "sealed purse of clean waters"
msgstr[0] "sealed purse of clean water"
msgstr[1] "sealed purse of clean waters"

#. ~ Description for sealed purse of clean water
#: lang/json/TOOL_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "A sealed purse of water.  activate to consume its contents."
msgstr "A sealed purse of water.  activate to consume its contents."

#. ~ Description for radiation biomonitor
#: lang/json/TOOL_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A battery-powered biometric safety device worn on the wrist.  Activate to "
"check your current level of radiation exposure."
msgstr "A battery-powered biometric safety device worn on the wrist.  Activate to check your current level of radiation exposure."

#: lang/json/TOOL_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "berserker stimpack"
msgid_plural "berserker stimpacks"
msgstr[0] "berserker stimpack"
msgstr[1] "berserker stimpacks"

#. ~ Use action msg for berserker stimpack.
#: lang/json/TOOL_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "You insert the needle into your vein and your blood boils!"
msgstr "You insert the needle into your vein and your blood boils!"

#. ~ Description for berserker stimpack
#: lang/json/TOOL_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An iv drip in a protective case.  PRM patented stimulants will push the body"
" to its limits for a brief period, making intense combat easier."
msgstr "An iv drip in a protective case.  PRM patented stimulants will push the body to its limits for a brief period, making intense combat easier."

#: lang/json/TOOL_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "berserker stimpack (active)"
msgid_plural "berserker stimpack (active)s"
msgstr[0] "berserker stimpack (active)"
msgstr[1] "berserker stimpack (active)s"

#. ~ Description for berserker stimpack (active)
#: lang/json/TOOL_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An iv drip in a protective case.  Inside, PRM brand chemicals are surging "
"through the needle, providing incredible strength and agility to its user."
msgstr "An iv drip in a protective case.  Inside, PRM brand chemicals are surging through the needle, providing incredible strength and agility to its user."

#: lang/json/TOOL_from_json.py
msgid "integrated toolset"
msgid_plural "integrated toolsets"
msgstr[0] "integrated toolset"
msgstr[1] "integrated toolsets"

#: lang/json/TOOL_from_json.py
msgid "bionic goggles"
msgid_plural "bionic goggless"
msgstr[0] "bionic goggles"
msgstr[1] "bionic goggless"

#: lang/json/TOOL_from_json.py
msgid "bionic razor"
msgid_plural "bionic razors"
msgstr[0] "bionic razor"
msgstr[1] "bionic razors"

#: lang/json/TOOL_from_json.py
msgid "cash card"
msgid_plural "cash cards"
msgstr[0] "cash card"
msgstr[1] "cash cards"

#. ~ Description for cash card
#: lang/json/TOOL_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A yellow plastic card used to store money.  These became popular once the "
"government officially moved to all electronic money.  It holds up to 2 "
"million dollars."
msgstr "A yellow plastic card used to store money.  These became popular once the government officially moved to all electronic money.  It holds up to 2 million dollars."

#: lang/json/TOOL_from_json.py
msgid "silver gas discount card"
msgid_plural "silver gas discount cards"
msgstr[0] "silver gas discount card"
msgstr[1] "silver gas discount cards"

#. ~ Description for silver gas discount card
#: lang/json/TOOL_from_json.py
msgid "This card gives you a little discount on the purchase of gasoline."
msgstr "This card gives you a little discount on the purchase of gasoline."

#: lang/json/TOOL_from_json.py
msgid "gold gas discount card"
msgid_plural "gold gas discount cards"
msgstr[0] "gold gas discount card"
msgstr[1] "gold gas discount cards"

#. ~ Description for gold gas discount card
#: lang/json/TOOL_from_json.py
msgid "This card gives you a good discount on the purchase of gasoline."
msgstr "This card gives you a good discount on the purchase of gasoline."

#: lang/json/TOOL_from_json.py
msgid "platinum gas discount card"
msgid_plural "platinum gas discount cards"
msgstr[0] "platinum gas discount card"
msgstr[1] "platinum gas discount cards"

#. ~ Description for platinum gas discount card
#: lang/json/TOOL_from_json.py
msgid "This card gives you a splendid discount on the purchase of gasoline."
msgstr "This card gives you a splendid discount on the purchase of gasoline."

#: lang/json/TOOL_from_json.py
msgid "nail bomb"
msgid_plural "nail bombs"
msgstr[0] "nail bomb"
msgstr[1] "nail bombs"

#. ~ Use action message for nail bomb.
#: lang/json/TOOL_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid "You light the fuse on the %s."
msgstr "You light the fuse on the %s."

#. ~ Description for nail bomb
#: lang/json/TOOL_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A crude and bulky improvised fragmentation grenade.  Use this item to light "
"the fuse.  You will then have five turns before it explodes; throwing it "
"would be a good idea."
msgstr "A crude and bulky improvised fragmentation grenade.  Use this item to light the fuse.  You will then have five turns before it explodes; throwing it would be a good idea."

#. ~ Description for broadsword
#: lang/json/TOOL_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is an early modern sword seeing use in the 16th, 17th, and 18th "
"centuries.  This sword appears to be made very poorly, but it should still "
"stand up to a few swings."
msgstr "This is an early modern sword seeing use in the 16th, 17th, and 18th centuries.  This sword appears to be made very poorly, but it should still stand up to a few swings."

#. ~ Description for cutlass
#: lang/json/TOOL_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a broad saber known for its use by sailors and pirates.  This sword "
"appears to be made very poorly, but it should still stand up to a few "
"swings."
msgstr "This is a broad saber known for its use by sailors and pirates.  This sword appears to be made very poorly, but it should still stand up to a few swings."

#. ~ Description for katana
#: lang/json/TOOL_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a rare sword from Japan.  While it's got the right edge and weight, "
"the pommel just snaps off, and the blade seems pretty worn."
msgstr "This is a rare sword from Japan.  While it's got the right edge and weight, the pommel just snaps off, and the blade seems pretty worn."

#. ~ Description for zweihänder
#: lang/json/TOOL_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a huge two-handed sword from Germany.  You're not quite sure it's "
"supposed to be that bendy."
msgstr "This is a huge two-handed sword from Germany.  You're not quite sure it's supposed to be that bendy."

#. ~ Description for wakizashi
#: lang/json/TOOL_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a comparatively-common Japanese short sword.  There's something not "
"quite right about this sword."
msgstr "This is a comparatively-common Japanese short sword.  There's something not quite right about this sword."

#. ~ Description for battle axe
#: lang/json/TOOL_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a huge axe designed for warfare.  You notice that the axe heads "
"aren't seated properly at all."
msgstr "This is a huge axe designed for warfare.  You notice that the axe heads aren't seated properly at all."

#. ~ Description for jian
#: lang/json/TOOL_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is an ancient Chinese doubled-edged straight sword, with an ornate "
"guard and a tassel attatched to the pommel.  One of the four major weapons "
"in folklore, alongside the dao sabre, qiang spear, and gun staff."
msgstr "This is an ancient Chinese doubled-edged straight sword, with an ornate guard and a tassel attatched to the pommel.  One of the four major weapons in folklore, alongside the dao sabre, qiang spear, and gun staff."

#. ~ Description for jian
#: lang/json/TOOL_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is an ancient Chinese doubled-edged straight sword.  The sword is quite"
" worn, and bent at an odd angle."
msgstr "This is an ancient Chinese doubled-edged straight sword.  The sword is quite worn, and bent at an odd angle."

#. ~ Description for scimitar
#: lang/json/TOOL_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a curved sword associated with various Middle Eastern and Central "
"Asian countries.  Designed for slashing, and quite deadly against unarmored "
"targets."
msgstr "This is a curved sword associated with various Middle Eastern and Central Asian countries.  Designed for slashing, and quite deadly against unarmored targets."

#. ~ Description for scimitar
#: lang/json/TOOL_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a curved sword associated with various Middle Eastern and Central "
"Asian countries.  This one seems oddly dull and worn."
msgstr "This is a curved sword associated with various Middle Eastern and Central Asian countries.  This one seems oddly dull and worn."

#. ~ Description for longsword
#: lang/json/TOOL_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a classic medieval sword, in between the lighter arming sword and "
"later two-handed swords in size.  It requires a larger baldric or scabbard, "
"compared to smaller swords."
msgstr "This is a classic medieval sword, in between the lighter arming sword and later two-handed swords in size.  It requires a larger baldric or scabbard, compared to smaller swords."

#. ~ Description for longsword
#: lang/json/TOOL_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a classic medieval sword, in between the lighter arming sword and "
"later two-handed swords in size.  You feel like the pommel could just snap "
"off if you used it."
msgstr "This is a classic medieval sword, in between the lighter arming sword and later two-handed swords in size.  You feel like the pommel could just snap off if you used it."

#. ~ Description for arming sword
#: lang/json/TOOL_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a classic medieval sword, just the right size to use one-handed."
msgstr "This is a classic medieval sword, just the right size to use one-handed."

#. ~ Description for arming sword
#: lang/json/TOOL_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a classic medieval sword, just the right size to use one-handed.  "
"This one doesn't seem to have been made right."
msgstr "This is a classic medieval sword, just the right size to use one-handed.  This one doesn't seem to have been made right."

#: lang/json/TOOL_from_json.py
msgid "folded poncho"
msgid_plural "folded ponchos"
msgstr[0] "folded poncho"
msgstr[1] "folded ponchos"

#. ~ Description for folded poncho
#: lang/json/TOOL_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A folded lightweight plastic rain poncho with a hood.  Use it to unfold for "
"use."
msgstr "A folded lightweight plastic rain poncho with a hood.  Use it to unfold for use."

#: lang/json/TOOL_from_json.py
msgid "folded emergency blanket"
msgid_plural "folded emergency blankets"
msgstr[0] "folded emergency blanket"
msgstr[1] "folded emergency blankets"

#. ~ Description for folded emergency blanket
#: lang/json/TOOL_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A folded blanket made of space-age materials that covers your most important"
" body parts.  Use it to unfold for use."
msgstr "A folded blanket made of space-age materials that covers your most important body parts.  Use it to unfold for use."

#: lang/json/TOOL_from_json.py
msgid "EMP grenade"
msgid_plural "EMP grenades"
msgstr[0] "EMP grenade"
msgstr[1] "EMP grenades"

#. ~ Use action msg for EMP grenade.
#: lang/json/TOOL_from_json.py
msgid "You pull the pin on the EMP grenade."
msgstr "You pull the pin on the EMP grenade."

#. ~ Description for EMP grenade
#: lang/json/TOOL_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a grenade that generates a electromagnetic pulse with a tiny nuclear"
" explosion.  Use this item to pull the pin and light the fuse, turning it "
"into an active EMP grenade.  You will then have three turns before it "
"detonates, creating an EMP field that damages robots and drains bionic "
"energy."
msgstr "This is a grenade that generates a electromagnetic pulse with a tiny nuclear explosion.  Use this item to pull the pin and light the fuse, turning it into an active EMP grenade.  You will then have three turns before it detonates, creating an EMP field that damages robots and drains bionic energy."

#: lang/json/TOOL_from_json.py
msgid "active EMP grenade"
msgid_plural "active EMP grenades"
msgstr[0] "active EMP grenade"
msgstr[1] "active EMP grenades"

#. ~ Use action sound_msg for active EMP grenade.
#. ~ Use action sound_msg for C-4 explosive (armed).
