msgid ""
"This is a large steel pickaxe, suitable for breaking up hard things or (with"
" enough skill) hard targets.  Strike the earth!"
msgstr "This is a large steel pickaxe, suitable for breaking up hard things or (with enough skill) hard targets.  Strike the earth!"

