"This is a section of a pipe filled with explosive materials.  Use this item "
"to light the fuse, which gives you three turns to get away from it before it"
" detonates.  You'll need a lighter or some matches to use it.  It is "
"somewhat unreliable, and may fail to detonate."
msgstr "This is a section of a pipe filled with explosive materials.  Use this item to light the fuse, which gives you three turns to get away from it before it detonates.  You'll need a lighter or some matches to use it.  It is somewhat unreliable, and may fail to detonate."

#: lang/json/TOOL_from_json.py
msgid "active pipe bomb"
msgid_plural "active pipe bombs"
msgstr[0] "active pipe bomb"
msgstr[1] "active pipe bombs"

#. ~ Description for active pipe bomb
#: lang/json/TOOL_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This pipe bomb's fuse is lit, and it will explode any second now.  Throw it "
"immediately!"
msgstr "This pipe bomb's fuse is lit, and it will explode any second now.  Throw it immediately!"

#: lang/json/TOOL_from_json.py
msgid "radio pipe bomb"
msgid_plural "radio pipe bombs"
msgstr[0] "radio pipe bomb"
msgstr[1] "radio pipe bombs"

#. ~ Use action msg for radio pipe bomb.
#: lang/json/TOOL_from_json.py
msgid "You arm your radio-detonated pipe bomb."
msgstr "You arm your radio-detonated pipe bomb."

#. ~ Description for radio pipe bomb
#: lang/json/TOOL_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A radio-detonated pipe bomb.  Activate it to arm the detonator, then place "
"somewhere and press a button on the radio control."
msgstr "A radio-detonated pipe bomb.  Activate it to arm the detonator, then place somewhere and press a button on the radio control."

#: lang/json/TOOL_from_json.py
msgid "activated radio pipe bomb"
msgid_plural "activated radio pipe bombs"
msgstr[0] "activated radio pipe bomb"
msgstr[1] "activated radio pipe bombs"

#. ~ Use action no_deactivate_msg for activated radio pipe bomb.
#: lang/json/TOOL_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"You can't disarm your %s'.  Place it, get away, and use the remote control "
"to detonate."
msgstr "You can't disarm your %s'.  Place it, get away, and use the remote control to detonate."

#. ~ Description for activated radio pipe bomb
#: lang/json/TOOL_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A radio-detonated pipe bomb, armed.  Place it or attach to a RC car, then "
"get away and use the radio-control to detonate."
msgstr "A radio-detonated pipe bomb, armed.  Place it or attach to a RC car, then get away and use the radio-control to detonate."

#: lang/json/TOOL_from_json.py
