"This is a makeshift shaving kit.  You can use it to shave if it's supplied "
"with soap.  It requires 1 unit of soap per use."
msgstr "This is a makeshift shaving kit.  You can use it to shave if it's supplied with soap.  It requires 1 unit of soap per use."

