"A treated animal hide which is undergoing the chemical processes required to"
" become leather.  You will be able to activate it to unroll and make use of "
"it when it is done."
msgstr "A treated animal hide which is undergoing the chemical processes required to become leather.  You will be able to activate it to unroll and make use of it when it is done."

#: lang/json/TOOL_from_json.py
