"completely and delivers its entire destructive power to everything in sight."
msgstr "This is an metal keg, filled with 50 litres worth of RDX and scrap metal.  Contains a core of primary explosive to ensure that the charge detonates completely and delivers its entire destructive power to everything in sight."

