msgstr "A pear-shaped chunk of rocket candy obtained by heating saltpetre with sugar and casting the obtained liquid.  Can serve as a rocket fuel, but also as a smokescreen – if you lit the narrow end, you should be able to throw it before the flame reaches the broad end."

