"This is a typical household flashlight with a plastic handle.  Using this "
"flashlight will turn it on and provide light, assuming it is charged with "
"batteries."
msgstr "This is a typical household flashlight with a plastic handle.  Using this flashlight will turn it on and provide light, assuming it is charged with batteries."

