msgstr "You strike your flare and light it."

#. ~ Description for flare
#: lang/json/TOOL_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a slow-burning magnesium flare.  Use it to strike the striker and "
"light it.  It will produce a bright light for about a half hour."
msgstr "This is a slow-burning magnesium flare.  Use it to strike the striker and light it.  It will produce a bright light for about a half hour."

