msgstr "The %s must be attached to a gas cylinder to light."

#. ~ Description for acetylene lamp (off)
#: lang/json/TOOL_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An antique brass lamp designed to run from a pressurized cylinder of "
"acetylene.  It is an efficient, if not somewhat dangerous light source."
msgstr "An antique brass lamp designed to run from a pressurized cylinder of acetylene.  It is an efficient, if not somewhat dangerous light source."

