msgstr "Increased cutting damage"

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Muay Thai"
msgstr "Muay Thai"

#. ~ Description for martial art 'Muay Thai'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Also referred to as the \"Art of 8 Limbs,\" Muay Thai is a popular fighting "
"technique from Thailand that uses powerful strikes.  Your strikes are more "
"powerful with high strength and weaker with low strength, and can "
"momentarily disorient enemies."
msgstr "Also referred to as the \"Art of 8 Limbs,\" Muay Thai is a popular fighting technique from Thailand that uses powerful strikes.  Your strikes are more powerful with high strength and weaker with low strength, and can momentarily disorient enemies."

#. ~ Description of buff for martial art 'Muay Thai'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Attacks scale better with strength"
msgstr "Attacks scale better with strength"

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Ninjutsu"
msgstr "Ninjutsu"

#. ~ Description for martial art 'Ninjutsu'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Ninjutsu is a martial art and set of tactics used by ninja in feudal Japan."
"  It focuses on rapid, precise, silent strikes.  Ninjutsu is almost entirely"
" silent.  It also provides small combat bonuses every time you move."
msgstr "Ninjutsu is a martial art and set of tactics used by ninja in feudal Japan.  It focuses on rapid, precise, silent strikes.  Ninjutsu is almost entirely silent.  It also provides small combat bonuses every time you move."

#. ~ Description of buff for martial art 'Ninjutsu'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Silent melee attacks"
msgstr "Silent melee attacks"

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Taekwondo"
msgstr "Taekwondo"

#. ~ Description for martial art 'Taekwondo'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Taekwondo is the national sport of Korea, and was used by the South Korean "
"army in the 20th century.  Focused on kicks and punches, it also includes "
"strength training; your blocks absorb extra damage the stronger you are."
msgstr "Taekwondo is the national sport of Korea, and was used by the South Korean army in the 20th century.  Focused on kicks and punches, it also includes strength training; your blocks absorb extra damage the stronger you are."

#. ~ Description of buff for martial art 'Taekwondo'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Strength decreases damage when blocking"
msgstr "Strength decreases damage when blocking"

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Bionic Combatives"
msgstr "Bionic Combatives"

#. ~ Description for martial art 'Bionic Combatives'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A modern combat style for the post-modern human.  Bionic Combatives combines"
" integrated weaponry, armor and augments into an consolidated fighting "
"discipline."
msgstr "A modern combat style for the post-modern human.  Bionic Combatives combines integrated weaponry, armor and augments into an consolidated fighting discipline."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Biojutsu"
msgstr "Biojutsu"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Biojutsu' for martial art 'Bionic Combatives'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "+1 Blocks"
msgstr "+1 Blocks"

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Zui Quan"
msgstr "Zui Quan"

#. ~ Description for martial art 'Zui Quan'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"AKA \"drunken boxing,\" Zui Quan imitates the movement of a drunk to confuse"
" the enemy, giving you a passive dodge bonus based on your intelligence.  "
"The turn after you attack, you may dodge any number of attacks with no "
"penalty, and successfully dodging an attack gives you bonus damage and to-"
"hit based on your intelligence."
msgstr "AKA \"drunken boxing,\" Zui Quan imitates the movement of a drunk to confuse the enemy, giving you a passive dodge bonus based on your intelligence.  The turn after you attack, you may dodge any number of attacks with no penalty, and successfully dodging an attack gives you bonus damage and to-hit based on your intelligence."

#. ~ Description of buff for martial art 'Zui Quan'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Intelligence increases dodging ability"
msgstr "Intelligence increases dodging ability"

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Silat"
msgstr "Silat"

#. ~ Description for martial art 'Silat'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Pentjak Silat, of Indonesian origin, is a fighting style that covers the use"
" of short blades and bludgeons.  Fighters stay low and mobile to avoid "
"attacks, then unleash deadly critical hits."
msgstr "Pentjak Silat, of Indonesian origin, is a fighting style that covers the use of short blades and bludgeons.  Fighters stay low and mobile to avoid attacks, then unleash deadly critical hits."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Silat Stance"
msgstr "Silat Stance"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Silat Stance' for martial art 'Silat'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "+1 dodge"
msgstr "+1 dodge"

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Fencing"
msgstr "Fencing"

#. ~ Description for martial art 'Fencing'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The noble art of fencing is taught with flexible competition blades, but the"
" techniques are derived from (and applicable to) more functional examples.  "
"Skilled fencers can take advantage of advances and retreats to deliver "
"accurate strikes."
msgstr "The noble art of fencing is taught with flexible competition blades, but the techniques are derived from (and applicable to) more functional examples.  Skilled fencers can take advantage of advances and retreats to deliver accurate strikes."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Niten Ichi-Ryu"
msgstr "Niten Ichi-Ryu"

#. ~ Description for martial art 'Niten Ichi-Ryu'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Niten Ichi-Ryu is an ancient school of combat, transmitting a style of "
"classical Japanese swordsmanship conceived by the warrior Miyamoto Musashi."
msgstr "Niten Ichi-Ryu is an ancient school of combat, transmitting a style of classical Japanese swordsmanship conceived by the warrior Miyamoto Musashi."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Blocking"
msgstr "Blocking"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Blocking' for martial art 'Niten Ichi-Ryu'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "You forgo dodging on the offensive, but gain more blocks."
msgstr "You forgo dodging on the offensive, but gain more blocks."

#. ~ Description of buff for martial art 'Niten Ichi-Ryu'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Perception increases dodging and damage."
msgstr "Perception increases dodging and damage."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Eskrima"
msgstr "Eskrima"

#. ~ Description for martial art 'Eskrima'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Eskrima, also known as Kali, is a Filipino martial art.  It emphasises rapid"
" strikes with knife and baton weapons, along with a variety of improvised "
"substitutes."
msgstr "Eskrima, also known as Kali, is a Filipino martial art.  It emphasises rapid strikes with knife and baton weapons, along with a variety of improvised substitutes."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Eskrima Combination"
msgstr "Eskrima Combination"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Eskrima Combination' for martial art 'Eskrima'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Combination"
msgstr "Combination"

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Eskrima Bashing"
msgstr "Eskrima Bashing"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Eskrima Bashing' for martial art 'Eskrima'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Increased bashing damage"
msgstr "Increased bashing damage"

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Crane Kung Fu"
msgstr "Crane Kung Fu"

#. ~ Description for martial art 'Crane Kung Fu'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"One of the five Shaolin animal styles.  The Crane uses intricate hand "
"techniques and jumping dodges.  Dexterity determines the majority of your "
"damage, rather than Strength; you also receive a dodge bonus the turn after "
"moving a tile."
msgstr "One of the five Shaolin animal styles.  The Crane uses intricate hand techniques and jumping dodges.  Dexterity determines the majority of your damage, rather than Strength; you also receive a dodge bonus the turn after moving a tile."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Crane's Precision"
msgstr "Crane's Precision"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Crane's Precision' for martial art 'Crane Kung Fu'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Damage bonus from dexterity at the cost of damage from strength."
msgstr "Damage bonus from dexterity at the cost of damage from strength."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Dragon Kung Fu"
msgstr "Dragon Kung Fu"

#. ~ Description for martial art 'Dragon Kung Fu'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"One of the five Shaolin animal styles.  The Dragon uses fluid movements and "
"hard strikes.  Intelligence improves your accuracy and damage dealt, as does"
" moving."
msgstr "One of the five Shaolin animal styles.  The Dragon uses fluid movements and hard strikes.  Intelligence improves your accuracy and damage dealt, as does moving."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Dragon Style"
msgstr "Dragon Style"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Dragon Style' for martial art 'Dragon Kung Fu'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Bonus damage from intelligence."
msgstr "Bonus damage from intelligence."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Leopard Kung Fu"
msgstr "Leopard Kung Fu"

#. ~ Description for martial art 'Leopard Kung Fu'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"One of the five Shaolin animal styles.  The Leopard focuses on rapid, "
"strategically planned strikes.  Perception and Intelligence both boost "
"dodging, and moving boosts your accuracy."
msgstr "One of the five Shaolin animal styles.  The Leopard focuses on rapid, strategically planned strikes.  Perception and Intelligence both boost dodging, and moving boosts your accuracy."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Leopard Strategy"
msgstr "Leopard Strategy"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Leopard Strategy' for martial art 'Leopard Kung Fu'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Perception and intelligence provide a bonus to dodge."
msgstr "Perception and intelligence provide a bonus to dodge."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Tiger Kung Fu"
msgstr "Tiger Kung Fu"

#. ~ Description for martial art 'Tiger Kung Fu'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"One of the five Shaolin animal styles.  The Tiger focuses on relentless "
"attacks above all else.  Your Strength determines your accuracy, and your "
"attacks do increasing damage as you continue attacking."
msgstr "One of the five Shaolin animal styles.  The Tiger focuses on relentless attacks above all else.  Your Strength determines your accuracy, and your attacks do increasing damage as you continue attacking."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Tiger Fury"
msgstr "Tiger Fury"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Tiger Fury' for martial art 'Tiger Kung Fu'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "+3 Bash/atk"
msgstr "+3 Bash/atk"

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Tiger Strength"
msgstr "Tiger Strength"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Tiger Strength' for martial art 'Tiger Kung Fu'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Strength provides additional damage bonus."
msgstr "Strength provides additional damage bonus."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Snake Kung Fu"
msgstr "Snake Kung Fu"

#. ~ Description for martial art 'Snake Kung Fu'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"One of the five Shaolin animal styles.  The Snake focuses on sinuous "
"movement and precision strikes.  Your Perception improves your damage."
msgstr "One of the five Shaolin animal styles.  The Snake focuses on sinuous movement and precision strikes.  Your Perception improves your damage."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Snake Sight"
msgstr "Snake Sight"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Snake Sight' for martial art 'Snake Kung Fu'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Perception provides a bonus to damage."
msgstr "Perception provides a bonus to damage."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Centipede Kung Fu"
msgstr "Centipede Kung Fu"

#. ~ Description for martial art 'Centipede Kung Fu'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"One of the Five Deadly Venoms.  Centipede Style uses an onslaught of rapid "
"strikes.  Each attack you land increases your speed by 4."
msgstr "One of the Five Deadly Venoms.  Centipede Style uses an onslaught of rapid strikes.  Each attack you land increases your speed by 4."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Hundred-Hitter"
msgstr "Hundred-Hitter"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Hundred-Hitter' for martial art 'Centipede Kung Fu'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "+4 Atk Speed"
msgstr "+4 Atk Speed"

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Scorpion Kung Fu"
msgstr "Scorpion Kung Fu"

#. ~ Description for martial art 'Scorpion Kung Fu'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"One of the Five Deadly Venoms.  Scorpion Style is a mysterious art which "
"uses pincer-like hands and a stinger kick.  Critical hits do massive damage "
"and knock your target back."
msgstr "One of the Five Deadly Venoms.  Scorpion Style is a mysterious art which uses pincer-like hands and a stinger kick.  Critical hits do massive damage and knock your target back."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Scorpion Venom"
msgstr "Scorpion Venom"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Scorpion Venom' for martial art 'Scorpion Kung Fu'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "+2 bashing damage."
msgstr "+2 bashing damage."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Toad Kung Fu"
msgstr "Toad Kung Fu"

#. ~ Description for martial art 'Toad Kung Fu'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"One of the Five Deadly Venoms.  Masters of Toad Style can focus themselves "
"against all attacks.  You can meditate by pausing, giving you armor, though "
"you will lose focus when you move."
msgstr "One of the Five Deadly Venoms.  Masters of Toad Style can focus themselves against all attacks.  You can meditate by pausing, giving you armor, though you will lose focus when you move."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Toad's Iron Skin"
msgstr "Toad's Iron Skin"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Toad's Iron Skin' for martial art 'Toad Kung Fu'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Gain up to +6 armor while standing still"
msgstr "Gain up to +6 armor while standing still"

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Lizard Kung Fu"
msgstr "Lizard Kung Fu"

#. ~ Description for martial art 'Lizard Kung Fu'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"One of the Five Deadly Venoms, and likely to be refactored to a mutation at "
"the next save-compatibility breaker.  Lizard Style focuses on using walls to"
" your advantage."
msgstr "One of the Five Deadly Venoms, and likely to be refactored to a mutation at the next save-compatibility breaker.  Lizard Style focuses on using walls to your advantage."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Viper Kung Fu"
msgstr "Viper Kung Fu"

#. ~ Description for martial art 'Viper Kung Fu'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A legacy of the Five Deadly Venoms.  Viper Style has a unique three-part "
"combo, which initiates on a dodge, then counters with a stunning chop and "
"the legendary Viper Strike."
msgstr "A legacy of the Five Deadly Venoms.  Viper Style has a unique three-part combo, which initiates on a dodge, then counters with a stunning chop and the legendary Viper Strike."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Viper Lock"
msgstr "Viper Lock"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Viper Lock' for martial art 'Viper Kung Fu'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "You bit true!  Your next attack will be the Viper Strike!"
msgstr "You bit true!  Your next attack will be the Viper Strike!"

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Viper Patience"
msgstr "Viper Patience"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Viper Patience' for martial art 'Viper Kung Fu'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "+2 Dodge.  Dodging an attack initiates a combo."
msgstr "+2 Dodge.  Dodging an attack initiates a combo."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Debug Mastery"
msgstr "Debug Mastery"

#. ~ Description for martial art 'Debug Mastery'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "A secret martial art used only by developers and cheaters."
msgstr "A secret martial art used only by developers and cheaters."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Elemental resistance"
msgstr "Elemental resistance"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Elemental resistance' for martial art 'Debug
#. Mastery'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"+Strength bash armor, +Dexterity acid armor, +Intelligence electricity "
"armor, +Perception fire armor."
msgstr "+Strength bash armor, +Dexterity acid armor, +Intelligence electricity armor, +Perception fire armor."

#. ~ Description for martial art 'Niten Ichi-Ryu'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Niten Ichi-Ryu is an ancient school of combat, transmitting a style of "
"classical Japanese swordsmanship conceived by the warrior Miyamoto Musashi."
"  It primarily focuses on the proper use of the katana and wakizashi, but "
"includes staff techniques as well."
msgstr "Niten Ichi-Ryu is an ancient school of combat, transmitting a style of classical Japanese swordsmanship conceived by the warrior Miyamoto Musashi.  It primarily focuses on the proper use of the katana and wakizashi, but includes staff techniques as well."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Medieval Swordsmanship"
msgstr "Medieval Swordsmanship"

#. ~ Description for martial art 'Medieval Swordsmanship'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The art of the longsword and other weapons, preceding the later development "
"of fencing.  Designed for combat both unarmored and in armor, it includes "
"grappling as well as defensive and offensive sword techniques, plus "
"familiarity with other weapon like polearms."
msgstr "The art of the longsword and other weapons, preceding the later development of fencing.  Designed for combat both unarmored and in armor, it includes grappling as well as defensive and offensive sword techniques, plus familiarity with other weapon like polearms."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Pankration"
msgstr "Pankration"

#. ~ Description for martial art 'Pankration'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An ancient Greek martial art, combining boxing and wrestling techniques to "
"create a brutal sport, though modern revival of the art is less of no-holds-"
"barred in nature."
msgstr "An ancient Greek martial art, combining boxing and wrestling techniques to create a brutal sport, though modern revival of the art is less of no-holds-barred in nature."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Grappling"
msgstr "Grappling"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Grappling' for martial art 'Pankration'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "I have you now!"
msgstr "I have you now!"

