msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Caffeine pills and all-nighters in front of a computer screen have given you"
" skills in an area that seem, on the face of it, distinctly less-than-useful"
" when the world has ended.  You suppose you can't really get in trouble for "
"fulfilling your dream of hacking into a military mainframe, now.  That's a "
"plus."
msgstr "Caffeine pills and all-nighters in front of a computer screen have given you skills in an area that seem, on the face of it, distinctly less-than-useful when the world has ended.  You suppose you can't really get in trouble for fulfilling your dream of hacking into a military mainframe, now.  That's a plus."

