#. ~ Profession (male Roller Derby Player) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were hell on wheels prior to the apocalypse.  Now the rest of your team "
"is dead, and you probably wouldn't have lived this long if not for your "
"penchant for high-speed violence.  Things are looking grim; how long can you"
" race laps around the undead before you get blocked for good?"
msgstr "You were hell on wheels prior to the apocalypse.  Now the rest of your team is dead, and you probably wouldn't have lived this long if not for your penchant for high-speed violence.  Things are looking grim; how long can you race laps around the undead before you get blocked for good?"

