#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"If the human race is to survive, the threats facing its existence must be "
"eliminated, no matter the cost.  If it's hostile, you kill it."
msgstr "If the human race is to survive, the threats facing its existence must be eliminated, no matter the cost.  If it's hostile, you kill it."

