msgstr "Veteran Bandit"

#. ~ Profession (male Veteran Bandit) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"After the cities exploded there was a whirlwind of looting; a firestorm of "
"fear.  Men began to feed on men.  On the roads it was a white line "
"nightmare.  Only those mobile enough to scavenge or brutal enough to pillage"
" would survive.  You are one of the latter."
msgstr "After the cities exploded there was a whirlwind of looting; a firestorm of fear.  Men began to feed on men.  On the roads it was a white line nightmare.  Only those mobile enough to scavenge or brutal enough to pillage would survive.  You are one of the latter."

