"A mall security guard.  You don't have any useful skills, other than some "
"basic training for your job.  You do however have your trusty tazer, baton, "
"and pocket knife."
msgstr "A mall security guard.  You don't have any useful skills, other than some basic training for your job.  You do however have your trusty tazer, baton, and pocket knife."

