#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Your parents were crazy preppers who thought some \"cataclysm\" was coming, "
"and insisted on preparing you for it.  Turns out they were right.  You "
"didn't get a chance to thank them.  The only thing you can do for them now "
"is what they always hoped you would do in the dark days ahead: survive."
msgstr "Your parents were crazy preppers who thought some \"cataclysm\" was coming, and insisted on preparing you for it.  Turns out they were right.  You didn't get a chance to thank them.  The only thing you can do for them now is what they always hoped you would do in the dark days ahead: survive."

