msgid ""
"Against all odds, you managed to make it back to the station house in one "
"piece.  Now the reanimated husks of your former comrades want to make sure "
"you never leave it again."
msgstr "Against all odds, you managed to make it back to the station house in one piece.  Now the reanimated husks of your former comrades want to make sure you never leave it again."

