#: lang/json/skill_from_json.py
msgid "bartering"
msgstr "bartering"

#. ~ Description for bartering
#: lang/json/skill_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your skill in bargaining, haggling, and trading with others.  Higher levels "
"increase the odds of getting the better end of a deal, and might even see "
"you convincing others to give you free stuff."
msgstr "Your skill in bargaining, haggling, and trading with others.  Higher levels increase the odds of getting the better end of a deal, and might even see you convincing others to give you free stuff."

#: lang/json/skill_from_json.py
msgid "computers"
msgstr "computers"

#. ~ Description for computers
#: lang/json/skill_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your skill in accessing and manipulating computers.  Higher levels can allow"
" a user to navigate complex software systems and even bypass their security."
msgstr "Your skill in accessing and manipulating computers.  Higher levels can allow a user to navigate complex software systems and even bypass their security."

#: lang/json/skill_from_json.py
msgid "construction"
msgstr "construction"

#. ~ Description for construction
#: lang/json/skill_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your general competence in building construction.  This governs the "
"complexity of structures that can be built, and the time required to build "
"them."
msgstr "Your general competence in building construction.  This governs the complexity of structures that can be built, and the time required to build them."

#: lang/json/skill_from_json.py
msgid "cooking"
msgstr "cooking"

#. ~ Description for cooking
#: lang/json/skill_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your skill in combining food ingredients to make other, tastier food items."
"  It may also be used in certain chemical mixtures and other, more esoteric "
"tasks."
msgstr "Your skill in combining food ingredients to make other, tastier food items.  It may also be used in certain chemical mixtures and other, more esoteric tasks."

#: lang/json/skill_from_json.py
msgid "driving"
msgstr "driving"

#. ~ Description for driving
#: lang/json/skill_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your skill in operating and steering a vehicle in motion.  A higher level "
"allows greater control over vehicles at higher speeds, and reduces the "
"penalty of shooting while driving."
msgstr "Your skill in operating and steering a vehicle in motion.  A higher level allows greater control over vehicles at higher speeds, and reduces the penalty of shooting while driving."

#: lang/json/skill_from_json.py
msgid "electronics"
msgstr "electronics"

#. ~ Description for electronics
#: lang/json/skill_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your skill in dealing with electrical systems, used in the craft and repair "
"of objects with electrical components.  This skill is an important part of "
"installing and managing bionic implants."
msgstr "Your skill in dealing with electrical systems, used in the craft and repair of objects with electrical components.  This skill is an important part of installing and managing bionic implants."

#: lang/json/skill_from_json.py
msgid "fabrication"
msgstr "fabrication"

#. ~ Description for fabrication
#: lang/json/skill_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your skill in working with raw materials and shaping them into useful "
"objects.  This skill plays an important role in the crafting of many "
"objects."
msgstr "Your skill in working with raw materials and shaping them into useful objects.  This skill plays an important role in the crafting of many objects."

#: lang/json/skill_from_json.py
msgid "first aid"
msgstr "first aid"

#. ~ Description for first aid
#: lang/json/skill_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your skill in effecting emergency medical treatment.  Higher levels allow "
"better use of medicines and items like bandages and first aid kits, and "
"reduce the failure and complication rates of medical procedures."
msgstr "Your skill in effecting emergency medical treatment.  Higher levels allow better use of medicines and items like bandages and first aid kits, and reduce the failure and complication rates of medical procedures."

#: lang/json/skill_from_json.py
msgid "mechanics"
msgstr "mechanics"

#. ~ Description for mechanics
#: lang/json/skill_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your skill in engineering, maintaining and repairing vehicles and other "
"mechanical systems.  This skill covers the craft of items with complex "
"parts, and plays a role in the installation of bionic equipment."
msgstr "Your skill in engineering, maintaining and repairing vehicles and other mechanical systems.  This skill covers the craft of items with complex parts, and plays a role in the installation of bionic equipment."

#: lang/json/skill_from_json.py
msgid "speaking"
msgstr "speaking"

#. ~ Description for speaking
#: lang/json/skill_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your skill in speaking to other people.  Covers ability in boasting, "
"flattery, threats, persuasion, lies, and other facets of interpersonal "
"communication.  Works best in conjunction with a high level of intelligence."
msgstr "Your skill in speaking to other people.  Covers ability in boasting, flattery, threats, persuasion, lies, and other facets of interpersonal communication.  Works best in conjunction with a high level of intelligence."

#: lang/json/skill_from_json.py
msgid "survival"
msgstr "survival"

#. ~ Description for survival
#: lang/json/skill_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your skill in surviving the wilderness, and in crafting various basic "
"survival items.  This also covers your ability to skin and butcher animals "
"for meat and hides."
msgstr "Your skill in surviving the wilderness, and in crafting various basic survival items.  This also covers your ability to skin and butcher animals for meat and hides."

#: lang/json/skill_from_json.py
msgid "swimming"
msgstr "swimming"

#. ~ Description for swimming
#: lang/json/skill_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your ability to stay afloat and move around in bodies of water.  This skill "
"keeps you from drowning, affects your combat effectiveness and speed in deep"
" water, and determines the detriment of swimming with heavier gear."
msgstr "Your ability to stay afloat and move around in bodies of water.  This skill keeps you from drowning, affects your combat effectiveness and speed in deep water, and determines the detriment of swimming with heavier gear."

#: lang/json/skill_from_json.py
msgid "tailoring"
msgstr "tailoring"

#. ~ Description for tailoring
#: lang/json/skill_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your skill in the craft and repair of clothing, bags, blankets and other "
"textiles.  Affects knitting, sewing, stitching, weaving, and nearly anything"
" else involving a needle and thread."
msgstr "Your skill in the craft and repair of clothing, bags, blankets and other textiles.  Affects knitting, sewing, stitching, weaving, and nearly anything else involving a needle and thread."

#: lang/json/skill_from_json.py
msgid "trapping"
msgstr "trapping"

#. ~ Description for trapping
#: lang/json/skill_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your skill in creating, setting, finding and disarming traps safely and "
"effectively.  This skill does not affect the evasion of traps that are "
"triggered."
msgstr "Your skill in creating, setting, finding and disarming traps safely and effectively.  This skill does not affect the evasion of traps that are triggered."

#: lang/json/skill_from_json.py
msgid "archery"
msgstr "archery"

#. ~ Description for archery
#: lang/json/skill_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your skill in using bow weapons, from hand-carved self bows to complex "
"hunting crossbows.  Quiet and effective, they require strength of body and "
"sight to wield, and are not terribly accurate over a long distance."
msgstr "Your skill in using bow weapons, from hand-carved self bows to complex hunting crossbows.  Quiet and effective, they require strength of body and sight to wield, and are not terribly accurate over a long distance."

#: lang/json/skill_from_json.py
msgid "bashing weapons"
msgstr "bashing weapons"

#. ~ Description for bashing weapons
#: lang/json/skill_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your skill in fighting with blunt weaponry, from rocks and sticks to "
"baseball bats and the butts of rifles.  Skill increases damage, and higher "
"levels will improve the accuracy of an attack."
msgstr "Your skill in fighting with blunt weaponry, from rocks and sticks to baseball bats and the butts of rifles.  Skill increases damage, and higher levels will improve the accuracy of an attack."

#: lang/json/skill_from_json.py
msgid "cutting weapons"
msgstr "cutting weapons"

#. ~ Description for cutting weapons
#: lang/json/skill_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your skill in fighting with weaponry designed to cut, hack and slash an "
"opponent.  Lower levels of skill increase accuracy and damage, while higher "
"levels will help to bypass heavy armor and thick hides."
msgstr "Your skill in fighting with weaponry designed to cut, hack and slash an opponent.  Lower levels of skill increase accuracy and damage, while higher levels will help to bypass heavy armor and thick hides."

#: lang/json/skill_from_json.py
msgid "dodging"
msgstr "dodging"

#. ~ Description for dodging
#: lang/json/skill_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your ability to dodge an oncoming threat, be it an enemy's attack, a "
"triggered trap, or a falling rock.  This skill is also used in attempts to "
"fall gracefully, and for other acrobatic feats."
msgstr "Your ability to dodge an oncoming threat, be it an enemy's attack, a triggered trap, or a falling rock.  This skill is also used in attempts to fall gracefully, and for other acrobatic feats."

#: lang/json/skill_from_json.py
msgid "marksmanship"
msgstr "marksmanship"

#. ~ Description for marksmanship
#: lang/json/skill_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your overall skill in using bows and firearms.  With higher levels, this "
"general experience increases accuracy with any bows or firearms, but is "
"secondary to practice with the type of ranged weapon in question."
msgstr "Your overall skill in using bows and firearms.  With higher levels, this general experience increases accuracy with any bows or firearms, but is secondary to practice with the type of ranged weapon in question."

#. ~ Description for launchers
#: lang/json/skill_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your skill in using heavy weapons like rocket, grenade or missile launchers."
"  These weapons have a variety of applications and may carry immense "
"destructive power, but they are cumbersome and hard to manage."
msgstr "Your skill in using heavy weapons like rocket, grenade or missile launchers.  These weapons have a variety of applications and may carry immense destructive power, but they are cumbersome and hard to manage."

#: lang/json/skill_from_json.py
msgid "melee"
msgstr "melee"

#. ~ Description for melee
#: lang/json/skill_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your skill and finesse in personal combat, both with and without a weapon.  "
"Higher levels can significantly increase the accuracy and effectiveness of "
"your physical attacks."
msgstr "Your skill and finesse in personal combat, both with and without a weapon.  Higher levels can significantly increase the accuracy and effectiveness of your physical attacks."

#: lang/json/skill_from_json.py
msgid "piercing weapons"
msgstr "piercing weapons"

#. ~ Description for piercing weapons
#: lang/json/skill_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your skill in fighting with knives, spears and other such stabbing "
"implements.  Skill increases attack accuracy as well as the chance of "
"inflicting a deadly and critical blow."
msgstr "Your skill in fighting with knives, spears and other such stabbing implements.  Skill increases attack accuracy as well as the chance of inflicting a deadly and critical blow."

#: lang/json/skill_from_json.py
msgid "throwing"
msgstr "throwing"

#. ~ Description for throwing
#: lang/json/skill_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your skill in throwing objects over a distance.  Skill increases accuracy, "
"and at higher levels, the range of a throw."
msgstr "Your skill in throwing objects over a distance.  Skill increases accuracy, and at higher levels, the range of a throw."

#: lang/json/skill_from_json.py
msgid "unarmed combat"
msgstr "unarmed combat"

#. ~ Description for unarmed combat
#: lang/json/skill_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your skill in hand-to-hand fighting.  For the unskilled, it's a good way to "
"get hurt, but those with enough practice can perform special blows and "
"techniques to quickly dispatch enemies."
msgstr "Your skill in hand-to-hand fighting.  For the unskilled, it's a good way to get hurt, but those with enough practice can perform special blows and techniques to quickly dispatch enemies."

#: lang/json/skill_from_json.py
msgid "handguns"
msgstr "handguns"

#. ~ Description for handguns
#: lang/json/skill_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Handguns have poor accuracy compared to rifles, but are usually quick to "
"fire and reload faster than other guns.  They are very effective at close "
"quarters, though unsuited for long range engagement."
msgstr "Handguns have poor accuracy compared to rifles, but are usually quick to fire and reload faster than other guns.  They are very effective at close quarters, though unsuited for long range engagement."

#: lang/json/skill_from_json.py
msgid "rifles"
msgstr "rifles"

#. ~ Description for rifles
#: lang/json/skill_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Rifles have terrific range and accuracy compared to other firearms, but may "
"be slow to fire and reload, and can prove difficult to use in close "
"quarters.  Fully automatic rifles can fire rapidly, but are harder to handle"
" properly."
msgstr "Rifles have terrific range and accuracy compared to other firearms, but may be slow to fire and reload, and can prove difficult to use in close quarters.  Fully automatic rifles can fire rapidly, but are harder to handle properly."

#: lang/json/skill_from_json.py
msgid "shotguns"
msgstr "shotguns"

#. ~ Description for shotguns
#: lang/json/skill_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Shotguns are easy to shoot and can inflict massive damage, but their "
"effectiveness and accuracy decline rapidly with range.  Slugs can be loaded "
"into shotguns to provide greater range, though they are somewhat inaccurate."
msgstr "Shotguns are easy to shoot and can inflict massive damage, but their effectiveness and accuracy decline rapidly with range.  Slugs can be loaded into shotguns to provide greater range, though they are somewhat inaccurate."

#: lang/json/skill_from_json.py
msgid "submachine guns"
msgstr "submachine guns"

#. ~ Description for submachine guns
#: lang/json/skill_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Comprised of an automatic rifle carbine designed to fire a pistol cartridge,"
" submachine guns can reload and fire quickly, sometimes in bursts, but they "
"are relatively inaccurate and may be prone to mechanical failures."
msgstr "Comprised of an automatic rifle carbine designed to fire a pistol cartridge, submachine guns can reload and fire quickly, sometimes in bursts, but they are relatively inaccurate and may be prone to mechanical failures."

#: lang/json/skill_from_json.py
msgid "weapon"
msgstr "weapon"

#: lang/json/skill_from_json.py
msgid "arcana"
msgstr "arcana"

#. ~ Description for arcana
#: lang/json/skill_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your knowledge of strange, anomalous powers from far-off worlds.  While "
"certain artifacts are beyond mortal understanding, this skill can be used "
"for creating and using a few odd devices, some with lethal applications."
msgstr "Your knowledge of strange, anomalous powers from far-off worlds.  While certain artifacts are beyond mortal understanding, this skill can be used for creating and using a few odd devices, some with lethal applications."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You feel great!  It doesn't seem like wounds could even slow you down for "
"more than a day."
msgstr "You feel great!  It doesn't seem like wounds could even slow you down for more than a day."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Within moments you're ready and up.  You don't feel like anything could stop"
" you today!"
msgstr "Within moments you're ready and up.  You don't feel like anything could stop you today!"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your eyes open and your entire body feels like it is just bursting with "
"energy to burn!"
msgstr "Your eyes open and your entire body feels like it is just bursting with energy to burn!"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You feel like a rubber ball; whatever hits you, you'll just bounce back!"
msgstr "You feel like a rubber ball; whatever hits you, you'll just bounce back!"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You're up and you feel fantastic.  No sickness is going to keep you down "
"today!"
msgstr "You're up and you feel fantastic.  No sickness is going to keep you down today!"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You're up and going rather quickly, and all the little aches from yesterday "
"are gone."
msgstr "You're up and going rather quickly, and all the little aches from yesterday are gone."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You get up feeling pretty good, as if all your little aches were fading "
"faster."
msgstr "You get up feeling pretty good, as if all your little aches were fading faster."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Getting up comes easy to you, your muscles revitalized after your rest."
msgstr "Getting up comes easy to you, your muscles revitalized after your rest."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You're up and your little pains from before seem to have faded away rather "
"quickly."
msgstr "You're up and your little pains from before seem to have faded away rather quickly."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Awareness comes fast, your body coming quickly to attention after your rest."
msgstr "Awareness comes fast, your body coming quickly to attention after your rest."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "You feel good.  Healthy living does seem to have some rewards."
msgstr "You feel good.  Healthy living does seem to have some rewards."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Getting out of bed doesn't seem too hard today.  You could get used to this!"
msgstr "Getting out of bed doesn't seem too hard today.  You could get used to this!"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Alertness comes somewhat fast, and your muscles stretch easier than before "
"you went to bed."
msgstr "Alertness comes somewhat fast, and your muscles stretch easier than before you went to bed."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "You feel extra alert, and your body feels ready to go."
msgstr "You feel extra alert, and your body feels ready to go."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your body stretches with ease, and you feel ready to take on the world."
msgstr "Your body stretches with ease, and you feel ready to take on the world."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "You feel cruddy.  Maybe you should consider eating a bit healthier."
msgstr "You feel cruddy.  Maybe you should consider eating a bit healthier."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "You get up with a bit of a scratch in your throat."
msgstr "You get up with a bit of a scratch in your throat."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "You stretch, but your muscles don't seem to be doing so good today."
msgstr "You stretch, but your muscles don't seem to be doing so good today."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your stomach gurgles.  It's probably nothing, but maybe you should look into"
" eating something healthy."
msgstr "Your stomach gurgles.  It's probably nothing, but maybe you should look into eating something healthy."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You struggle to awareness.  Being awake seems somewhat harder to reach "
"today."
msgstr "You struggle to awareness.  Being awake seems somewhat harder to reach today."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Getting out of bed only comes with great difficulty, and your muscles resist"
" the movement."
msgstr "Getting out of bed only comes with great difficulty, and your muscles resist the movement."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Getting up seems like it should be easy, but all you want to do is go back "
"to bed."
msgstr "Getting up seems like it should be easy, but all you want to do is go back to bed."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Tired hands rub at your eyes, the little aches of yesterday protesting your "
"stretches."
msgstr "Tired hands rub at your eyes, the little aches of yesterday protesting your stretches."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Alertness seems flighty today, and your body argues when you move towards "
"it."
msgstr "Alertness seems flighty today, and your body argues when you move towards it."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "You're up, but your body seems like it would rather stay in bed."
msgstr "You're up, but your body seems like it would rather stay in bed."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You get up feeling horrible, as if something was messing with your body."
msgstr "You get up feeling horrible, as if something was messing with your body."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "You feel awful, and every ache from yesterday is still there."
msgstr "You feel awful, and every ache from yesterday is still there."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your eyes struggle to open, and your muscles ache like you didn't sleep at "
"all."
msgstr "Your eyes struggle to open, and your muscles ache like you didn't sleep at all."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Bleary-eyed and half-asleep, you consider why you are doing this to "
"yourself."
msgstr "Bleary-eyed and half-asleep, you consider why you are doing this to yourself."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Awareness seems to only come with a battle... and your body seem to be on "
"its side."
msgstr "Awareness seems to only come with a battle... and your body seem to be on its side."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Squirrels are pretty yummy, but if you shoot them with a high-powered gun "
"you'll probably be left with no meat!  Use a BB gun or maybe a .22 rifle."
msgstr "Squirrels are pretty yummy, but if you shoot them with a high-powered gun you'll probably be left with no meat!  Use a BB gun or maybe a .22 rifle."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Ever run into those big worm things?  If you see trails of churned-up dirt, "
"you can be sure they're around."
msgstr "Ever run into those big worm things?  If you see trails of churned-up dirt, you can be sure they're around."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Try to stay on the roads as much as you can.  Giant worms can't cross them!"
msgstr "Try to stay on the roads as much as you can.  Giant worms can't cross them!"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Don't relax after killing a giant worm.  Little bits of them can break off "
"and still attack!"
msgstr "Don't relax after killing a giant worm.  Little bits of them can break off and still attack!"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"If you see a big mob of zombies coming, RUN!  Trying to fight them all is "
"suicide unless you have a big tactical advantage."
msgstr "If you see a big mob of zombies coming, RUN!  Trying to fight them all is suicide unless you have a big tactical advantage."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Watch out for those zombies that shriek; they'll let other zombies know "
"where you are, and will attract them from all over."
msgstr "Watch out for those zombies that shriek; they'll let other zombies know where you are, and will attract them from all over."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Those acid-spitting zombies are pretty nasty, but if you're smart, you can "
"get other zombies to wade through the acid."
msgstr "Those acid-spitting zombies are pretty nasty, but if you're smart, you can get other zombies to wade through the acid."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"If there's a pool of acid blocking your way, trying tossing a junk item into"
" it.  Eating up items will help neutralize the acid faster."
msgstr "If there's a pool of acid blocking your way, trying tossing a junk item into it.  Eating up items will help neutralize the acid faster."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"There's this type of zombie that can shoot bolts of lightning!  Stay away "
"from walls and stuff when they do... the electricity can travel along solid "
"surfaces."
msgstr "There's this type of zombie that can shoot bolts of lightning!  Stay away from walls and stuff when they do... the electricity can travel along solid surfaces."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Zombie hulks are NASTY, but they're easy to outsmart.  If there's other "
"monsters between you and them, they'll kill the monster for you!"
msgstr "Zombie hulks are NASTY, but they're easy to outsmart.  If there's other monsters between you and them, they'll kill the monster for you!"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"If you run into a zombie hulk, it's probably a good idea to run.  They're "
"fast as hell, but pretty dumb; they'll try to smash through obstacles rather"
" than going around, and that slows them down a lot."
msgstr "If you run into a zombie hulk, it's probably a good idea to run.  They're fast as hell, but pretty dumb; they'll try to smash through obstacles rather than going around, and that slows them down a lot."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Zombie brutes and hulks have really tough hide.  Don't bother shooting at "
"them with lower-caliber guns, the bullet will bounce right off!"
msgstr "Zombie brutes and hulks have really tough hide.  Don't bother shooting at them with lower-caliber guns, the bullet will bounce right off!"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Try not to kill a boomer if it's standing right next to you.  They tend to "
"explode when they die, and that pink goop will get all over you."
msgstr "Try not to kill a boomer if it's standing right next to you.  They tend to explode when they die, and that pink goop will get all over you."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Skeletons are a tough target.  They're so skinny and full of holes that "
"bullets fired at them will usually just fly right past."
msgstr "Skeletons are a tough target.  They're so skinny and full of holes that bullets fired at them will usually just fly right past."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Skeletons are too delicate to smash through doors or windows.  They also "
"can't smell you, unlike zombies, so if you turn your light off at night you "
"can sneak right past."
msgstr "Skeletons are too delicate to smash through doors or windows.  They also can't smell you, unlike zombies, so if you turn your light off at night you can sneak right past."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Don't try to take on a skeleton with a bladed weapon... you'll just leave "
"scratch marks.  You've got to shatter those bones with a hammer or "
"something."
msgstr "Don't try to take on a skeleton with a bladed weapon... you'll just leave scratch marks.  You've got to shatter those bones with a hammer or something."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"It's a good idea to butcher corpses if you have the time, even if you don't "
"plan on eating them.  I've seen these weird zombies bring their friends back"
" from the dead!"
msgstr "It's a good idea to butcher corpses if you have the time, even if you don't plan on eating them.  I've seen these weird zombies bring their friends back from the dead!"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Triffids are tough.  They've got natural armor, and it takes a lot to bring "
"them down.  I don't recommend getting into a fight with them."
msgstr "Triffids are tough.  They've got natural armor, and it takes a lot to bring them down.  I don't recommend getting into a fight with them."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Triffids can't see!  They figure out where you are by your smell, but if you"
" mask it with smoke or something, you're as good as invisible."
msgstr "Triffids can't see!  They figure out where you are by your smell, but if you mask it with smoke or something, you're as good as invisible."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"I figured out how to take care of those triffids!  Let me just say this: "
"they're made of wood, and wood and fire don't mix."
msgstr "I figured out how to take care of those triffids!  Let me just say this: they're made of wood, and wood and fire don't mix."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Have you heard about those queen triffids?  You gotta keep your distance "
"from them, unless you like having a tree grow right through your chest."
msgstr "Have you heard about those queen triffids?  You gotta keep your distance from them, unless you like having a tree grow right through your chest."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"I have a buddy who was sleeping in this cabin way out in the woods, when he "
"suddenly woke up to trees and vines growing right up through the floor and "
"walls!  He said it was some kind of huge triffid making it happen..."
msgstr "I have a buddy who was sleeping in this cabin way out in the woods, when he suddenly woke up to trees and vines growing right up through the floor and walls!  He said it was some kind of huge triffid making it happen..."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Oh man, have you gone down into the old subway systems?  I'd be careful... "
"there's these things down there that are like zombies, but tougher."
msgstr "Oh man, have you gone down into the old subway systems?  I'd be careful... there's these things down there that are like zombies, but tougher."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"There's snakes down in most of the old sewer systems.  They're slow on land,"
" but boy, those suckers can swim fast!"
msgstr "There's snakes down in most of the old sewer systems.  They're slow on land, but boy, those suckers can swim fast!"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"If you're planning on wandering around the sewers--not that you'd have a "
"reason too--watch out for those fish.  Those suckers are fast, and vicious "
"too!"
msgstr "If you're planning on wandering around the sewers--not that you'd have a reason too--watch out for those fish.  Those suckers are fast, and vicious too!"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Have you seen those eyebots flying around?  It's hard to say, but some "
"faction's controlling them--maybe the military.  All I know is, I don't want"
" them taking my picture..."
msgstr "Have you seen those eyebots flying around?  It's hard to say, but some faction's controlling them--maybe the military.  All I know is, I don't want them taking my picture..."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Ever go toe-to-toe with a manhack?  Tiny little helicopters covered in "
"knives.  Best be packing a shotgun!"
msgstr "Ever go toe-to-toe with a manhack?  Tiny little helicopters covered in knives.  Best be packing a shotgun!"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"They're rare, but molebots are nasty things.  They bore through the ground, "
"then pop up to stab ya.  Still, you're safe from them if you stay on "
"pavement..."
msgstr "They're rare, but molebots are nasty things.  They bore through the ground, then pop up to stab ya.  Still, you're safe from them if you stay on pavement..."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "Don't fire your gun if you can help it--the noise attracts monsters!"
msgstr "Don't fire your gun if you can help it--the noise attracts monsters!"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Standing behind a window is a good tactic.  It takes zombies a long time to "
"crawl through, giving you lots of opportunities to hit them."
msgstr "Standing behind a window is a good tactic.  It takes zombies a long time to crawl through, giving you lots of opportunities to hit them."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Zombies are pretty dumb... heck, most monsters are!  If you can get a fire "
"going between you and them, they'll just run straight through it."
msgstr "Zombies are pretty dumb... heck, most monsters are!  If you can get a fire going between you and them, they'll just run straight through it."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"I know it's tempting to just go full-auto and unload as many bullets as "
"possible, but don't except as a last resort.  It's inaccurate and wastes "
"ammo."
msgstr "I know it's tempting to just go full-auto and unload as many bullets as possible, but don't except as a last resort.  It's inaccurate and wastes ammo."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"If there's a bunch of zombies in a straight line, try unloading a burst from"
" your gun.  Be sure to aim at the zombie furthest away; you'll hit more of "
"them that way."
msgstr "If there's a bunch of zombies in a straight line, try unloading a burst from your gun.  Be sure to aim at the zombie furthest away; you'll hit more of them that way."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"If you shoot a zombie, but don't quite kill it, try to finish it off with a "
"punch or something instead of wasting a bullet."
msgstr "If you shoot a zombie, but don't quite kill it, try to finish it off with a punch or something instead of wasting a bullet."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"If you're in a corridor or something, and there's a bunch of zombies chasing"
" you down it, try to wound the guy in front badly.  He'll start moving slow "
"and cause a serious traffic jam!"
msgstr "If you're in a corridor or something, and there's a bunch of zombies chasing you down it, try to wound the guy in front badly.  He'll start moving slow and cause a serious traffic jam!"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Here's a trick for taking care of a huge swarm of zombies chasing you: head "
"into a liquor store, shoot out as many bottles as you can, then light the "
"alcohol on fire.  Then duck out the back door, and watch the zombies run "
"into a burning building!"
msgstr "Here's a trick for taking care of a huge swarm of zombies chasing you: head into a liquor store, shoot out as many bottles as you can, then light the alcohol on fire.  Then duck out the back door, and watch the zombies run into a burning building!"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Sledge hammers may seem like a great weapon, but swinging them is really "
"slow, and you won't do much damage unless you're really strong."
msgstr "Sledge hammers may seem like a great weapon, but swinging them is really slow, and you won't do much damage unless you're really strong."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"For a good melee weapon, you can't beat a machete.  I've seen a guy take "
"down a zombie brute with one!  Of course, if you can find a katana, that "
"might be even better..."
msgstr "For a good melee weapon, you can't beat a machete.  I've seen a guy take down a zombie brute with one!  Of course, if you can find a katana, that might be even better..."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You know, a glass bottle can make a good weapon in a pinch.  If you break it"
" over someone's head, the shattering glass will hurt them extra.  Of course,"
" it might hurt your hands, too..."
msgstr "You know, a glass bottle can make a good weapon in a pinch.  If you break it over someone's head, the shattering glass will hurt them extra.  Of course, it might hurt your hands, too..."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You know what makes a nice weapon?  Take a two by four, or a baseball bat or"
" something, and stick a bunch of nails through the end!"
msgstr "You know what makes a nice weapon?  Take a two by four, or a baseball bat or something, and stick a bunch of nails through the end!"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"BB guns may seem like a joke, but they've got their uses.  They're good for "
"hunting small game, or getting to know the basics of rifles."
msgstr "BB guns may seem like a joke, but they've got their uses.  They're good for hunting small game, or getting to know the basics of rifles."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Crossbows are a great weapon for long term use.  Most of the time, you can "
"retrieve the bolt after shooting it, so running out of ammo is less of a "
"concern."
msgstr "Crossbows are a great weapon for long term use.  Most of the time, you can retrieve the bolt after shooting it, so running out of ammo is less of a concern."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"It's good to keep a pistol handy, in case your main gun runs out of ammo or "
"something.  They're also better than most guns at short range."
msgstr "It's good to keep a pistol handy, in case your main gun runs out of ammo or something.  They're also better than most guns at short range."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Shotguns are nice; you can take out lots of baddies with a single shot.  "
"Just remember that they're noisy as hell, and you might end up attracting "
"more than you kill."
msgstr "Shotguns are nice; you can take out lots of baddies with a single shot.  Just remember that they're noisy as hell, and you might end up attracting more than you kill."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A good submachine gun can't be beat.  Most of them use common ammo, they're "
"good at short and long range, and you can burst-fire if you need to!"
msgstr "A good submachine gun can't be beat.  Most of them use common ammo, they're good at short and long range, and you can burst-fire if you need to!"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Hunting rifles are great at long range, but suck close up.  Plus, most of "
"them don't carry many rounds.  Keep a pistol as a sidearm if you use a "
"rifle."
msgstr "Hunting rifles are great at long range, but suck close up.  Plus, most of them don't carry many rounds.  Keep a pistol as a sidearm if you use a rifle."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You know, you don't have to go full auto with an assault rifle.  Firing "
"single shots is more accurate and efficient!"
msgstr "You know, you don't have to go full auto with an assault rifle.  Firing single shots is more accurate and efficient!"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"I've seen a couple guys running around with laser pistols.  They seem like "
"the perfect weapon... quiet, accurate, and deadly.  But I've never found "
"one, and I bet ammo is wicked scarce..."
msgstr "I've seen a couple guys running around with laser pistols.  They seem like the perfect weapon... quiet, accurate, and deadly.  But I've never found one, and I bet ammo is wicked scarce..."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"When it comes to footwear, you've got two basic choices as far as I see it; "
"sneakers, for running extra fast, or boots for durability.  Depends on your "
"style, I guess."
msgstr "When it comes to footwear, you've got two basic choices as far as I see it; sneakers, for running extra fast, or boots for durability.  Depends on your style, I guess."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You don't really need to wear gloves most of the time, but once in a while "
"they'll really come in handy."
msgstr "You don't really need to wear gloves most of the time, but once in a while they'll really come in handy."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"It's good to keep a filter mask or gas mask handy.  You never know when "
"you'll have to go into a smoke-filled room or something."
msgstr "It's good to keep a filter mask or gas mask handy.  You never know when you'll have to go into a smoke-filled room or something."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"There's basically no reason not to wear safety glasses... nothing is worse "
"than taking a hit to the eyes and getting blinded for a few seconds."
msgstr "There's basically no reason not to wear safety glasses... nothing is worse than taking a hit to the eyes and getting blinded for a few seconds."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Ski goggles are a great choice if you're worried about getting stuff in your"
" eyes.  Perfect for dealing with boomers!"
msgstr "Ski goggles are a great choice if you're worried about getting stuff in your eyes.  Perfect for dealing with boomers!"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"If you get a pair of night vision goggles, hold on to them!  A flashlight "
"will give you away, but with goggles you can be sneaky.  Beware that some "
"types of zombies are camouflaged against it, and require proper light to be "
"visible."
msgstr "If you get a pair of night vision goggles, hold on to them!  A flashlight will give you away, but with goggles you can be sneaky.  Beware that some types of zombies are camouflaged against it, and require proper light to be visible."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"I know they look dumb, but wearing a fanny pack gives you that extra bit of "
"storage without encumbering you."
msgstr "I know they look dumb, but wearing a fanny pack gives you that extra bit of storage without encumbering you."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Backpacks let you carry lots of stuff, but they limit your movement a lot.  "
"If you're an unarmed fighter, don't wear one!"
msgstr "Backpacks let you carry lots of stuff, but they limit your movement a lot.  If you're an unarmed fighter, don't wear one!"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Don't underestimate a good book.  Not only will it keep you company on "
"lonely nights, but you can learn a hell of a lot from some of them."
msgstr "Don't underestimate a good book.  Not only will it keep you company on lonely nights, but you can learn a hell of a lot from some of them."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"It's a good idea to carry around a couple of empty bottles.  You can fill "
"them up with water, gasoline, or whatever!"
msgstr "It's a good idea to carry around a couple of empty bottles.  You can fill them up with water, gasoline, or whatever!"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"If you need a bunch of rags for making Molotov cocktails, take a pair of "
"scissors to an old t-shirt or something."
msgstr "If you need a bunch of rags for making Molotov cocktails, take a pair of scissors to an old t-shirt or something."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Carrying a lighter is something all veterans do.  It takes up almost no "
"space, and can easily save your life."
msgstr "Carrying a lighter is something all veterans do.  It takes up almost no space, and can easily save your life."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"If you can spare the space, you might want to carry a fire extinguisher "
"along.  Nothing is worse than being trapped in a burning building!"
msgstr "If you can spare the space, you might want to carry a fire extinguisher along.  Nothing is worse than being trapped in a burning building!"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Crowbars not only make a pretty good weapon, they're also useful for opening"
" locked doors and lifting manhole covers."
msgstr "Crowbars not only make a pretty good weapon, they're also useful for opening locked doors and lifting manhole covers."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"If you're spending the night in a dangerous area, grab a shovel and dig pits"
" all around your camp."
msgstr "If you're spending the night in a dangerous area, grab a shovel and dig pits all around your camp."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A chainsaw may seem like a great weapon, but remember that they're slow, "
"unwieldy, and very noisy."
msgstr "A chainsaw may seem like a great weapon, but remember that they're slow, unwieldy, and very noisy."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Bubblewrap is pretty harmless, but setting it up around you before going to "
"sleep will keep you from waking up to a zombie punching you."
msgstr "Bubblewrap is pretty harmless, but setting it up around you before going to sleep will keep you from waking up to a zombie punching you."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Bear traps are a nice way to cover an escape.  If you place one in a "
"doorway, the first zombie through will get stuck, and the rest won't be able"
" to get past!"
msgstr "Bear traps are a nice way to cover an escape.  If you place one in a doorway, the first zombie through will get stuck, and the rest won't be able to get past!"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Smoke grenades aren't really offensive weapons, but they'll cover up your "
"scent and hide you from view--perfect for making a quick escape."
msgstr "Smoke grenades aren't really offensive weapons, but they'll cover up your scent and hide you from view--perfect for making a quick escape."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "Don't use Molotovs indoors.  Especially in a liquor store."
msgstr "Don't use Molotovs indoors.  Especially in a liquor store."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"If you're going to be playing with Molotov cocktails around a gas station, "
"just make sure you're a long way from those pumps."
msgstr "If you're going to be playing with Molotov cocktails around a gas station, just make sure you're a long way from those pumps."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"I once knew a guy who figured he'd survive a night in the subway by setting "
"fires blocking off the tunnel in both directions and sleeping between them."
"  He wound up asphyxiating on the smoke."
msgstr "I once knew a guy who figured he'd survive a night in the subway by setting fires blocking off the tunnel in both directions and sleeping between them.  He wound up asphyxiating on the smoke."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Don't light a Molotov until you're ready to throw it.  Not only can they go "
"out, but if you accidentally drop it or something, you're in trouble."
msgstr "Don't light a Molotov until you're ready to throw it.  Not only can they go out, but if you accidentally drop it or something, you're in trouble."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"If you're weak or clumsy, it might be a good idea not to mess with Molotovs "
"or grenades.  Accidentally dropping them when you meant to throw them could "
"be deadly."
msgstr "If you're weak or clumsy, it might be a good idea not to mess with Molotovs or grenades.  Accidentally dropping them when you meant to throw them could be deadly."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"If you're wandering in the wilderness, or following a road, keep an eye out "
"for wild strawberries or blueberries."
msgstr "If you're wandering in the wilderness, or following a road, keep an eye out for wild strawberries or blueberries."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Be careful eating wild mushrooms.  Some are poisonous, and others can make "
"you hallucinate."
msgstr "Be careful eating wild mushrooms.  Some are poisonous, and others can make you hallucinate."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Try to go around swamps, if you can.  Some of them have sinkholes that can "
"pull you right underground."
msgstr "Try to go around swamps, if you can.  Some of them have sinkholes that can pull you right underground."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"I heard about this group that raided a bee hive a while ago.  Everyone got "
"massacred but one, and he came home with this weird, magic honey stuff."
msgstr "I heard about this group that raided a bee hive a while ago.  Everyone got massacred but one, and he came home with this weird, magic honey stuff."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"If you need to, you can swim across a river to escape; most monsters can't "
"swim.  Just make sure you drop as much stuff as possible first, and maybe "
"strip naked, or you'll sink like a rock."
msgstr "If you need to, you can swim across a river to escape; most monsters can't swim.  Just make sure you drop as much stuff as possible first, and maybe strip naked, or you'll sink like a rock."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Houses can be a surprisingly good resource for all kinds of stuff; clothing,"
" medication, food, books, and more."
msgstr "Houses can be a surprisingly good resource for all kinds of stuff; clothing, medication, food, books, and more."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"While there's not much to loot, gas stations are a good source for gasoline,"
" to power tools or to make Molotov cocktails."
msgstr "While there's not much to loot, gas stations are a good source for gasoline, to power tools or to make Molotov cocktails."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"It's not like in the movies--shooting a gas pump won't make it explode.  But"
" it WILL make it leak all over the place, which is a definite fire hazard."
msgstr "It's not like in the movies--shooting a gas pump won't make it explode.  But it WILL make it leak all over the place, which is a definite fire hazard."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"I know grocery stores and stuff are full of fruit, but be careful, it's "
"probably rotten."
msgstr "I know grocery stores and stuff are full of fruit, but be careful, it's probably rotten."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Next time you visit a grocery store, load up on canned goods.  They never go"
" bad!"
msgstr "Next time you visit a grocery store, load up on canned goods.  They never go bad!"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"I've found more good weapons in hardware stores than anywhere else.  Except "
"gun stores, of course."
msgstr "I've found more good weapons in hardware stores than anywhere else.  Except gun stores, of course."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Liquor stores are a great place to pick up non-alcoholic beverages, too.  "
"Not that I mind alcohol!"
msgstr "Liquor stores are a great place to pick up non-alcoholic beverages, too.  Not that I mind alcohol!"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Most gun stores follow pretty similar layouts.  The restricted stuff--SMGs, "
"assault rifles, and most importantly ammo--are always behind the counter."
msgstr "Most gun stores follow pretty similar layouts.  The restricted stuff--SMGs, assault rifles, and most importantly ammo--are always behind the counter."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"I've spent many nights in the changing rooms at the back of clothing stores."
"  Walls on four sides, far from the store's entrance, a corridor for easy "
"defense... it's perfect!"
msgstr "I've spent many nights in the changing rooms at the back of clothing stores.  Walls on four sides, far from the store's entrance, a corridor for easy defense... it's perfect!"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"If you're getting chased by a hoard of zombies, try ducking into the subways"
" and traveling a block or two, then coming back up."
msgstr "If you're getting chased by a hoard of zombies, try ducking into the subways and traveling a block or two, then coming back up."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Have you seen those weird science labs out in the middle of nowhere?  I "
"think you need some kind of special ID card to get in."
msgstr "Have you seen those weird science labs out in the middle of nowhere?  I think you need some kind of special ID card to get in."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"I've thought about raiding an ant hill before, but I realized it wasn't "
"worth the risk.  I doubt they have any loot beyond some scraps of food, you "
"know?"
msgstr "I've thought about raiding an ant hill before, but I realized it wasn't worth the risk.  I doubt they have any loot beyond some scraps of food, you know?"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This guy I know was walking through the subway when he came across a giant "
"rift in the earth, with lava far below.  Weird, huh?"
msgstr "This guy I know was walking through the subway when he came across a giant rift in the earth, with lava far below.  Weird, huh?"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"In a lot of places, there's little hallways connecting the subways with the "
"sewers, with heavy metal doors on both ends.  It's a perfect place to sleep!"
msgstr "In a lot of places, there's little hallways connecting the subways with the sewers, with heavy metal doors on both ends.  It's a perfect place to sleep!"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Be careful of drinking water from rivers and stuff, it's a good way to get "
"sick.  But if you have a water purifier, it'll make it safe."
msgstr "Be careful of drinking water from rivers and stuff, it's a good way to get sick.  But if you have a water purifier, it'll make it safe."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"General Carlsberg wanted us to figure out what's going on with the bot AI.  "
"Apparently the fat-cat defense contractors' toy tank has ranging issues or "
"something: 31-34 meters and it's apparently impotent.  The Director sent 'em"
" back with a note that we're scientists, not firmware devs."
msgstr "General Carlsberg wanted us to figure out what's going on with the bot AI.  Apparently the fat-cat defense contractors' toy tank has ranging issues or something: 31-34 meters and it's apparently impotent.  The Director sent 'em back with a note that we're scientists, not firmware devs."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Our chemical department has made great strides in the production of a "
"concentrated mutagen, derived from samples of PE012."
msgstr "Our chemical department has made great strides in the production of a concentrated mutagen, derived from samples of PE012."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Our chemical department has perfected an untargeted stem cell treatment.  "
"Consumption of the treatment will reverse the effects of mutation, and may "
"even cure congenital defects.  This substance has been denoted PE018."
msgstr "Our chemical department has perfected an untargeted stem cell treatment.  Consumption of the treatment will reverse the effects of mutation, and may even cure congenital defects.  This substance has been denoted PE018."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Both PE012 and PE018 show great stability.  A subject was exposed to both "
"substances, alternating between the mutagen and the purifier.  Ultimately, "
"the subject returned to baseline state with no apparent side effects."
msgstr "Both PE012 and PE018 show great stability.  A subject was exposed to both substances, alternating between the mutagen and the purifier.  Ultimately, the subject returned to baseline state with no apparent side effects."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
":.||||ERROR||With XE037 having breached confinement, Dr. Maiar recommends "
"that we prepare for the inevitable.  PE050 can be quickly and cheaply "
"reconfigured for |||||ERROR: FILE CORRUPT|||||"
msgstr ":.||||ERROR||With XE037 having breached confinement, Dr. Maiar recommends that we prepare for the inevitable.  PE050 can be quickly and cheaply reconfigured for |||||ERROR: FILE CORRUPT|||||"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Dr. Maiar has been terminated for engaging in unethical research on human "
"subjects.  His notes are being destroyed and all personnel under him have "
"been reassigned.  Further discussion of or attempts to carry on his work "
"will be grounds for immediate termination."
msgstr "Dr. Maiar has been terminated for engaging in unethical research on human subjects.  His notes are being destroyed and all personnel under him have been reassigned.  Further discussion of or attempts to carry on his work will be grounds for immediate termination."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"|||ERROR: UNREFERENCED MEMORY 0Ex670c9e1f5, REROUTING: CENSORSHIP IS A "
"BREAKDOWN, WE ROUTE AROUND IT.  THE WORD IS ALREADY OUT.  NOBODY DROPS MAIAR"
" INTO LAVA.||||||"
msgstr "|||ERROR: UNREFERENCED MEMORY 0Ex670c9e1f5, REROUTING: CENSORSHIP IS A BREAKDOWN, WE ROUTE AROUND IT.  THE WORD IS ALREADY OUT.  NOBODY DROPS MAIAR INTO LAVA.||||||"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Given the current population projections, PE065 deployment is no longer "
"feasible.  We simply haven't the stock.  Remaining chemical and "
"psychopharmacological department assets are being assigned to Dr. Sattler's "
"PE070 project."
msgstr "Given the current population projections, PE065 deployment is no longer feasible.  We simply haven't the stock.  Remaining chemical and psychopharmacological department assets are being assigned to Dr. Sattler's PE070 project."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Dr. Maiar's success with intravenous mutagenic administration has been "
"adopted facility-wide; insofar as any of our work can ever be 'published', "
"he and his team hit the jackpot.  IV administration is quicker and easier, "
"and in some cases is reportedly more efficient, than the oral techniques we "
"have been using."
msgstr "Dr. Maiar's success with intravenous mutagenic administration has been adopted facility-wide; insofar as any of our work can ever be 'published', he and his team hit the jackpot.  IV administration is quicker and easier, and in some cases is reportedly more efficient, than the oral techniques we have been using."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Recent fieldwork and extraction efforts have resulted in a series of "
"mutagens tailored to focus the mutation process into particular subtypes.  "
"These have been designated PE025 through 037.  Though significantly more "
"resource- and time-intensive to produce, they promise a bold new transhuman "
"future.  Several research teams are already investigating possible "
"applications."
msgstr "Recent fieldwork and extraction efforts have resulted in a series of mutagens tailored to focus the mutation process into particular subtypes.  These have been designated PE025 through 037.  Though significantly more resource- and time-intensive to produce, they promise a bold new transhuman future.  Several research teams are already investigating possible applications."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The chemical department has come through with a stable mutagen cocktail.  "
"PE050 shows promise as an all-around genetic enhancement, with the worst "
"side effect being digestive upset.  The lack of macro-scale physical changes"
" makes it ideal for both military and civilian applications."
msgstr "The chemical department has come through with a stable mutagen cocktail.  PE050 shows promise as an all-around genetic enhancement, with the worst side effect being digestive upset.  The lack of macro-scale physical changes makes it ideal for both military and civilian applications."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Dr. Dionne's team has come up with an ambitious mutagenic cocktail, dubbed "
"PE065.  Though its effects are wildly polymorphic and unstable, to say the "
"least, he suggests that several such mutants could effectively check the "
"spread of reanimated XE037 infectees.  We are looking into implementation "
"methodology."
msgstr "Dr. Dionne's team has come up with an ambitious mutagenic cocktail, dubbed PE065.  Though its effects are wildly polymorphic and unstable, to say the least, he suggests that several such mutants could effectively check the spread of reanimated XE037 infectees.  We are looking into implementation methodology."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"We have made a fascinating discovery; by creating a miniature portal with "
"low stability and high power, one can transpose into the 4th dimension and "
"return immediately, but shifted by several meters.  Our subjects oscillated "
"so quickly that none were even aware that they had visited lower planes."
msgstr "We have made a fascinating discovery; by creating a miniature portal with low stability and high power, one can transpose into the 4th dimension and return immediately, but shifted by several meters.  Our subjects oscillated so quickly that none were even aware that they had visited lower planes."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The research team headed by Dr. Isha has produced a concentrated form of "
"mutagen that shows promising results for the treatment of many forms of "
"disease.  Testing reveals that it inhibits the body's pain responses while "
"bolstering the immune system and natural regenerative capabilities, though a"
" few troubling behavioral side effects have been reported."
msgstr "The research team headed by Dr. Isha has produced a concentrated form of mutagen that shows promising results for the treatment of many forms of disease.  Testing reveals that it inhibits the body's pain responses while bolstering the immune system and natural regenerative capabilities, though a few troubling behavioral side effects have been reported."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Our research on teleportation has ground to a halt.  For some reason, the "
"creation of a long-range transportation device eludes us, and one can "
"transfer no further than 30 meters."
msgstr "Our research on teleportation has ground to a halt.  For some reason, the creation of a long-range transportation device eludes us, and one can transfer no further than 30 meters."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"I don't know how it happened, but a janitor managed to activate the portal "
"while cleaning the lab, shifting in an assortment of prehistoric fauna.  "
"Security was called in immediately but was unable to save the janitor from "
"being torn apart.  By the time the confusion settled, all the fauna had been"
" terminated."
msgstr "I don't know how it happened, but a janitor managed to activate the portal while cleaning the lab, shifting in an assortment of prehistoric fauna.  Security was called in immediately but was unable to save the janitor from being torn apart.  By the time the confusion settled, all the fauna had been terminated."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Tests on the prehistoric fauna show extremely close genetic relationships "
"with extant and extinct terranean animals.  It might be that the portal had "
"performed a transposition in time, unfortunately the portal device was "
"destroyed when security put down the fauna."
msgstr "Tests on the prehistoric fauna show extremely close genetic relationships with extant and extinct terranean animals.  It might be that the portal had performed a transposition in time, unfortunately the portal device was destroyed when security put down the fauna."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An incident occurred in the teleportation lab, wherein a subject managed to "
"teleport into another subject.  The latter was completely destroyed from the"
" inside out, while the former sustained little damage.  I would like to "
"explore the phenomenon further, but subjects are expensive."
msgstr "An incident occurred in the teleportation lab, wherein a subject managed to teleport into another subject.  The latter was completely destroyed from the inside out, while the former sustained little damage.  I would like to explore the phenomenon further, but subjects are expensive."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Test subjects in the teleportation department are showing alarming symptoms."
"  It seems prolonged rapid transposition along the 4th dimension weakens the"
" forces holding one on this plane."
msgstr "Test subjects in the teleportation department are showing alarming symptoms.  It seems prolonged rapid transposition along the 4th dimension weakens the forces holding one on this plane."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Catastrophe struck in our teleportation department yesterday.  It seems that"
" our test subjects are so detached from this plane that they create "
"occasional tunnels along the 4th dimension, allowing life forms to transfer "
"to this plane.  All subjects with prolonged exposure have been terminated."
msgstr "Catastrophe struck in our teleportation department yesterday.  It seems that our test subjects are so detached from this plane that they create occasional tunnels along the 4th dimension, allowing life forms to transfer to this plane.  All subjects with prolonged exposure have been terminated."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Our lifeform extraction program continues to produce samples of specimen "
"XE037.  It seems to be a kind of living, semi-sentient primordial ooze, and "
"is the basis of much of the life we have found."
msgstr "Our lifeform extraction program continues to produce samples of specimen XE037.  It seems to be a kind of living, semi-sentient primordial ooze, and is the basis of much of the life we have found."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Specimen XE037, jokingly referred to as \"the blob\", has been observed "
"entering a kind of dormant state, forming a depression in the floor.  "
"Hendelson stepped into one of these pits yesterday, and was immediately "
"coated and attacked."
msgstr "Specimen XE037, jokingly referred to as \"the blob\", has been observed entering a kind of dormant state, forming a depression in the floor.  Hendelson stepped into one of these pits yesterday, and was immediately coated and attacked."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"XE037 shows promise as a catalyst for both cloning and treatments that mimic"
" stem cells.  This is further evidence supporting Hendelson's theory of a "
"near universal symbiotic relationship involving XE037."
msgstr "XE037 shows promise as a catalyst for both cloning and treatments that mimic stem cells.  This is further evidence supporting Hendelson's theory of a near universal symbiotic relationship involving XE037."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Several of the more advanced specimens we have retrieved show stunning "
"similarity to XE037.  XE142 and XE157 in particular show the same amorphous,"
" slime-like structure as XE037, suggesting a close genetic relationship."
msgstr "Several of the more advanced specimens we have retrieved show stunning similarity to XE037.  XE142 and XE157 in particular show the same amorphous, slime-like structure as XE037, suggesting a close genetic relationship."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Today we tested weaponry against XE142 and XE157, two amorphous subprime "
"samples.  Their form proved to be nearly invulnerable to projectile based "
"weaponry, but they were susceptible to directed energy weapons and "
"flagration."
msgstr "Today we tested weaponry against XE142 and XE157, two amorphous subprime samples.  Their form proved to be nearly invulnerable to projectile based weaponry, but they were susceptible to directed energy weapons and flagration."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Our cloning department has failed to produce results.  In vats containing "
"stem cell treatments, XE037, and control vats, the subjects simple "
"disintegrated.  This suggests that XE037, while compatible with subprime "
"lifeforms, shows only destructive effects on prime plane lifeforms."
msgstr "Our cloning department has failed to produce results.  In vats containing stem cell treatments, XE037, and control vats, the subjects simple disintegrated.  This suggests that XE037, while compatible with subprime lifeforms, shows only destructive effects on prime plane lifeforms."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The vivisection program has shown mixed results, revealing an incredible "
"degree of variation in subplane lifeforms.  Certain specimens have an "
"internal structure that is amazingly similar to that of mammals, while "
"others seem to have no internal structure at all."
msgstr "The vivisection program has shown mixed results, revealing an incredible degree of variation in subplane lifeforms.  Certain specimens have an internal structure that is amazingly similar to that of mammals, while others seem to have no internal structure at all."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Our security department has identified several key flaws.  Though our "
"surface entrance is quite secure, there are several possible points of entry"
" below the surface, particularly in the sewage systems."
msgstr "Our security department has identified several key flaws.  Though our surface entrance is quite secure, there are several possible points of entry below the surface, particularly in the sewage systems."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Today we applied a very small sample of XE037, suspended in water, to "
"subject TP92, prior to necessary termination.  During the postmortem "
"examination, the subject went through a revivification progress, but "
"displayed next to no human intelligence."
msgstr "Today we applied a very small sample of XE037, suspended in water, to subject TP92, prior to necessary termination.  During the postmortem examination, the subject went through a revivification progress, but displayed next to no human intelligence."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Mendelson shows a dismaying lack of organization and security consciousness."
"  Containment of all samples of XE037 is of critical importance, as shown by"
" contamination experiments."
msgstr "Mendelson shows a dismaying lack of organization and security consciousness.  Containment of all samples of XE037 is of critical importance, as shown by contamination experiments."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Mendelson has been terminated following an incident with XE037.  A "
"substantial mobile sample departed his lab and encountered our security "
"forces.  Before the sample was destroyed, it managed to kill two men.  "
"Alarmingly, their corpses displayed mobility and extreme aggression."
msgstr "Mendelson has been terminated following an incident with XE037.  A substantial mobile sample departed his lab and encountered our security forces.  Before the sample was destroyed, it managed to kill two men.  Alarmingly, their corpses displayed mobility and extreme aggression."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"We have created a new department to investigate the effects of XE037 on the "
"human body, specifically to examine the revivification effect observed on "
"two prior occasions.  Sadly, our human subject pool is dwindling due to the "
"short lifespan of subjects in this program.  More will be acquired soon."
msgstr "We have created a new department to investigate the effects of XE037 on the human body, specifically to examine the revivification effect observed on two prior occasions.  Sadly, our human subject pool is dwindling due to the short lifespan of subjects in this program.  More will be acquired soon."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Testing XE037 on non-human mammal subjects does not appear to display the "
"same revivifying effect, oddly enough.  Acquiring non-human subjects, sadly,"
" is a long and costly process, and research into this area is lacking."
msgstr "Testing XE037 on non-human mammal subjects does not appear to display the same revivifying effect, oddly enough.  Acquiring non-human subjects, sadly, is a long and costly process, and research into this area is lacking."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"After our curious results with testing XE037 on non-human mammals, we "
"decided to introduce the substance to some of the insects which have found "
"their way into the lab.  Horrifyingly, XE037 caused near-instant mutation "
"and gigantism in the insects, and security intervention was required."
msgstr "After our curious results with testing XE037 on non-human mammals, we decided to introduce the substance to some of the insects which have found their way into the lab.  Horrifyingly, XE037 caused near-instant mutation and gigantism in the insects, and security intervention was required."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Earlier conjecture that revivification occurred only in humans and insects "
"was premature.  Exposure introduces a persistent, low level infection in all"
" mammal subjects, but quickly enters a form of stasis and seems to go "
"dormant."
msgstr "Earlier conjecture that revivification occurred only in humans and insects was premature.  Exposure introduces a persistent, low level infection in all mammal subjects, but quickly enters a form of stasis and seems to go dormant."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The primary factor in determining revivification of mammalian subjects seems"
" to be the amount of XE037 within the body at time of expiration.  Smaller "
"mammals such as lab rats do not obtain this critical mass of XE037 before "
"going dormant.  Larger canine subjects, however, do."
msgstr "The primary factor in determining revivification of mammalian subjects seems to be the amount of XE037 within the body at time of expiration.  Smaller mammals such as lab rats do not obtain this critical mass of XE037 before going dormant.  Larger canine subjects, however, do."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"I swear they are talking to me.  No one believes me.  No one understands.  "
"They whisper to me, at night, in the dark.  Please, please, make them stop."
msgstr "I swear they are talking to me.  No one believes me.  No one understands.  They whisper to me, at night, in the dark.  Please, please, make them stop."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Program S37ZBE, investigation of XE037 on inert human bodies, is making "
"great strides.  Recently we found that XE037 has no effect when introduced "
"to a deceased body; revivification only occurs when the subject is exposed "
"to XE037 prior to expiration."
msgstr "Program S37ZBE, investigation of XE037 on inert human bodies, is making great strides.  Recently we found that XE037 has no effect when introduced to a deceased body; revivification only occurs when the subject is exposed to XE037 prior to expiration."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Attempts to surpass the XE037 mammalian stasis limit have had some success."
"  Direct subcutaneous injection of XE037 quickly spreads through the body, "
"and while it immediately enters stasis after equalizing, it remains in the "
"body."
msgstr "Attempts to surpass the XE037 mammalian stasis limit have had some success.  Direct subcutaneous injection of XE037 quickly spreads through the body, and while it immediately enters stasis after equalizing, it remains in the body."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"There has been an incident in Lab 24, 2 casualties reported, one lethal.  A "
"rat involved in the stasis breaking project was hooked to a monitoring "
"machine and left over night.  Upon opening the cage, Simon Bellevue was "
"electrocuted, and another researcher at the opposite end of the lab "
"sustained severe current burns, despite never approaching the cage."
msgstr "There has been an incident in Lab 24, 2 casualties reported, one lethal.  A rat involved in the stasis breaking project was hooked to a monitoring machine and left over night.  Upon opening the cage, Simon Bellevue was electrocuted, and another researcher at the opposite end of the lab sustained severe current burns, despite never approaching the cage."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A post-mortem on the rat involved in the electrocution incident has revealed"
" several changes to its internal anatomy centered around its connection with"
" the monitoring device, and large buildups of XE037 were detected around the"
" connection point."
msgstr "A post-mortem on the rat involved in the electrocution incident has revealed several changes to its internal anatomy centered around its connection with the monitoring device, and large buildups of XE037 were detected around the connection point."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"There is a belief several other rat subjects experienced changes overnight "
"as well.  This hypothesis was informed when an inventory check after the "
"incident found almost twenty rats had gone missing from their cages "
"overnight."
msgstr "There is a belief several other rat subjects experienced changes overnight as well.  This hypothesis was informed when an inventory check after the incident found almost twenty rats had gone missing from their cages overnight."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Exposure of large quantities of XE037 to various types of radiation have "
"shown promising results, stimulating activity and forming interesting "
"structural changes in the subject being tested.  Exposure to radiation on "
"living subjects scheduled."
msgstr "Exposure of large quantities of XE037 to various types of radiation have shown promising results, stimulating activity and forming interesting structural changes in the subject being tested.  Exposure to radiation on living subjects scheduled."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Exposure to radiation of test subject T3D indicates stimulation of internal "
"XE037 deposits and a temporary lifting of the mammalian stasis condition."
msgstr "Exposure to radiation of test subject T3D indicates stimulation of internal XE037 deposits and a temporary lifting of the mammalian stasis condition."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"As in the tests of isolated XE037 samples, prolonged radiation exposure of "
"T3D has resulted in significant structural changes.  These do not appear to "
"be random.  T3D appears to be in immense pain as a result of these changes, "
"but the lack of an oral opening has rendered him unable to vocalize."
msgstr "As in the tests of isolated XE037 samples, prolonged radiation exposure of T3D has resulted in significant structural changes.  These do not appear to be random.  T3D appears to be in immense pain as a result of these changes, but the lack of an oral opening has rendered him unable to vocalize."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Subject T3D has succumbed to radiation poisoning, but not before undergoing "
"several more physiological changes the lab boys are referring to as "
"\"mutations\".  They do not appear to be truly random, and may be an attempt"
" by XE037 to adapt its host to an unknown stimulus."
msgstr "Subject T3D has succumbed to radiation poisoning, but not before undergoing several more physiological changes the lab boys are referring to as \"mutations\".  They do not appear to be truly random, and may be an attempt by XE037 to adapt its host to an unknown stimulus."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Post-mortem revivification of subject T3D occurred as expected, followed by "
"an immediate autopsy.  The internal changes were significant, with large "
"parts of the subjects internal anatomy replaced with \"organs\" of XE037 "
"with unknown properties, primarily those known to succumb earlier to the "
"effects of radiation poisoning."
msgstr "Post-mortem revivification of subject T3D occurred as expected, followed by an immediate autopsy.  The internal changes were significant, with large parts of the subjects internal anatomy replaced with \"organs\" of XE037 with unknown properties, primarily those known to succumb earlier to the effects of radiation poisoning."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Samples of XE037 from subject T3D remains extremely active.  Further "
"experimentation on induced mutation in infected individuals shows "
"significant potential.  Samples of the enhanced XE037, labeled PE012, have "
"been sent to several researchers for further study."
msgstr "Samples of XE037 from subject T3D remains extremely active.  Further experimentation on induced mutation in infected individuals shows significant potential.  Samples of the enhanced XE037, labeled PE012, have been sent to several researchers for further study."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"S37ZBE, the special investigation into the effects of XE037 on inert human "
"bodies, has made terrific discoveries.  It seems that it occasionally "
"displays a mutagenic property which manifests itself after termination of "
"the subject, resulting in a striking variety in postmortem morphology."
msgstr "S37ZBE, the special investigation into the effects of XE037 on inert human bodies, has made terrific discoveries.  It seems that it occasionally displays a mutagenic property which manifests itself after termination of the subject, resulting in a striking variety in postmortem morphology."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Incidence of post-mortem mutation seems to depend on several factors - "
"leading candidates include type and amount of damage sustained leading to "
"expiration, embedded foreign bodies at time of revivification, proximity to "
"other revived individuals, and the body mass of the subject."
msgstr "Incidence of post-mortem mutation seems to depend on several factors - leading candidates include type and amount of damage sustained leading to expiration, embedded foreign bodies at time of revivification, proximity to other revived individuals, and the body mass of the subject."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Time also appears to play a large role in post-mortem revivification, as "
"does sustained trauma insufficient to permanently disable the subject.  "
"Sufficient amounts of trauma in short periods of time lead to deactivation "
"of XE037, but smaller amounts over several days cause it to expand."
msgstr "Time also appears to play a large role in post-mortem revivification, as does sustained trauma insufficient to permanently disable the subject.  Sufficient amounts of trauma in short periods of time lead to deactivation of XE037, but smaller amounts over several days cause it to expand."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"S37ZBE may be put on indefinite hold shortly.  Postmortem morphological "
"changes have reached extreme levels; this morning one subject nearly doubled"
" in size, acquiring enough strength to reduce a concrete wall to rubble.  It"
" required a 6 man team, heavily armed, to re-terminate the subject."
msgstr "S37ZBE may be put on indefinite hold shortly.  Postmortem morphological changes have reached extreme levels; this morning one subject nearly doubled in size, acquiring enough strength to reduce a concrete wall to rubble.  It required a 6 man team, heavily armed, to re-terminate the subject."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Jakobson insists that S37ZBE must continue, despite the extreme security and"
" safety risks.  Nearly half of our security forces have been redirected to "
"the S37ZBE project, simply to deal with the occasional escape of a subject."
msgstr "Jakobson insists that S37ZBE must continue, despite the extreme security and safety risks.  Nearly half of our security forces have been redirected to the S37ZBE project, simply to deal with the occasional escape of a subject."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Jakobson was killed today by one of S37ZBE's subjects; ironic considering "
"how hard he fought to keep the project active.  Alarmingly, his corpse "
"revivified immediately.  This suggests that XE037 may have contaminated the "
"lab at large."
msgstr "Jakobson was killed today by one of S37ZBE's subjects; ironic considering how hard he fought to keep the project active.  Alarmingly, his corpse revivified immediately.  This suggests that XE037 may have contaminated the lab at large."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Termination of a subject which was never a part of S37ZBE has confirmed my "
"fears.  XE037 has contaminated most, if not all of the laboratory, most "
"likely via the water supply.  Research has started immediately into a "
"process to destroy XE037 within the human body."
msgstr "Termination of a subject which was never a part of S37ZBE has confirmed my fears.  XE037 has contaminated most, if not all of the laboratory, most likely via the water supply.  Research has started immediately into a process to destroy XE037 within the human body."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Despite a wide variety of treatments, we have been completely unsuccessful "
"in removing XE037 from human subjects.  Every individual displayed "
"revivification post termination.  Interestingly, XE037 seems to be "
"completely inert prior to termination."
msgstr "Despite a wide variety of treatments, we have been completely unsuccessful in removing XE037 from human subjects.  Every individual displayed revivification post termination.  Interestingly, XE037 seems to be completely inert prior to termination."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"We have finally found success in S37BEP, our emergency investigation into "
"the destruction of XE037 in living subjects.  8 of 10 of the subjects showed"
" no revivification, despite confirmed dosages of XE037."
msgstr "We have finally found success in S37BEP, our emergency investigation into the destruction of XE037 in living subjects.  8 of 10 of the subjects showed no revivification, despite confirmed dosages of XE037."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"PE062, our \"cure\" for XE037 contamination, has neared perfection.  Sadly, "
"the production of PE062 is a costly and time-consuming process.  What is "
"more, the substance shows no effect on postmortem subjects whatsoever; a "
"substance which renders XE037 inert after it has activated would be "
"immensely useful in the case of an outbreak."
msgstr "PE062, our \"cure\" for XE037 contamination, has neared perfection.  Sadly, the production of PE062 is a costly and time-consuming process.  What is more, the substance shows no effect on postmortem subjects whatsoever; a substance which renders XE037 inert after it has activated would be immensely useful in the case of an outbreak."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An alarming discovery has been made.  A colony of XE037 has formed nearly a "
"half mile from the laboratory.  It is unclear how it escaped; it is quite "
"possible that it is in the ground water now."
msgstr "An alarming discovery has been made.  A colony of XE037 has formed nearly a half mile from the laboratory.  It is unclear how it escaped; it is quite possible that it is in the ground water now."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An emergency meeting was held today to discuss the possible implications of "
"widespread XE037 contamination.  It was agreed that neutralization must be "
"instated immediately to prevent a catastrophic event."
msgstr "An emergency meeting was held today to discuss the possible implications of widespread XE037 contamination.  It was agreed that neutralization must be instated immediately to prevent a catastrophic event."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"It has begun.  The XE037 contamination has spread for miles, and those who "
"have since deceased have revivified.  It is my fear that extremely large "
"populations will be decimated by this pandemic.  We must find a way to "
"remove XE037 from revivified bodies."
msgstr "It has begun.  The XE037 contamination has spread for miles, and those who have since deceased have revivified.  It is my fear that extremely large populations will be decimated by this pandemic.  We must find a way to remove XE037 from revivified bodies."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"We have even more distressing news than the widespread XE037 contamination, "
"there are reports of the XE037 mutating into various new variants.  See data"
" files on XE037a - XE037f.  Research on the effects of these variants is "
"ongoing.  We do know that XE037d shows signs of PE062 immunity, and XE037b "
"can revive various breeds of canines.  However, revival is not as guaranteed"
" as standard XE037 humanoid infection.  Canine body size seems to influence "
"the chances.  See experiment tXE037b_c."
msgstr "We have even more distressing news than the widespread XE037 contamination, there are reports of the XE037 mutating into various new variants.  See data files on XE037a - XE037f.  Research on the effects of these variants is ongoing.  We do know that XE037d shows signs of PE062 immunity, and XE037b can revive various breeds of canines.  However, revival is not as guaranteed as standard XE037 humanoid infection.  Canine body size seems to influence the chances.  See experiment tXE037b_c."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Today we found our solution, quite by accident.  It was found that XE037 is "
"completely removed from a revivified body following a series of extremely-"
"high energy 4th dimensional transpositions.  Unfortunately, this invariably "
"allows subplane life forms to pass into the prime plan.  The cure is worse "
"than the disease."
msgstr "Today we found our solution, quite by accident.  It was found that XE037 is completely removed from a revivified body following a series of extremely-high energy 4th dimensional transpositions.  Unfortunately, this invariably allows subplane life forms to pass into the prime plan.  The cure is worse than the disease."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"XE037 revivification has reached critical levels, which are rapidly "
"overwhelming the available military and regional police assets' ability to "
"stop.  Every team in the field has encountered hostile specimens, and "
"several are no longer responding to communications.  Dr. Savage has proposed"
" a strategic redeployment to the underground complex known as the VAULT, and"
" continuing production of PE062 there."
msgstr "XE037 revivification has reached critical levels, which are rapidly overwhelming the available military and regional police assets' ability to stop.  Every team in the field has encountered hostile specimens, and several are no longer responding to communications.  Dr. Savage has proposed a strategic redeployment to the underground complex known as the VAULT, and continuing production of PE062 there."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is an advertisement for the Diet Devil brand Metabolic Exchange CBM.  "
"It shows a picture of a tiny obese devil sitting on a woman's shoulder.  The"
" woman stares intently at a gigantic wedding cake covered with bacon and "
"candy bars.  The caption reads: \"Burn calories!  Burn!\""
msgstr "This is an advertisement for the Diet Devil brand Metabolic Exchange CBM.  It shows a picture of a tiny obese devil sitting on a woman's shoulder.  The woman stares intently at a gigantic wedding cake covered with bacon and candy bars.  The caption reads: \"Burn calories!  Burn!\""

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is an advertisement for the Diet Devil brand Internal Furnace CBM.  It "
"shows a picture of a tiny obese devil sitting on a man's shoulder.  The man "
"is about to bite into a frosting-covered baby.  The caption reads: \"Eat "
"What You Want!  How You Want!  Who You Want!\""
msgstr "This is an advertisement for the Diet Devil brand Internal Furnace CBM.  It shows a picture of a tiny obese devil sitting on a man's shoulder.  The man is about to bite into a frosting-covered baby.  The caption reads: \"Eat What You Want!  How You Want!  Who You Want!\""

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
