msgstr " ...What do you know about surviving in the Wilderness?  If you can't make a snare you don't know TRAP!  Hunt down a copy of TRAPPERS' LIFE and learn about wildlife!...  And how to kill it.  Classic BEAR TRAP returns in this issue!"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"HUNTING GOODS!  Food prices getting you down?  Why not get a crossbow or "
"compound bow and Hunt Your Own!?  Our arrows and bolts are completely "
"reusable, so why not hunt animals like Mother Nature intended?"
msgstr "HUNTING GOODS!  Food prices getting you down?  Why not get a crossbow or compound bow and Hunt Your Own!?  Our arrows and bolts are completely reusable, so why not hunt animals like Mother Nature intended?"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"BEWARE UNDEAD PROPAGANDA: Stories about the dead \"rising\" may abet the "
"enemy, a general said today.  \"These stories have been tracked to communist"
" sources tied in with the presumably Chinese invasion.\""
msgstr "BEWARE UNDEAD PROPAGANDA: Stories about the dead \"rising\" may abet the enemy, a general said today.  \"These stories have been tracked to communist sources tied in with the presumably Chinese invasion.\""

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"GENERAL SAYS AVOID BUNKERS: Do not attempt to flee to your nearest military "
"bunker!  Understaffed bunkers are defended by turrets, which shoot those "
"without proper registration.  Please seek military personnel if you need "
"access."
msgstr "GENERAL SAYS AVOID BUNKERS: Do not attempt to flee to your nearest military bunker!  Understaffed bunkers are defended by turrets, which shoot those without proper registration.  Please seek military personnel if you need access."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"RIOTS CAUSED BY \"NEW DRUG\": Rumors of riots were quelled today.  \"These "
"are isolated incidents\" said a local police chief.  \"The violence is "
"random and senseless, our current theory is a street drug gone terribly "
"wrong\""
msgstr "RIOTS CAUSED BY \"NEW DRUG\": Rumors of riots were quelled today.  \"These are isolated incidents\" said a local police chief.  \"The violence is random and senseless, our current theory is a street drug gone terribly wrong\""

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"ZOMBIE DRUG: TRUTH OR FICTION?  A blogger suggests recent riots are a "
"chemical attack by China.  \"They are jealous of our cybernetic superiority,"
" they teamed up with Haiti to put hoodoo drugs in the water making people "
"zombies.\""
msgstr "ZOMBIE DRUG: TRUTH OR FICTION?  A blogger suggests recent riots are a chemical attack by China.  \"They are jealous of our cybernetic superiority, they teamed up with Haiti to put hoodoo drugs in the water making people zombies.\""

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"PICKLED MEAT IN A JAR!  Just like your grandma used to make!  It will last "
"for months or longer, and when you've eaten it, you can refill and seal the "
"jar!  Stock your emergency supply TODAY!"
msgstr "PICKLED MEAT IN A JAR!  Just like your grandma used to make!  It will last for months or longer, and when you've eaten it, you can refill and seal the jar!  Stock your emergency supply TODAY!"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"BAGS, BAGS, BAGS!  They're very useful things!  If we didn't have BAGS, "
"what-would-we-use...  to PUT a lot of things in!?  (Ad by the \"Play "
"SchoolClothing Co.\")"
msgstr "BAGS, BAGS, BAGS!  They're very useful things!  If we didn't have BAGS, what-would-we-use...  to PUT a lot of things in!?  (Ad by the \"Play SchoolClothing Co.\")"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"FEELING BLUE?  Try \"Greens\" for Magazines!  Your local Supermarket!  "
"Nothing cheers you up like a good magazine...  Unless it's JUNK FOOD!  Or "
"why not buy an MP3 PLAYER or a GAME CONSOLE?  Chase those Blues away at "
"GREENS Supermarket"
msgstr "FEELING BLUE?  Try \"Greens\" for Magazines!  Your local Supermarket!  Nothing cheers you up like a good magazine...  Unless it's JUNK FOOD!  Or why not buy an MP3 PLAYER or a GAME CONSOLE?  Chase those Blues away at GREENS Supermarket"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"WELCOME HOME!  Your decision to join our family will lead you to become part"
" of the next generation of job creators.  With us you will already have a "
"foot in the door when it is time to rebuild the nation!"
msgstr "WELCOME HOME!  Your decision to join our family will lead you to become part of the next generation of job creators.  With us you will already have a foot in the door when it is time to rebuild the nation!"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"NEED A NEW JOB?  Now that you have secured a comfortable home, try looking "
"into one of the many promising career opportunities that have positions "
