"TECHNICIAN offer limitless growth potential!  Please contact your employment"
" adviser if you have any questions."
msgstr "NEED A NEW JOB?  Now that you have secured a comfortable home, try looking into one of the many promising career opportunities that have positions open.  Openings such as GEOLOGICAL ENGINEERING ASSISTANT or FACILITY TECHNICIAN offer limitless growth potential!  Please contact your employment adviser if you have any questions."

