msgid "Anything I can do for you?"
msgstr "Anything I can do for you?"

#: lang/json/talk_topic_from_json.py
msgid "See you later."
msgstr "See you later."

#: lang/json/talk_topic_from_json.py
msgid "This is a refugee center that we've made into a sort of trading hub."
msgstr "This is a refugee center that we've made into a sort of trading hub."

#: lang/json/talk_topic_from_json.py
msgid "So are you with the government or something?"
msgstr "So are you with the government or something?"

#: lang/json/talk_topic_from_json.py
msgid "What do you trade?"
msgstr "What do you trade?"

#: lang/json/talk_topic_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Ha ha ha, no.  Though there is Old Guard somewhere around here if you have "
"any questions relating to what the government is up to."
msgstr "Ha ha ha, no.  Though there is Old Guard somewhere around here if you have any questions relating to what the government is up to."

#: lang/json/talk_topic_from_json.py src/npctalk.cpp src/npctalk.cpp
msgid "Oh, okay."
msgstr "Oh, okay."

#: lang/json/talk_topic_from_json.py
msgid "Oh, okay.  I'll go look for him"
msgstr "Oh, okay.  I'll go look for him"

#: lang/json/talk_topic_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Anything valuable really.  If you really want to know, go ask one of the "
"actual traders.  I'm just protection."
msgstr "Anything valuable really.  If you really want to know, go ask one of the actual traders.  I'm just protection."

#: lang/json/talk_topic_from_json.py
msgid "I'll go talk to them later."
msgstr "I'll go talk to them later."

#: lang/json/talk_topic_from_json.py
msgid "Will do, thanks!"
msgstr "Will do, thanks!"

#: lang/json/talk_topic_from_json.py src/npctalk.cpp
msgid "Nope."
msgstr "Nope."

#: lang/json/talk_topic_from_json.py
msgid "That's pretty blunt!"
msgstr "That's pretty blunt!"

#: lang/json/talk_topic_from_json.py
msgid "Death is pretty blunt."
msgstr "Death is pretty blunt."

#: lang/json/talk_topic_from_json.py
msgid "So no negotiating?  No, 'If you do this quest then we'll let you in?'"
msgstr "So no negotiating?  No, 'If you do this quest then we'll let you in?'"

#: lang/json/talk_topic_from_json.py
msgid "I don't like your attitude."
msgstr "I don't like your attitude."

#: lang/json/talk_topic_from_json.py
msgid "Well alright then."
msgstr "Well alright then."

#: lang/json/talk_topic_from_json.py
msgid "Then leave, you have two feet."
msgstr "Then leave, you have two feet."

#: lang/json/talk_topic_from_json.py
msgid "I think I'd rather rearrange your face instead!"
msgstr "I think I'd rather rearrange your face instead!"

#: lang/json/talk_topic_from_json.py
msgid "I will."
msgstr "I will."

#: lang/json/talk_topic_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Uh, not really.  Go talk to a merchant if you have anything to sell.  "
"Otherwise the Old Guard liaison might have something, if you can find him."
msgstr "Uh, not really.  Go talk to a merchant if you have anything to sell.  Otherwise the Old Guard liaison might have something, if you can find him."

#: lang/json/talk_topic_from_json.py
msgid "Alright then."
msgstr "Alright then."

#: lang/json/talk_topic_from_json.py
msgid "Old Guard huh, I'll go talk to him!"
msgstr "Old Guard huh, I'll go talk to him!"

#: lang/json/talk_topic_from_json.py
msgid "Who are the Old Guard?"
msgstr "Who are the Old Guard?"

#: lang/json/talk_topic_from_json.py
msgid ""
"That's just our nickname for them.  They're what's left of the federal "
"government.  Don't know how legitimate they are but they are named after "
"some military unit that once protected the president.  Their liaison is "
"usually hanging around here somewhere."
msgstr "That's just our nickname for them.  They're what's left of the federal government.  Don't know how legitimate they are but they are named after some military unit that once protected the president.  Their liaison is usually hanging around here somewhere."

#: lang/json/talk_topic_from_json.py
msgid "Whatever, I had another question."
msgstr "Whatever, I had another question."

#: lang/json/talk_topic_from_json.py
msgid "Okay, I'll go look for him then."
msgstr "Okay, I'll go look for him then."

#: lang/json/talk_topic_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Stay safe out there.  Hate to have to kill you after you've already died."
msgstr "Stay safe out there.  Hate to have to kill you after you've already died."

#: lang/json/talk_topic_from_json.py
msgid "Hello."
msgstr "Hello."

#: lang/json/talk_topic_from_json.py
msgid "I am actually new."
msgstr "I am actually new."

#: lang/json/talk_topic_from_json.py
msgid "Are there any rules I should follow while inside?"
msgstr "Are there any rules I should follow while inside?"

#: lang/json/talk_topic_from_json.py
msgid "So who is everyone around here?"
msgstr "So who is everyone around here?"

#: lang/json/talk_topic_from_json.py
msgid "Lets trade!"
msgstr "Lets trade!"

#: lang/json/talk_topic_from_json.py
msgid "Is there anything I can do to help?"
msgstr "Is there anything I can do to help?"

#: lang/json/talk_topic_from_json.py
msgid "Thanks!  I will be on my way."
msgstr "Thanks!  I will be on my way."

#: lang/json/talk_topic_from_json.py
msgid "Yes of course.  Just don't bring any trouble and it's all fine by me."
msgstr "Yes of course.  Just don't bring any trouble and it's all fine by me."

#: lang/json/talk_topic_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Well mostly no.  Just don't go around robbing others and starting fights and"
" you will be all set.  Also, don't go into the basement.  Outsiders are not "
"allowed in there."
msgstr "Well mostly no.  Just don't go around robbing others and starting fights and you will be all set.  Also, don't go into the basement.  Outsiders are not allowed in there."

#: lang/json/talk_topic_from_json.py
msgid "Ok, thanks."
msgstr "Ok, thanks."

#: lang/json/talk_topic_from_json.py
msgid "So uhhh, why not?"
msgstr "So uhhh, why not?"

#: lang/json/talk_topic_from_json.py
msgid ""
"In short, we had a problem when a sick refugee died and turned into a "
"zombie.  We had to expel the refugees and most of our surviving group now "
"stays to the basement to prevent it from happening again.  Unless you really"
" prove your worth I don't foresee any exceptions to that rule."
msgstr "In short, we had a problem when a sick refugee died and turned into a zombie.  We had to expel the refugees and most of our surviving group now stays to the basement to prevent it from happening again.  Unless you really prove your worth I don't foresee any exceptions to that rule."

#: lang/json/talk_topic_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Most are scavengers like you.  They now make a living by looting the cities "
"in search for anything useful: food, weapons, tools, gasoline.  In exchange "
"for their findings we offer them a temporary place to rest and the services "
"of our shop.  I bet some of them would be willing to organize resource runs "
"with you if you ask."
msgstr "Most are scavengers like you.  They now make a living by looting the cities in search for anything useful: food, weapons, tools, gasoline.  In exchange for their findings we offer them a temporary place to rest and the services of our shop.  I bet some of them would be willing to organize resource runs with you if you ask."

#: lang/json/talk_topic_from_json.py
msgid "Thanks for the heads-up."
msgstr "Thanks for the heads-up."

#: lang/json/talk_topic_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You are asking the wrong person, should look for our merchant by the main "
"entrance.  Perhaps one of the scavengers is also interested."
msgstr "You are asking the wrong person, should look for our merchant by the main entrance.  Perhaps one of the scavengers is also interested."

