#, c-format
msgid ""
"Use the arrow- or keypad keys to navigate the left list.\n"
"Press [%s] to select highlighted armor for reordering.\n"
"Use   [%s] / [%s] to scroll the right list.\n"
"Press [%s] to assign special inventory letters to clothing.\n"
"Press [%s] to change the side on which item is worn.\n"
"Use   [%s] to equip an armor item from the inventory.\n"
"Press [%s] to remove selected armor from oneself.\n"
" \n"
"[Encumbrance and Warmth] explanation:\n"
"The first number is the summed encumbrance from all clothing on that bodypart.\n"
"The second number is an additional encumbrance penalty caused by wearing multiple items on one of the bodypart's four layers.\n"
"The sum of these values is the effective encumbrance value your character has for that bodypart."
msgstr "Use the arrow- or keypad keys to navigate the left list.\nPress [%s] to select highlighted armor for reordering.\nUse   [%s] / [%s] to scroll the right list.\nPress [%s] to assign special inventory letters to clothing.\nPress [%s] to change the side on which item is worn.\nUse   [%s] to equip an armor item from the inventory.\nPress [%s] to remove selected armor from oneself.\n \n[Encumbrance and Warmth] explanation:\nThe first number is the summed encumbrance from all clothing on that bodypart.\nThe second number is an additional encumbrance penalty caused by wearing multiple items on one of the bodypart's four layers.\nThe sum of these values is the effective encumbrance value your character has for that bodypart."

