msgstr "Profit: $200-$1000\nDanger: Medium\nTime: 10 hour missions\n \nRaid Roster:\n"

#: src/mission_companion.cpp
msgid ""
"Profit: $8/hour\n"
"Danger: Minimal\n"
"Time: 1 hour minimum\n"
" \n"
"Assigning one of your allies to menial labor is a safe way to teach them basic skills and build reputation with the outpost.  Don't expect much of a reward though."
msgstr "Profit: $8/hour\nDanger: Minimal\nTime: 1 hour minimum\n \nAssigning one of your allies to menial labor is a safe way to teach them basic skills and build reputation with the outpost.  Don't expect much of a reward though."

#: src/mission_companion.cpp
msgid ""
"Profit: $8/hour\n"
"Danger: Minimal\n"
"Time: 1 hour minimum\n"
" \n"
"Labor Roster:\n"
msgstr "Profit: $8/hour\nDanger: Minimal\nTime: 1 hour minimum\n \nLabor Roster:\n"

#: src/mission_companion.cpp
msgid ""
"Profit: $12/hour\n"
"Danger: Minimal\n"
"Time: 1 hour minimum\n"
" \n"
"Carpentry work requires more skill than menial labor while offering modestly improved pay.  It is unlikely that your companions will face combat but there are hazards working on makeshift buildings."
msgstr "Profit: $12/hour\nDanger: Minimal\nTime: 1 hour minimum\n \nCarpentry work requires more skill than menial labor while offering modestly improved pay.  It is unlikely that your companions will face combat but there are hazards working on makeshift buildings."

